For early season variety seed rate of 500 gm is required whereas for late and main season variety seed rate of 250 gm per acre is required.

Seed Treatment:
Before sowing dip seeds in hot water (50 for 30 min) or streptocycline@0.01 gm/Ltr for two hours. After treatment dry them in shade and then sow on bed. Blackrot mostly observed in Rabi. As a preventive measure seed treatment with mercury chloride is essential. For that dip seeds in Mercury chloride@1 gm/Ltr solution for 30 min after that dry them in shed. Crop grown in sandy soils are more prone to stem rot. To prevent it do seed treatment with Carbendazim 50%WP@3 gm/kg of seeds.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Carrot,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF  CARROT CROP?,"Seed Treatment:
Before sowing dip seeds in hot water (50 for 30 min) or streptocycline@0.01 gm/Ltr for two hours. After treatment dry them in shade and then sow on bed. Blackrot mostly observed in Rabi. As a preventive measure seed treatment with mercury chloride is essential. For that dip seeds in Mercury chloride@1 gm/Ltr solution for 30 min after that dry them in shed. Crop grown in sandy soils are more prone to stem rot. To prevent it do seed treatment with Carbendazim 50%WP@3 gm/kg of seeds.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Carrot,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NURSERY MANAGEMENT AND TRANPLANTING OF CARROT CROP?,"Before sowing apply mixture of calcium ammonium nitrate and single superphosphate @150g on the raised beds. Sow Carrot seeds on raised beds of 8 m x 1.25 m and of convenient width. After sowing cover the seed beds with FYM and mix well in the soil. After sowing immediate water sprinkler is necessary.

12-15 days after sowing germination of seed starts. When germination begins, application of calcium ammonium nitrate at fortnight to each bed is given. For good plant size application of calcium ammonium nitrate @100g is given to each bed at the interval of one month.

Seedlings are ready for transplantation in 60-70 days after sowing. Before transplanting light irrigation is given to beds so that seedlings can be easily uprooted and be turgid at transplanting time. Transplanting is mainly done in the month of mid-November end of December.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Carrot,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF NEMATODEST   IN  CARROT CROP?,"Nematodes: To control nematodes, apply neem cake@0.5ton/acre at time of sowing.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Carrot,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF SPOT  IN  CARROT CROP?,Leaf spot: If infestation is observed in field to control take spray of Mancozeb@2gm/Litre of water.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Carrot,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NECESSARY NUTRITION OF CARROT?,"NITROGEN--25kg/acre, PHOSPHORUS --12kg/acre, POTASH --30 kg/acre
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Carrot,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH OF CARROT?,Advised to the farmer do not apply more irrigation in carrot crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Carrot,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF CARROT?,"Improved varieties of carrot - PUNJAB Kert Red, PUNJAB Black Beauty, PC-34 and PC-161.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
