Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED MANAGEMENT OF  BITTER GOURD CROP?,"Seed rate:
Use seed rate of 2.0 kg per acre. 
 
Seed treatment:
Before sowing, seeds are soaked in 25-50 ppm Gibberelic acid and 25 ppm boron for 24 hours. 

","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF  BITTER GOURD CROP?,"Seed Treatment:
Before sowing, seeds are soaked in 25-50 ppm Gibberelic acid and 25 ppm boron for 24 hours.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED PRODUCTION OF  BITTER GOURD CROP?,"Seed production:
Rouging should be done three times i.e. first at vegetative phase, second at flowering stage and third at the time of fruiting stage. Keep isolation distance of 1000m from other varieties of bitter gourd. Remove diseased plants from the field. Place one honey bee colony for the production of good seed yield. For seed production, the fruits are harvested when the fruit turns dark yellow to orange in color. After harvesting seeds are taken out form pulp, then they are cleaned and are shade dried.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF POWDERY MILDEW   IN  BITTER GOURD CROP?,Powdery mildew: The symptoms are appearance of white powdery spots on upper surface of leaves which causes leaf withering.Spraying of Carbendazim@3gm /ltr is done to control the powdery mildew.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DOWNY MILDEW  IN  BITTER GOURD CROP?,"Downy mildew: If infestation is observed spraying of Mancozeb or Chlorothalonil@2gm/ltr is done twice at the interval of 10-12 days.

","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF 
APHIDS  IN  BITTER GOURD CROP?","Aphids: They suck the sap from the leaves resulting in yellowing and drooping of leaves.
 
Spraying of imidachloprid@0.5ml/ltr is done to control the aphids.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MITES LEAF SPOT  IN  BITTER GOURD CROP?,"Mites: Thrips results in curling of leaves, leaves become cup shaped or curved upward.
 
Spraying of Dicofol 18.5% SC@2.5ml/ltr water is done to control mites.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BEETLES  IN  BITTER GOURD CROP?,"Beetles: The symptoms are damage to flowers, leaves and stems.
 Spraying of Malathion 50EC@1ml/ltr is done to control beetles. 
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF SPOT AND BLIGHT IN BITTER GOURD?,Leaf spot and Blight: If infestation of blight is observed to control take spray of Mancozeb or Copper oxychloride @300gm/150 Ltr along with 20 ml sticker.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CERCOSPORA LEAF SPOT IN BITTER GOURD?,Apply 2 g / liter of Mancosep in the bitter gourd.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGICIDE IN BITTER GOURD?,Spraying with Bavistein 30 gm + 00:52:34 (Mono potassium phosphate) 60 gm/15 liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGUS ATTACK IN BITTER GOURD?,30 grams/ 15 liters of clean Karlya water and spray it.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF SUCKING PEST IN BITTER GOURD?,Thymithocozom (Actra) 5 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEFRUIT FLIES MANAGEMENT IN BITTER GOURD?,(5k wet fish food + 1 ml diclorvas) apply.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEYELLOWING LEAVES OF BITTER GOURD?,Microla 30 ml + Ridomil Gold 30 g / 15 liters of water by spraying.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEGOOD QUALITY AND YIELD OF BITTER GOURD?,Spray 1 kg NPK 13:0:45 mixed with 100 liters of water for better fruit and good quality from bitter gourd crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER GROWTH OF BITTER GOURD?,Micronutrient 300 ml +humic acid 300 ml /acre should be given through drip.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NECESSARY NUTRITION OF BITTER GOURD?,"NITROGEN--13kg/acre, PHOSPHORUS --20kg/acre, POTASH --20 kg/acre
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER REQUIREMENT IN BITTER GOURD?,"UREA--30kg/acre, SSP--125kg/acre,MURIATE OF POTASH--35 kg/acre
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
