","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com,  Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEMON?,"Citrus is an important fruit crop. Lemon is one of the important category of citrus. It is mainly known for its pulp and juice throughout the world. Different citrus fruits are used throughout the world as food or juice. In central India, Nagpur santra is grown on a large scale. Mandarin Production states are Assam, Dibrugarh and Brahmaputra valley. In India Citrus cultivation is done on an area of about 923 thousand hectare with annual production of 8608 thousand metric tons. In Punjab citrus is grown on 39.20 hectares of land.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com,  Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF  LEMON CROP?,The best season for planting is July-August.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com,  Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE TEMPARARTURE OF LEMON CROPS?,"The suitable temparature: Sowing Temparature- 20-25 degree, 
Normal Temperature- 20-25 degree,Harvesting Temperature- 25-30 degree, Rainfall- 75-200cm
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com,  Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
