Oilseeds,Sunflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUNFLOWER?,"Sunflower, the name ""Helianthus"" is derived from eliosmeaning unand nthusmeaning lower It called as sunflower as it follow the sun, always turning toward its direct rays. It is important oilseed crop of country. Sunflower oil is most popular because of its light color, bland flavour, high smoke point and high level of linoleic acid which is good for heart patient. Sunflower seed contains about 4853 percent edible oil.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Oilseeds,Sunflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF  SUNFLOWER CROP?,"To obtain good yield, complete sowing of sunflower by January end. In case of delay in sowing, when it is to be done in February, use transplanting method as direct sowing cause reduction in yield also delay sowing causes high pest and disease incidence.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Oilseeds,Sunflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE TEMPARARTURE OF SUNFLOWER CROPS?,"The suitable temparature: Sowing Temparature- 20-25 degree, 
Normal Temperature- 20-25 degree,Harvesting Temperature- 35-37 degree, Rainfall- 500-700mm
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Oilseeds,Sunflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TEMPARARTURE OF SUNFLOWER CROPS?,Sowing Temparature- 20-25 degree,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Oilseeds,Sunflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NORMAL TEMPARARTURE OF SUNFLOWER CROPS?,Normal Temperature- 20-25 degree,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
