Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Lentil,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LENTIL  VARIETIEY   DPL 62?,DPL 62 : Ready to harvest in 130-140 days. Gives average yield of 6-8 qtl/acre.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
