Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BENGAL GRAM  VARIETIEY   C 104 ?,"C 104: Kabuli gram varieties, Suitable for Punjab and Uttar Pradesh. Gives average yield of 6-8 qtl/acre.
