Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED MANAGEMENT OF  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Seed rate:
For good yield use seed rate of 6 kg per acre. 

Seed Treatment:
Select healthy seeds and bold seeds for sowing. Treat seeds with Carbendazim or Thiram@2gm per Kg of seeds. After chemical treatment, treat seed with Trichoderma viride@4gm/kg of seeds or Pseudomonas Fluorescens@10gm/Kg of seeds","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Seed treatment:
Before sowing treat seeds with Captan or Thiram or Mancozeb or Carbendazim@2.5gm per kg of seeds. After then dry them in shades. After chemical treatment treat seed with Rhizobium@2gm/kg of seeds.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGICIDE NAME  OF  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Fungicide/Insecticide name Quantity (Dosage per Kg seed)
Carbendazim 2gm
Thiram 3gm
 

","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLISTER BEETLES  IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Blister beetles: Also known as flower beetles, they feed on flower and thus reduces pod numbers. Adults are black beetles with bright red coloration on the forewings.To control it, spraying Deltamethrin 2.8EC @ 200ml or Indoxacarb 14.5SC @ 200ml per acre using 100-125 litres of water per acre. Take spray in evening hours and if necessary repeat the spray after 10 days.
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF POD BORER  IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Pod Borer: This is the most serious pest and causes damage up to 75% reduction in yield. It feed on leaves causes skeletonization of leaves also feeds on flower and green pods. On pods they make circular holes and feed on grains.Install Pheromone traps for Helicoverpa armigera @ 12/ha. In case of low infestation, handpicked grown up larvae. At early stage use HNPV or Neem extract @ 50gm/Litre of water. Use of chemicals are necessary after ETL level. (ETL: 2 early instar larvae/plant or 5-8 eggs/plant).If incidence is observed, spray crop with Indoxacarb 14.5SC @ 200ml or Spinosad 45SC @ 60ml/100-125litres of water per acre using manually operated knapsack sprayer. Take spray in evening hour.days.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CERCOSPORA LEAF SPOT)  IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Cercospora leaf spot: Greyish brown to dark spots are observed under surface of leaves. In severe condition spots are observed on petioles and stems along with leaf drop.To control this disease, use disease free seeds and before sowing treat seeds with Captan or Thiram@3gm per kg seed.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT  IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Wilt: This disease causes considerable loss in yield. It can affect at the seedling stage as well as in an advanced stage of plant growth. Initially affected plant show dropping of petioles and gives dull green color. Afterwards all leaves turn yellow and become straw colored.Grow resistant varieties. In primary stage of wilt, to control mix 1 kg of Trichoderma in 200 kg well decomposed cow dung and keep it for 3 days, then apply it in wilt affected area. If wilt is observed in fields, spray 300 ml Propiconazol with 200 Litre of water per acre. 
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CANKERS  IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Cankers: It causes due to various fungus. Cankers are developed on stem and twigs. It causes breaking of plants at affected place.Follow suitable crop rotation. In severe conditions, spray crop with Mancozeb 75WP @ 2gm per Litre of water.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF STERILITY MOSAIC  IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Sterility Mosaic: It is caused due to eriophyid mite. Due to infection of this disease, either no flowering or little flowering is observed. Leaves are of pale color. Plant gives bushy appearance.
Grow resistant variety. For mite control Spray Fenazaquin 10% EC @ 300 ml/acre with 200 Ltr water.

","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PHYTOPHTHORA STEM BLIGHT  IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,"Phytophthora stem blight: If it occurred at seedling stage, young seedling dies after emergence. Brown or black necrotic lesions are observed on stem. On leaflet, circular or irregular lesions are form and whole foliage becomes blighted.If Infestation Phytophthora blight observed, to control spray with Metalaxyl 8%+Mancozeb 64% @ 2gm/Ltr of water.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITE GRUB IN  PIGEON PEA CROP?,Thimet 4 kg/ acre should be used to remove white grub.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWER DROP CONTROL IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,Spraying 00:52:34 60 g Calcibor in 30 g / 15 liters of water to reduce flowering and pod filling of tur crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MORE FLOWERING IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,To increase the number of flowers in the tur crop - boomflower (nitrobenzene 20%) should be sprayed with 30 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,Proclaim 5 gm + Saaf 30 gm / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH  SPRAY FOR PIGEON PEA CROP?,12 :61 :00 (Mono Ammonium Phosphate) 3000 g + Microlla 1000 ml + Trichoderma viridi 400 g /200 liter of water should be sprayed for 1 acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF TERMITE IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,Thymate should be applied at 2 kg per acre for termite control in Tur crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF SUCKING PEST IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,Spray Regent 20 ml /15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF EATING CATEPILLER IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,Chlorpyrifos 30 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DRENCHING IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,Radomil Gold 45 gm + humic acid 30 ml/15 liters of water should be mixed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FLOWERING ISSUE IN PIGEON PEA CROP?,2:61:00 - 80 gm along with Mikrolla - 30 ml in 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
