","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RICEBEAN  VARIETIEY   BRS 1?,"BRS 1: High yielding variety, developed by NBPGR, Bhowali. It is Suitable for hilly region. This variety seeds are having black color. It give average yield of 7 qtl/acre.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED MANAGEMENT OF  RICEBEAN CROP?,"Seed rate:
For good yield, use seed rate of 10-12 kg per acre.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF  RICEBEAN CROP?,"Seed treatment:
Before sowing treat seeds with Captan or Thiram or Mancozeb or Carbendazim@2.5gm per kg of seeds. After then dry them in shades. After chemical treatment treat seed with Rhizobium@2gm/kg of seeds.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF STEM ROTTEN  IN  RICEBEAN CROP?,"Leaf stem rotten: The disease damages the stem and as a result there is low seed yield and its quality also decreases.
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF YELLOW LEAVES  IN  RICEBEAN CROP?,Yellow leaves: The disease appears firstly as a red spot and then gradually it turns into reddish brown and then yellow. It will decrease the leaves yield.Remove the infected portion as early as possible to treat this disease.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLISTER BEETLE  IN  RICEBEAN CROP?,"Blister beetle: The beetle damages the flower and blocks the pod formation.
Spraying of deltamethrin 2.8 EC @200ml or indoxacarb 14.5 SC @200ml or acephate 75 SP @800g/acre in 80-100 ltr of water is given to treat blister beetle pest.","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF SMALL LARVA (HAIRY CATERPILLAR)  IN  RICEBEAN CROP?,"Small larva (hairy caterpillar): The caterpillar damages the leaves and green stems by feeding themselves.Spraying of Ekalux 25 EC@200ml in 80-100 ltr of water or Nuvan 100 @200ml in 80-100l of water is used to treat hairy caterpillar.
","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF POD BORER (LEPIDOPTERA)  IN  RICEBEAN CROP?,Pod borer (Lepidoptera): It damages the pod by eating the young seeds or by moving on one pod to another.Spraying of indoxacarb 14.5 SC @ 200 ml or acephate 75 SP @ 800 g or spinosad 45 SC @ 60 ml in 100 litres of water per acre is given to treat pod borer.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LIZARD  IN  RICEBEAN CROP?,"Lizard: It causes cuts to the leaves and bunds of the plant.Spraying of pesticide around the plant will help to remain lizard away from the plants. Spraying must be done in evening.

","[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Pulses,RiceBean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LARVA  IN  RICEBEAN CROP?,Larva: It destroys the leaves and pod of the plant by feeding themselves on the leaves and bore in the pod.,"[Reference: www.apnikheti.com, Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Department of Agriculture, Indian Agricultural Research Institute New Delhi,
Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
