Indian Institute of Wheat and Barley Research, Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare]"
Cereals,Oats,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME Oats VARIETIEY  ALGERIAN?,"Algerian: This variety is suitable for irrigated areas. Average plant height is 100-120 cm. It has slow early growth and light green color leaves.

