Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHEAT VARIETIES FEATURE OF POSHAN (HI-8663) (2008)?,"Features are- Growth habit semi erect, white & glabrous, elliptical & medium dense earhead, white auricle, semi dwarf plant with waxy bloom, bold amber & hard grain, Non-lodging & non-shattering.",[Reference: PoP (package of practices)]
