Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHEAT VARIETIES FEATURE OF GW-496 (1990)?,"Features are- Early growth habit Semi erect, good tillering capacity, colour of stem & foliage deep green with bloom & pale grain hairy auricle.",[Reference: PoP (package of practices)]
