Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RICE VARIETIES FEATURE OF PHULE SAMRUDDH (2007)?,"Features are- Semi dwarf & non-lodging, midlate group, long slender grain, small notch at back of seed.",[Reference: PoP (package of practices)]
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RICE VARIETIES FEATURE OF RATNAGIRI 711 (1978)?,"Features are- Semi dwarf stature, long slender grain, suitable for light & medium type soils, suitable for both kharif and hot weather conditions, can be grown under dibbled and transplanted conditions",[Reference: PoP (package of practices)]
