Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHICH BANK ACCOUNT IS REQUIRED FOR PRADHAN MANTRI KISAN SAMMAN NIDHI SCHEME?,Any of your Bank account linked with Aadhar card is required for obtaining benefits of the scheme.,"[Reference:https://www.tesz.in/ask/which-bank-account-is-required-for-pradhan-mantri-kisan-samman-nidhi-scheme-nc1153](Varun
Answered on July 16,2019)"
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR PRADHAN MANTRI KISAN SAMMAN NIDHI SCHEME, CAN STATES/UTS PROVIDE CERTIFIED LISTS OF BENEFICIARIES ON THE PM KISAN PORTAL IN PHASES OR IN BATCHES AS AND WHEN THEY ARE FINALIZED?","Yes, States/UTs can provide list of eligible beneficiaries as and when they are finalized based on the eligibility criteria in batches/phrases. The benefits will be released on regular basis based on the approved list provided by the States/UTs.","[Reference:https://www.tesz.in/ask/for-pradhan-mantri-kisan-samman-nidhi-scheme-can-states-uts-provide-certified-lists-of-beneficiaries-on-the-pm-kisan-portal-in-phases-or-in-batches-as-and-when-they-are-finalized-nc808](Indu:
Answered on February 23,2019)"
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR PRADHAN MANTRI KISAN SAMMAN NIDHI SCHEME, ARE AADHAAR DETAILS MANDATORY?","Adhaar card is important: Since this is a beneficiary oriented scheme, in terms of extant guidelines, the Aadhaar number of the beneficiary has to be mandatorily provided. In case Adhaar number is not available, then in such case the application has to provide the Aadhar enrolment number to avail of the benefit under the scheme. However, only for transfer of first installment relaxation has been given for transfer of benefit to beneficiaries on basis of alternate documents for identification. However subsequent installments will be transferred only where States/UTs where Aadhar number is not available.

In cases of beneficiaries in States of Assam, Meghalaya, J&K where Aadhaar number has not been issued to most of the citizens, Aadhaar number shall be collected for those beneficiaries where it is available and for others alternate prescribed documents can be collected for identity verification purposes by the States/UT Governments","[Reference:https://www.tesz.in/ask/for-pradhan-mantri-kisan-samman-nidhi-scheme-are-aadhaar-details-mandatory-nc807](
Rashmi:
Answered on February 22,2019)"
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHETHER IT IS COMPULSORY FOR BENEFICIARIES TO GIVE THEIR BANK ACCOUNT DETAILS?,"Yes, the beneficiaries are required to provide their bank account details along with their Aadhaar number so as to credit the financial benefit under the scheme directly into their bank accounts. No benefit can be given if bank account details have not been provided.
",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201665.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILL BE MONETARY BENEFIT UNDER THE SCHEME BE DIRECTLY CREDITED INTO BENEFICIARY ACCOUNTS?,Yes. The financial benefit under the scheme shall be directly credited into bank accounts of beneficiaries.,[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201666.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHETHER GIVING AADHAAR DETAILS IS MANDATORY FOR AVAILING BENEFIT UNDER THE SCHEME?,"Aadhaar number was optional and not mandatory for release of 1st installment pertaining to the period 01 .12.2018 to 31.03.2019, whereas only possession of Aadhaar number was made mandatory for release of 2nd installment pertaining to the period 01 .04.2019 to 31 .07.2019. Further, Aadhaar seeding of beneficiaries' data was made mandatory for release of 3'o installment pertaining to the period 01.08.2019, and for subsequent installments onwards. Recently, however, Government has relaxed the mandatory requirement of Aadhaar seeding of beneficiaries' data upto 30.1 1.20'19. This mandatory requirement of Aadhaar seeding of the beneficiaries' data would continue to applicable for release of all installments w.e.f . O1 .12.2019. However, Assam, Meghalaya and Jammu & Kashmir, where Aadhaar penetration has not been much, have been given exemption from this mandatory requirement till 31.03.2020",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201667.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHETHER FARMERS IN VILLAGES SITUATED IN URBAN AREAS ARE ELIGIBLE FOR THE BENEFIT OF THE SCHEME?,"There is no distinction between urban and rural cultivable land under the scheme. Both are covered under the scheme, provided that land situated in urban areas is under actual cultivation.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201668.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHETHER FARMERS MAY AVAIL THE BENEFIT OF THE SCHEME AGAINST AGRICULTURAL LAND BEING USED FOR NON -AGRICULTURAL PURPOSES?,No. Agricultural land being used for non-agricultural purposes will not be covered for benefit under the scheme.,[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201669.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW DOES A LANDHOLDER FARMERS' FAMILY KNOW THAT HIS / HER NAME IS INCLUDED IN THE LIST OF BENEFICIARIES?,"The beneficiary lists would be displayed at Panchayats to ensure greater transparency and information. Further, States/UTs would notify the sanction of benefit to the beneficiary through system generated SMS. He / she can also ascertain his status through the Farmers Corner in the PM-Kisan portal.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201670.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT IS THE MANDATORY INFORMATION REQUIRED TO BE SUBMITTED ON PM-KISAN PORTAL FOR THE TRANSFER OF BENEFITS?,"The following information / documents are required to be furnished by the farmers for enrollment under PM-Kisan Scheme
(i) Name, Age, Gender and Category (SC/ST)
(ii) Aadhaar Number [except in case of farmers in the States of Assam, Meghalaya and J&K (now UTs of J&K and Laddakh), where Aadhaar number has not been issued to most of the citizens, and therefore these States have been exempted from the requirement till 31 March, 2020. ln these States / UTs, Aadhaar number shall be collected for those beneficiaries where it is available and for others alternate prescribed documents can be collected for identity verification purposes by the States/UT Governments, like Aadhaar Enrollment Number and / or any other prescribed documents for purposes of the identification such as Driving Licence, Voters' lD Card, NREGA Job Card, or any other identification such as Driving Licence, Voters' lD Card, NREGA Job Card, or any other identification documents issued by Central/State/UT Governments or their authorities, etc.) Bank Account Number and IFSC Code. Mobile number - though it is not mandatory but it is advised that when available it may be provided so that the information related to transfer of benefit can be communicated.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201671.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LS ANY PERSON / FARMER WHO IS CULTIVATING A LAND BUT IS NOT HAVING THE LAND HOLDING IN HIS / HER OWN NAME, FOR EXAMPLE TENANT FARMERS, IS ELIGIBLE TO GET BENEFIT UNDER THE SCHEME?",No. Land holding is the sole criteria to avail the benefit under the Scheme,[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201672.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MELS ANY PERSON / FARMER WHO IS NOT HAVING LAND HOLDING IN HIS / HER OWN NAME, BUT IS CULTIVATING LAND OWNED BY HIS / HER FATHER / FOREFATHERS IS ELIGIBLE TO GET BENEFIT UNDER THE SCHEME?","No. The land must be in his / her own name. lf the land ownership has been transferred in his / her name on account of succession then he / she will be eligible.
",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201673.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT IS THE DEFINITION OF 'FAMILY' UNDER THE SCHEME?,"A landholder farmer's family is defined as ""a family comprising of husband, wife and minor children who own cultivable land as per the land records of the concerned State/UT"". The existing land-ownership system will be used for identification of beneficiaries for calculation of benefit.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201674.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LS AN INCOME TAX PAYEE FARMER OR HIS / HER SPOUSE ELIGIBLE TO GET BENEFIT UNDER THE SCHEME?,"No. If any member of the family is income tax payee in last assessment ear, then the family is not eligible for benefit under the scheme.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201675.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT IS THE CUTOFF DATE FOR DETERMINATION OF ELIGIBILITY OF BENEFICIARIES UNDER THE SCHEME?,"The cut-off date for determination of eligibility of beneficiaries under the scheme is 01 .02.2019 and no changes thereafter shall be considered for eligibility of benefit under the scheme for next 5 years, except transfer of land on succession in case of death of landholder.
",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201676.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT WILL HAPPEN IF THE BENEFICIARY GIVES INCORRECT DECLARATION FOR THE IMPLEMENTATION OF THE SCHEME?,"ln case of incorrect declaration, the beneficiary shall be liable for recovery of transferred financial benefit and other penal actions as per law.
",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201677.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILL ANY INDIVIDUAL OR FARMER FAMILY OWNING MORE THAN 2 HECTARE OF CULTIVABLE LAND GET ANY BENEFIT UNDER THE SCHEME?,"Yes. The ambit of the scheme has been extended to cover all farmer families, irrespective of the size of their land holdings.
",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201678.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHETHER AN EMPLOYEE OF THE CENTRAL/STATE GOVERNMENT / PSU / AUTONOMOUS ORGANIZATION, ETC., WHO HOLDS CULTIVABLE LAND IN HIS/HER OWN NAME IN VILLAGES, IS ELIGIBLE TO GET THE BENEFIT UNDER THE SCHEME?","No. All serving or retired officers and employees of central / state Government ministries / Offices / Departments and their field units, Central or State PSEs and Attached offices / Autonomous lnstitutions under Government as well as regular employees of the Local Bodies are not eligible to get benefit under the scheme whose monthly Pension Staff / Class lV/GrouP IS D employees are eligible to get benefit under the Scheme, provided their families are otherwise eligible and not covered under other exclusion criteria.
",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201679.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW MANY TIMES WILL THE BENEFIT BE GIVEN IN A YEAR?,"Under the PM-Kisan scheme, all landholding farmers' families shall be provided the financial benefit of Rs.6000/- per annum per family payable in three equal installments of Rs.200O/- each, every four months. The period of 1't installment under the scheme is from 01 .12 2O18 to 31 03 2019, that of 2nd installment from 01 04.2019 to 31 07 .2019,3'd installment from 01 08.2019 to 30 11 2019, and so on.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201680.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHO ARE NOT ELIGIBLE TO GET BENEFITS UNDER THE SCHEME (WHAT ARE THE EXCLUSION CRITERIA UNDER THE SCHEME)?,"The following category of farmers are not eligible to get the benefits of the PM-Kisan scheme:
a) All institutional Landholders; and
(b) Farmer families in which one or more of its members belong to following categories:-
i. Former and present holders of constitutional posts
ii. Former and present ministers/ State Ministers and former/present Members of Loksabha/ Rajya sabha/ state Legislative Assemblies/ State Legislative councils, former and present mayors of Municipal corporations, former and present Chairpersons of District Panchayats.
iii. All serving or retired officers and employees of Central/ State Government ministries /Offices/Departments and its field units Central or State PSEs and Attached offices /Autonomous lnstitutions under Government as well as regular employees of the Local Bodies (Excluding Multi Tasking staff / Class
lV/Group D employees).
v. All superannuated/retired pensioners Rs.10,000/-or more (Excluding multi Tasking employees) All Persons who paid lncome Tax in last assessment year
vi. Professionals like Doctors, Engineers' Lawyers, Chartered Accountants, and Architects registered with Professional bodies and carrying out profession by undertaking practices.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201681.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT ARE THE BENEFITS OF THE SCHEME?,"Under the PM-KISAN scheme, all landholding farmers' families shall be provided the financial benefit of Rs.6000 per annum per family payable in three equal installments of Rs.2000 each, every four months.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201682.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,Pradhan Mantri KISAN Samman Nidhi Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHETHER THE BENEFITS OF THE SCHEME ARE ADMISSIBLE TO ONLY SMALL & MARGINAL FARMERS' (SMF) FAMILIES?,"No. ln the beginning when the PM-Kisan Scheme was launched on 24th February, 2019, its benefits were admissible only to Small & Marginal Farmers' (SMF) families, with combined landholding upto 2 hectare. The Scheme was later on revised w.e.f. 1 .6.2019 and extended to all farmer families irrespective of the size of their landholdings.",[Reference:https://economictimes.indiatimes.com//wealth/save/pm-kisan-samman-nidhi-benefits-to-eligibility-important-faqs-for-a-beneficiary-answered/articleshow/90201683.cms?utm_source=contentofinterest&utm_medium=text&utm_campaign=cppst]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PM KUSUM YOJANA?,"Pradhan Mantri Kisan Urja Suraksha Evam Utthaan Mahabhiyan Yojana is a scheme to subsidise farmers to install solar irrigation pumps for cultivation.Each farmer will receive a 60% subsidy to set up tube wells and pump sets.They will also get 30% of the total cost as a loan from the Government.The primary objective of the PM KUSUM Scheme is to make cutting-edge technology available to our farmers and provide sources for de-dieselised irrigation to the agricultural sector.The main objectives of this scheme are:

1.The solar pumps assist our farmers in much more effective and eco-friendly irrigation as these are capable of generating safer energy.
2.In addition, the pump sets comprise an energy power grid that generates more energy than diesel driven pumps. Farmers will be able to sell the extra power to our Government directly to enhance their income.

",[Reference:https://www.godigit.com/guides/government-schemes/pm-kusum-scheme]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PM KUSUM YOJANA ELIGIBILITY?,"The eligible categories for KUSUM Scheme are:

1.An individual farmer.
2.A group of farmers.
3.FPO or Farmer producer organisation.
4.Panchayat.
5.Co-operatives.
6.Water User Associations.",[Reference:https://www.godigit.com/guides/government-schemes/pm-kusum-scheme]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO APPLY PM KUSUM YOJANA?,"Step 1: Go to the official portal and click on the registration section.
Step 2: Fill in the registration form that appears on your screen with all the required details.
Step 3: Check the box of declaration and click on submit
Step 4: After registering, click on login for Solar Agricultural Pumpset Subsidy Scheme 2021.
Step 5: Provide all necessary information accurately in the online application form, attach all the supporting documents, and submit.",[Reference:https://www.godigit.com/guides/government-schemes/pm-kusum-scheme]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PM KUSUM YOJANA REQUIRED DOCUMENTS?,"1.Aadhar card
2.A land document including KhasraKhatauni
3.A bank account passbook
4.A declaration form
5.Mobile number
6.Passport size photo
***After a successful online application for KUSUM Scheme, farmers must deposit 10% of the total cost to set up a solar pump to the supplier sent by the department.The solar pump set will be empowered after the subsidy amount gets sanctioned, which generally takes 90 to 10 days.",[Reference:https://www.godigit.com/guides/government-schemes/pm-kusum-scheme]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHERE CAN I GET MORE INFORMATION ABOUT THE SCHEME?,"For more information, please visit https://mnre.gov.in/solar/schemes/ or call at toll free number 1800-180-3333.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IS THERE ANY SUBSIDY FOR THE INSTALLATION OF SOLARISATION OF PUMP?,"For all states except for North-eastern States, Hill States/UTs and Island UTs, subsidy of 30%, each by Central and State Governments will be provided, and the remaining 40% will be invested by the farmer for solarization of existing pumps. Subsidy in percentage mentioned above is applicable on benchmark cost or tender cost, whichever is lower. For North-eastern States, Himachal Pradesh, Uttarakhand, Jammu and Kashmir/Ladakh and Island UTs, subsidy of 50% will be provided by Central Government and at least 30% will be provided by the State Government for solarization of existing pumps. Farmer will have to invest balance 20%.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHO IS ELIGIBLE UNDER COMPONENT-A OF PM-KUSUM SCHEME?,Individual farmers/ group of farmers/ cooperatives/panchayats/ Farmer Producer Organisations (FPO)/Water User associations (WUA). Land on which the project is proposed to be installed should be within 5 km from the nearest electricity sub-station.,[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHO IS ELIGIBLE UNDER COMPONENT C OF PM-KUSUM?,"Individual farmers, water user associations and community/cluster based irrigation system will also be covered under this component.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT IS COMPONENT-C OF PM-KUSUM SCHEME?,"Under this Component, farmers can solarize their existing grid connected agriculture pumps of capacity up to 7.5 HP. Solar PV capacity up to two times of pump capacity in kW is allowed under the scheme.However, States may choose to allow lower solar PV capacity, which in no case will be less than pump capacity in HP. The farmer will be able to use the generated solar power to meet the irrigation needs and the excess solar power will be sold to DISCOMs.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IS THERE ANY SUBSIDY FOR THE INSTALLATION OF SOLAR PUMP?,"For all states except for North-eastern States, Hill States/UTs and Island UTs, subsidy of 30%, each by Central and State Governments will be provided, and the remaining 40% will be invested by the farmer for installation of solar pump. Subsidy in percentage mentioned above is applicable on benchmark cost or tender cost, whichever is lower. For North-eastern States, Himachal Pradesh, Uttarakhand, Jammu and Kashmir/Ladakh and Island UTs, subsidy of 50% will be provided by Central Government and at least 30% will be provided by the State Government for installation of solar pump. Farmer will have to invest balance 20%.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHO IS ELIGIBLE UNDER COMPONENT B OF PM-KUSUM?,"Individual farmers, Water User Associations and community/cluster based irrigation system will be covered under this component.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT IS COMPONENT-B OF PM-KUSUM SCHEME?,"Under this Component, farmers can replace their existing diesel poweredagriculture pumps with standalone solar pumpsof capacity up to 7.5 HP in off-grid areas. Pumps of capacity higher than 7.5 HP may be allowed, however, the central subsidy will be limited to the subsidy applicable for pump of 7.5 HP.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT KIND OF FINANCIAL SUPPORT IS AVAILABLE UNDER COMPONENT-A OF THE SCHEME?,"The renewable power generated will be purchased by DISCOMs at a pre-fixed levelised tariff. The duration of PPA will be 25 years from Commercial Operation Date (COD) of the project. Procurement based incentive (PBI) of 40 paisa per unit of electricity generated or Rs. 6.6 lakh per MW per annum, whichever is lower, will be provided to DISCOM for buying electricity generated for five years.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN FARMERS LEASE THEIR LAND FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF RENEWABLE ENERGY POWER PLANT UNDER COMPONENT-A?,"Yes, farmers can either install renewable power project on their land or lease the land on rent to a developer at mutually agreed terms between the parties.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT IS COMPONENT-A OF PM-KUSUM SCHEME?,"Under this component, solar or other renewable energy based power plants of capacity 500 kW to 2 MW can be installed on barren or uncultivable agriculture land mainly. Agriculture land is also permitted under this scheme provided that solar plants are installed in slit fashion (i.e. raised structure for installation of solar panels) and with adequate spacing between panel rows for ensuring that farming activity is not affected.",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Schemes,PM Kusum Yojana,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHAT ARE THE DIFFERENT KIND OF SYSTEMS SUPPORTED UNDER PM-KUSUM SCHEME?,"PM-KUSUM Scheme supports three different kind of installations, known as three components of the Scheme as given below:

1.Component-A: Setting up of decentralized ground/ stilt mounted grid connected solar or other renewable energy based power plants up to 2 MW capacity
2.Component-B: Installation of stand-alone solar agriculture pumps of capacity up to 7.5 HP
3.Component-C: Solarisation of existing grid connected agriculture pumps of capacity up to 7.5 HP",[Reference:https://pmkusum.mnre.gov.in/landing-faq.html]
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BLAST IN PADDY/BASMATI?,"Spray 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) in 200 liters of water per acre, first spray at crop emergence and second Spray at the beginning of the budding","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF CONTROL OF FALSE SMUT IN PADDY?,Adding 400 ml of Galileo Whey 18.76 SC (picoxystrobin 7% + propiconazole 12%) or 500 gm Cocide 46 DF (copper hydroxide) in 200 liters of water at the time of crop emergence. Spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT IN PADDY?,"To reduce blight in paddy, spray 1.5% potassium nitrate NPK 13:00:45 (3 kg in 200 liters of water) per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF PLANT HOPPER/ GRASSHOPPER IN PADDY/ BASMATI?,94 ml Paxalone 10 SC (Triflumizopyram) or 80 g Ocean 20 SG (Dinotefuron) or 120 g CHESS 50 WG (Pymetrogin) or 800 ml Spray Acalx 25 EC (quinalphas) or 40 ml of Confidor 17.8 SL (Imidacloprid) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BUNT/ KARNAL BUNT IN PADDY/BASMATI?,"There is no sure solution for prevention of bunt in paddy/basmati crop.To prevent its occurrence, nitrogen fertilizers should not be applied more than recommended and if the crop is in bud and after 10 days if 200 ml tilt 25 EC (Propiconazole) can be avoided to a large extent if sprayed in 200 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SHEATH BLIGHT IN PADDY/BASMATI?,150 ml Pulsar 24 SC (Thifluzamide) OR 26.8 g Epic 75 WG (Hexaconazole) OR 400 ml Galileo Whey 18.76 SC (Peoxystrobin 7%+ Propiconazole 12%) OR For prevention of stem leaf blight disease in Paddy/Basmati. 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) or 200 ml Tilt 25 EC (Propiconazole) or 200 ml Foliker 25 EC (Tabuconazole) or 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifluoxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole) 50%) or 320 ml of Luscher 37.5 SE (Flujilazole 25%+Carbendazim 12.5%) or 200 ml of Monseron 250 SC (Pencicuron) in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF STEM BORER IN PADDY?,80 ml Ecotin 5% EC (Azadirachtin) 60 ml Corajan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 20 ml FEM 480 SC (Flubendamide) or 170 g Mortar 75 SG (cartop hydrochloride) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF FUNGICIDE IN PADDY CROP?,"Before spraying the crop, check for signs of disease and nutrient deficiency, and you can call again, or show it to the nearest agribusiness office, if there is no disease, do not apply any fungicide.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY/BASMATI?,80 ml Ecotin 5% EC (Azadirachtin) 60 ml Corajan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 20 ml FEM 480 SC (Flubendamide) or 170 g Mortar 75 SG (cartop hydrochloride) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH AND CONTROL NITROGEN DEFICIENCY AFTER APPLYING THE RECOMMENDED AMOUNT OF UREA TO THE PADDY CROP?,Spray 1 kg NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre to meet crop growth and nitrogen deficiency after applying the recommended amount of urea to the paddy crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF CHEMICALS.?,You should not mix potassium nitrate (NPK-13:0:45) and insecticides or fungicides used to control pests in paddy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FALSE SMUT IN PADDY?,Spray 500 g Cocide 46 DF (copper hydroxide) or 400 ml Galileo Way 18.76 SC (Picoxystrobin + Propiconazole) in 200 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RICE EAR CUTTING CATTERPILLER IN PADDY?,Spray 600-800 ml Acalx 25 EC (Quinalfas) dissolved in 100 liters of water per acre for control of paddy stem borer.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SHEATH BLIGHT IN PADDY CROP?,200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC (Ezoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) or 200 ml Folikar/Oreus 25.9 EC (Tabuconazole) or 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin+Tabuconazole) for prevention of stem leaf blight disease in paddy. ) or spray 200 ml of Monseron 250 SC (pencicuron) in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BROWN SPOT IN PADDY/BASMATI?,"Spray 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) in 200 liters of water per acre, repeat spraying after 15 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE MINIMUM HOURS REQUIRED FOR FUNGICIDE/INSECTICIDE?,"It takes at least 6-8 hours for the insecticide to kill the insects, if it does not rain for 6-8 hours after spraying, the spray is effective to a large extent. The fungicide takes at least 6-8 hours to work. Yes, if it doesn't rain for 6-8 hours after spraying, the spray will be effective to a large extent","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE USAGE OF GRANULAR INSECTICIDES FOR CONTROL OF STEM BORER AND LEAF FOLDER IN BASMATI?,Granular insecticides in Basmati 4 kg Furterra 0.4 gr (Chlorantraniliprole) or 4 kg Vibrant 4 gr (Thiocyclam hydrogen oxalate) or 10 kg Pdan 4 g (cartop hydrochloride) or 6 kg Regent Apply either 0.3 g (fipronil) or 4 kg Drusban 10 g (chlorpyrifos) per acre to standing water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE GROWTH REGULATOR USED FOR INCREASING GRAIN YIELD IN PADDY?,"To reduce blight in paddy, spray 1% potassium nitrate NPK 13:00:45 (1 kg in 100 liters of water) per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE GAP BETWEEN TWO SPRAYS IN PADDY?,There should be a gap of at least 2-3 days between the spraying of the elements and the fungicide in the crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL LEAF BLIGHT IN PADDY?,Spray 200 g of copper oxychloride + 30 g of agrimycin dissolved in 200 liters of water for one acre to control blight disease in paddy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FERTILIZER REQUIREMENT IN PADDY?,"Amount of fertilizers in paddy crop - 90 kg urea, 27 kg DAP or 75 kg super phosphate and 20 kg MOP per acre. If DAP has been applied in rubber crop then do not apply in saffron crop please use potash only based on soil test, apply urea in three equal parts in first, third and sixth weeks, but if PR 126 and 124 If typed, complete within 5 weeks","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN PADDY?,Spray 500 g Blytox and 3 g Sutrareptocycline in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLAST OR BROWN LEAF SPOT IN PADDY CROP?,Spray 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC (Azoxystrobin + Difenconazole) or 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin + Tabuconazole) in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF FOLDER AND STEM BORER IN PADDY?,"Add 170 gm mortar (cartop hydrochloride 75 SG), 20 ml FEM (flubedamide 480 SC) in 100 liters of water and spray one acre for leaf blight on basmati. For prevention of blight and blight, spray 170 g mortar (cartop hydrochloride 75 SG) or 60 ml Corazan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 1 liter Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAIL ABOUT THE TIMELY SOWING VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,Chas (Pymetrozine 50 WG) 120 gm or 40 ml Confidor (Imidacloprid 200 SL (17.8 % w/w) or Acalx (Quinalphos 25% EC) 800 ml or 1 liter Chlorpyrifos 20 EC at 100 Dissolve in liter of water and spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF RICE-EAR CUTTING CATERPILLAR?,Spray 400 ml of Acalx 25 EC (Quinalfas) in 100 liters of water in the evening.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF GRASSHOPPER AND PLANT HOPPER IN PADDY?,120 gm Chas (Pymetrozine 50 WG) or 40 ml Confidor (Imidacloprid 200 SL (17.8 % w/w) or 800 ml Ekalux (Quinalphos 25% EC) dissolved in 100-125 liters of water per Spray for acres,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF HISPA IN PADDY?,Spray 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos or 800 ml of Acalx in 100 liters of water for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DEFICIENCY OF BORON IN PADDY CROP?,Boron deficiency in paddy Mix 100 grams of borax in 100 liters of water and spray in one acre. Spraying is recommended only when boron deficiency occurs.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF POTASSIUM NITRATE (13:00:45) AND FUNGICIDE?,Never mix fungicides and potassium nitrate (13:00:45) medicine.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF ADULTS OF STEM BORER?,"If the weevil (which is khaki in color) is present in the paddy crop, no spraying is required as it does not harm the crop and its life span is only one week and lays eggs. Canker sores develop further and can be prevented by using recommended sprays for this canker sore.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO CONTROL ADULTS OF STEM BORER AND LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY?,"Do not spray based on the number of leafhoppers and moths in the field, start spraying at 10% infestation of leafhoppers and 5% infestations of moths.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FALSE SMUT PADDY CROP?,Spray for the prevention of false kangiari on paddy Dissolve 500 grams of Coside 46 DF (copper hydroxide) in 200 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLACK COLOR SPOT ON PANICLE OF PADDY CROP?,Spray 200 ml of Tilt 25 EC (propiconazole) in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN TRANSPLANTED PADDY OR BASMATI?,"Keep water in paddy or basmati for the first 15 days, after that keep a good gill. There is no need to store water, there is no need to store water when the crop matures, stop watering 2 weeks before the crop matures.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN PADDY?,Water the paddy crop as required. There is no need to keep the water standing continuously. You can water after 2 or 3 days when the soil absorbs water. Stop the water about 15 days before harvesting the crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE RECOMMENDED FERTILIZER DOSE FOR PUNJAB BASMATI 7, 5, 4, 3, PUSA BASMATI 1121, 1637, 1718?","Amount of fertilizers in Punjab Basmati 7, 5, 4, 3, Pusa Basmati 1121, 1637, 1718 varieties of Basmati - 36 kg urea, 27 kg DAP or 75 kg super phosphate and 20 kg muriate of potash per acre. If DAP has been applied in rubber crop then do not apply in saffron crop please use potash only based on soil test, apply urea in 2 equal parts apply in 3rd and 6th week","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN COTTON?,Spray 500 gm blytox and 20 gm agrimycin or 3 gm sutrareptocycline in 200 liters of water per acre and spray at 15 to 20 days interval.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BANNED PESTICIDES FOR BASMATI CROP?,"Kisan Viro Punjab Agriculture Department has appealed to the farmers not to use Acephate, Carbendazim, Thiamithoxam, Trizophos, Tricyclazole, Buprofangin, Carbofuron, Propiconazole and Thiofinate Methyl drugs in Basmati rice.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION MANAGEMENT IN PADDY AFTER BOOT STAGE OF CROP?,"There is no need to keep water standing in the paddy during the rainy season, but the land should not feel dry, as soon as the land becomes waterlogged, it should be irrigated within 2-3 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF PADDY WITH MATURITY PERIOD AND HEIGHT?,"Advanced varieties of paddy- PR 129 (day-138, height-105 cm), PR 128 (day-141, height-110 cm), PR 127 (day-137, height-104 cm), PR 126 (day-123, height-102 cm), PR 124 (day- 135, height-107 cm), PR 123 (day- 143, height-105 cm), PR 122 (day - 147, Height-108 cm), PR 121 (Day-140, Height-98 cm), PR 114 (Day-145, Height-92 cm), PR 113 (Day-142, Height- 105 cm), HKR 47 (D-134, Height-117 cm)|","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITE FLY?,Mix 40 grams of Ektra 25 WG (thiamethoxam) in 100 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN PADDY CROP?,Spray 500 gm blytox and 20 gm agrimycin or 3 gm sutrareptocycline in 200 liters of water per acre and spray at 15 to 20 days interval.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SUFFICIENT TIME GAP BETWEEN THE APPLICATION OF ANY CHEMICAL AND RAIN FOR BETTER RESULT?,For the best effect of any medicine there should be at least 8-10 hours gap between spraying and rain,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISEASE CONTROL IN PADDY CROP?,Spray of 500 g Kocide 46 DF (copper hydroxide) in 200 liters of water per acre at boot stage of the crop in disease prone areas.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BPH, WBPH AND GRASSHOPPER?",120 gm Chas (Pymetrozine 50 WG) or 40 ml Confidor (Imidacloprid 200 SL (17.8 % w/w)) or 800 ml Acalx (Quinalphos 25% EC) or 1 liter Chlorpyrifos 20 EC at 100 Dissolve in liter of water and spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GRAIN DISCOLORATION IN PADDY CROP?,"In paddy crop due to bad weather, grains turn reddish brown. To control it, apply 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC (Ezoxystrobin + Difenconazole) or 200 ml Folicure in 200 liters of water as a solution, depending on the plant.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLACKING OF EARS IN PADDY?,"If the results of paddy are black, it is due to using more than recommended amount of a drug or mixing 2 drugs together, there is no sure solution. Until this problem can be found","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF FUNGUS IN PADDY/BASMATI?,150 ml Pulsar 24 SC (Thifluzamide) or 26.8 g Epic 75 WG (Hexaconazole) or 400 ml Galileo Way 18.76 SC (Peoxystrobin 7%+ Propiconazole 12%) or 200 ml Amistar Top for prevention of blight in paddy/Basmati. 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) OR 200 ml Tilt 25 EC (Propiconazole) OR 200 ml Folicer 25 EC (Tabuconazole) OR 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifluoxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) OR Spray per acre by adding 320 ml of Luscher 37.5 SE (Flujilazole 25%+Carbendazim 12.5%) or 200 ml of Monseron 250 SC (Pencicuron) in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TIME DIFFERENCE BETWEEN PESTICIDE APPLICATION AND RAIN?,For good results there should be a gap of 7 to 8 hours between rain and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF NECK BLAST IN BASMATI CROP?,Make a solution of Indofil Z-78 500 grams or 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC (Azoxystrobin + Difenconazole) in 200 liters of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL PANICLE BLIGHT OF PADDY?,"To control bacterial panicle leaf blight disease in paddy crop, spray 200 ml of Folicure + 30 g of streptomycin in 200 liters of water for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL PANICLE BLIGHT IN PADDY?,"No medicine is recommended to solve the problem of blight disease in paddy crop. To prevent this disease, cultivate the recommended varieties of PAU, do not keep standing water in the field, use disease free seeds and Do not apply nitrogen supplements after 6 weeks and above recommended","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE MINIMUM HOURS REQUIRED FOR NUTRIENTS?,"If it does not rain for 8-10 hours after spraying, the spray will be effective to a large extent","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ANY SPRAY ON PADDY?,If there is no problem on paddy then no spray is needed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLACK COLOR SPOT ON PANICLE OF PADDY?,Spray 200 ml of Tilt 25 EC (Propiconazole) in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR CONTROL OF FUNGAL DISEASE IN PADDY BEFORE 20-25 DAYS OF HARVESTING?,"If the paddy crop is ready for harvest in the next 20-25 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN PADDY/BASMATI?,"No medicine is recommended to solve the problem of blight disease in paddy crop. To prevent this disease, PAU recommends to cultivate disease resistant varieties, do not keep standing water in the field, Use disease free seed and after 6 weeks and do not apply more nitrogen content than recommended","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY/BASMATI BEFORE FLOWERING STAGE OF CROP?,"Before the emergence of paddy crop, in case of attack of leafhopper, 20-30 meters long rope of coconut or mulberry should be wrapped twice on the upper part of the crop, first time from one end of the tiller to the other end and then again while wrapping the rope around the top of the crop. Back it should be taken care that the water must be standing in the crop while turning the rope","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DISCOLORATION IN PADDY?,You can spray 1.5 kg 13:00:45 in paddy when the munjars are infected.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DISCOLORATION OF SPIKE IN PADDY?,You can spray 200 ml of folicur in the paddy when the fungus is infected,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO CHECK ORIGINALITY OF PESTICIDE?,"While buying pesticides, get a valid bill from the shopkeeper so that you can claim in case of pesticide failure.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN WE MIX INSECTICIDE AND FUNGICIDE?,Never mix fungicides and insecticides,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR CONTROL OF FUNGAL DISEASE IN PADDY BEFORE 15 DAYS OF HARVESTING?,"If the paddy crop is ready for harvest in the next 15-20 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOWING OF TIPS OF LEAVES IN PADDY?,"Due to change in the weather, the tips of paddy leaves start to curl, so there is no need for any special medicine.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISCOLOURATION IN PADDY?,Blackness in paddy is due to weather,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY OF ANY PESTICIDE IN PADDY BEFORE 20 DAYS OF HARVESTING?,"If the paddy crop is ready for harvest in the next 20 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DYING OF PLANTS OF PADDY?,"Before spraying, check the attack of the disease well, or you can show it to the nearest agriculturist office and call again, if there is no disease, do not apply any fungicide.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT-ROT IN PADDY/BASMATI?,"To prevent root rot in paddy/basmati crop, sprinkle 500 gm of Sofilizer (Carbendazim 12%+Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15-20 kg of sand per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT FOR BETTER YIELD OF PADDY CROP?,NPK 13:00:45 dose in rice crop 1.5% (1.5 kg) per 200 liter water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MOISTURE?,Do not need much moisture during spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BUNT IN PADDY?,To prevent bunt in paddy apply only recommended amount of nitrogen fertilizer or 200 ml Tilt/Bumper 25 EC (propiconazole) in 200 liters of water first spray at emergence and second spray after 10 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF POTASH DEFICIENCY IN PADDY?,"If there are signs of potassium deficiency during the initial growth of the paddy crop, spray 1 kg of NPK 00:00:50 in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE COMBINED CONTROL OF SAP SUCKING INSECTS AND CATERPILLAR IN PADDY/BASMATI?,Spray 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC or 800 ml of Ecalx 25 EC (Quinlphas) in 100 liters of water to control the accumulation of sap-sucking insects and weevils in paddy/Basmati.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF PADDY?,"If there is yellowing on the leaves in the paddy crop, check its signs well to know which element is causing the yellowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE APPLICATION OF INSECTICIDES ON THE CROPS?,"Insecticides should be sprayed early in the morning or late in the evening; If used during hot weather, it can endanger the plants","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE GROWTH REGULATOR USED FOR INCREASING GRAIN YIELD IN PADDY/BASMATI?,"To reduce blight in paddy/basmati, spray 1.5% potassium nitrate NPK 13:00:45 (3 kg in 200 liters of water) per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY IN PADDY BEFORE 15-20 DAYS OF HARVESTING?,The crop is ready to harvest in the next 15-20 days so no spraying is required.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE MINIMUM HOURS REQUIRED FOR FUNGICIDE?,"It takes at least 6-8 hours for the fungicide to take effect, if it does not rain for 6-8 hours after spraying, the spray is effective to a large extent. It takes at least 6-8 hours for the insecticide to kill the insects. Yes, if it doesn't rain for 6-8 hours after spraying, the spray will be effective to a large extent","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SHEATH ROT IN PADDY/BASMATI?,26.8 g Epic 75 WG (Hexaconazole) 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) in 200 liters of water for prevention of stem leaf rot disease in Paddy/Basmati as first spray in crop . On arrival and do the second spraying at an interval of 15 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF PADDY HISPA?,Spray 800 ml of Acalx 25 EC (Quinlphas) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF REDDENING OF LEAVES OF PADDY?,The red leaves of paddy are also due to weather and you can spray Folikar to increase greenness,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BEST TIME OF DAY TO SPRAY ANY CHEMICAL ON PADDY?,The best time to spray the paddy is in the morning after the dew falls or in the evening,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER YIELD OF PADDY CROP?,"For better paddy yield, spray 1 kg NPK 0:0:50 in 100 liters of water per acre at the time of emergence.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY DISEASES CONTROL?,No spraying can be done without any disease after paddy germination,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF PADDY WITH THEIR YIELD?,"Advanced varieties of paddy- PR 129 (Yield- 30 quintal), PR 128 (Yield- 30.5 quintal), PR 127 (Yield- 30 quintal), PR 126 (Yield- 30 quintal), P .R 124 (Yield- 30.5 quintal), PR 123 (Yield- 29 quintal), PR 122 (Yield- 31.5 quintal), PR 121 (Yield- 30.5 quintal), PR 114 (Yield - 27.5 quintals, ), PR 113 (Yield- 28 quintals), HKR 47 (Yield- 29.5 quintals) |","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BROWN LEAF SPOT IN PADDY?,Spray for prevention of brown spot disease on paddy Dissolve 80 grams of Nativo in 200 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE LAST IRRIGATION IN THE DIRECT SEEDED PADDY?,"In direct seeded paddy, last irrigation should be applied 10-15 days before harvest depending on soil type.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF INSECTICIDE NEAR HARVESTING STAGE IN PADDY?,"When the paddy is close to maturity, there is no need to spray any insecticides","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INSECT CONTROL IN PADDY CROP?,Spray 120 GM chess (Pymetrozine 50 WG) in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISEASE CONTROL IN PADDY?,Propiconazole 25 EC 1 M. L. Make a solution per liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF LAST IRRIGATION TO PADDY?,Apply last water to paddy crop 10-15 days before harvest depending on soil type.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN SPRAY DELTAMETHRIN AND BIFENTHRIN TO CONTROL STEM BORER IN RICE?,Deltamethrin and bifenthrin are not recommended for use in paddy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF POTASSIUM NITRATE (13:00:45) AND INSECTICIDE?,It is not recommended to take two medicines together,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT THE PR127 OF PADDY?,"PR 127 (yield-30 quintals, time-137 days, height 104 cm),","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF STEM BORER/LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY/BASMATI?,60 ml of Corajan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 20 ml of FEM 480 SC (Flubendamide) or 170 g of Mortar 75 SG (cartop hydrochloride) to 100 liters for prevention of stem rot/leaf blight in paddy/basmati. Put in water and spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL LEAF BLIGHT OF PADDY?,Spray 80 g Nativo 75 WG (trifloxystrobin 25%+tabuconazole 50%) and 20 g agrimycin or 3 gm sutareptocycline in 200 liters of water for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH OF PADDY/BASMATI?,Fertilizers recommended for good growth of Paddy/Basmati If growth is still not good then add 1000 g NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water (10 g per liter) per acre. Spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF LEAF FOLDER AND IN PADDY/BASMATI?,80 ml of Ecotene 5% EC (Azadirachtin) 60 ml of Corajan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 20 ml of FEM 480 SC (Flubendamide) or 170 g of mortar for prevention of Leaf Blight and Stem Blight in Paddy/Basmati. Spray 75 SG (cartop hydrochloride) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TIME GAP BETWEEN N:P:K ::13:0:45, AND ANY FUNGICIDE?",Can use fungicide for 1-2 days after using N:P:K:: 13:0:45.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH OF PADDY CROP?,"For paddy growth, spray 1 KG powder NPK (19:19:19) or 200 g liquid (19:19:19) in 100 liters of water for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAINTAIN STANDING WATER FOR FIRST 15-20 DAYS THEN GOOD MOISTURE IS NEEDED TO GROW THE CROP.?,"Keep water in the paddy for the first 1520 days, after that keep a good gill, there is no need to store water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN PADDY?,"15 days before harvesting in paddy, stop watering","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RED TIPS IN PADDY?,There will be no harm due to red tip in paddy,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RECOMMENDATION OF GRANULAR INSECTICIDES (PADAN/REGENT/FERTERA)?,Padan/Regent/Fertera and other granular drugs are not recommended in paddy but in Basmati and leaf wrap can be applied in case of attack of sundi but not recommended for growth.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN BASMATI 1637,1121 & 1718?","Basmati 1637,1121 & 1718 Fertilizers 36 kg Urea, 27 kg DAP or 75 kg Super Phosphate and 20 kg MOP per acre. If DAP has been applied in rubber crop then do not apply in kharif crop, use potash only on the basis of soil test, apply urea in equal proportion, apply in 3rd and 6th week.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DILA AND MOTHA OR BOOTI IN PADDY AND WATER MANAGEMENT?,"20-25 days after sowing, 8 grams of Almix (metsulfuran methyl + chlorimuron ethyl) or 30 grams of Algrip 20 wg (metsulfuran) dissolved in 150 liters of water per acre. Spray in, do not water for a day after spraying","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IS PESTICIDES WASHED AWAY AFTER TWO HOURS OF RAIN?,At least 7-8 hours are required to reduce the pesticide,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETIES PBW 869 OF WHEAT?,P. B. W 869: This variety is recommended for intercropping with hepseeder/super seeder in paddy crop. Its average height is 101 cm. and this variety takes 158 days to mature. This variety is free from brown rot and moderately resistant to yellow rot. Its average yield is 23.2 quintals per acre. Its grains are coarser than all other varieties. It has been recommended jointly by Borlaug Institute (BISA) and PAU.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOSE OF TAKUMI AND CUSTODIA?,"The amount of Takumi in paddy is 50 grams in 100 liters of water, and the amount of Custodia is 200 ml in 200 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL YOUNGER LARVAE AMERICAN BOLL WORM IN KAPAS?,"To control small American bollworms in cotton, spray 40 ml of FEM or 250 g of Larvin 75 WP or 500 ml of Curacron 50 EC (Profenofos) or 800 ml of Ethane in 125 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NO NEED TO APPLY PESTICIDE IN LAST 15 DAYS OF PADDY CROP HARVEST.?,There is no need to spray 15 days before paddy harvesting,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF APHID IN PADDY CROP?,Spray of 1.5ml/1L Rogor 30EC (dimethoate) or 1ml/2.5L Confider 17.8SL (imidaclopride) or 1gm/2.5L Actara 25WG (thiamethozam) for control of aphid in paddy crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOSE OF AMISTAR TOP 325 SC IN RICE?,200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC (Ezoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) or 200 ml Tilt 25 EC (Propiconazole) or 200 ml Folikar 25 EC (Tabuconazole) for prevention of stem leaf blight in paddy/Basmati. Spray 80 g of Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY TIME IN PADDY OR OTHER CROPS?,The best time to spray any crop is in the morning and evening.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE EFFECT OF WEATHER ON PADDY?,If the tip of the leaf is drying and there are no other spots then it is due to weathering so no spray is needed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BAD AND RAINY WEATHER LEADS TO POOR FILLING OF GRAINS IN PADDY CROP?,"At the time of ripening, rain and wind in the paddy crop causes the grains to remain empty and stained","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PURPOSE OF USAGE OF AMISTAR TOP IN PADDY?,Spray 200 ml of Amistar Top 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2% + Difenconazole 11.4%) in 200 liters of water per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF POTASSIUM NITRATE WITH ANY FUNGICIDE OR PESTICIDE?,Mixing potassium nitrate with fungicides or insecticides in paddy is not recommended.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SIDE EFFECT OF SPRAY OF 2 MIXED CHEMICALS?,"If 2 medicines are mixed together and sprinkled, then there is no solution to the bad effect caused by this reason","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SUFFICIENT TIME GAP BETWEEN THE APPLICATION OF ANY FUNGICIDE AND RAIN FOR BETTER RESULT?,"For any fungicide to be effective, there should be at least 24 hours between spraying and rainfall.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETIES OF BASMATI?,The new variety of Basmati paddy is Punjab Basmati 7. This variety matures in 101 days after sowing and has an average height of 111 cm and an average yield of 19 quintals.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS FROM THE VACANT FIELD?,"Before sowing, spray 500 ml of Gramoxone 24 SL (Paraquat) in 200 liters of water per acre to control weeds from bare fields.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VISIT TO THE FIELD AND CALL AGAIN?,"Please go to the farm and tell the signs well for good information, so please go to the farm and call","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF FALSE SMUT IN PADDY?,"For the prevention of false blight in paddy, spray 500 grams of Cocide 46DF (Copper Hydroxide) in 200 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGUS IN PADDY?,You can spray 200 ml tilt 25 EC mixed in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN PADDY/BASMATI AFTER ONE MONTH OF TRANSPLANTING?,No herbicide is recommended after 1 month of paddy sowing,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BORON DEFICIENCY IN PADDY?,"To meet boron deficiency in paddy crop, spray 100 g of boron in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME EMPTY PODS OR WHITE PENICLE OF PADDY?,"In the paddy crop, if there is an attack of the weevil, or even with a blight, the munjar is left empty, which has no solution, the empty munjar does not produce grain later","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT THE VARIETIES OF PADDY?,"Paddy Varieties PR 128 (yield-30.5 quintal time-141 days, height-110 cm), PR 129 (yield-30 quintal time-138 days, height-105 cm) and HKR - 47 (yield-29.5 quintal, time-134 days, height-117 cm), PR 127 (yield-30 quintal, time-137 days, height 104 cm), PR 126 (yield-30 quintal , Time-123 days, Height-102 cm:), PR124 (Yield-30.5 quintals, Time-135 days , Height-107 cm:), PR 123 (Yield-29 quintals, Time-143 days , Height- 105 cm:), PR122(Yield-31.5 quintals, Time-147days, Height-108cm:), PR121(Yield-30.5 quintals, Time-140days, Height-98 cm:), PR114 (Yield-27.5 quintal, Time-145 days, Height-102 cm), PR 128 (Yield-30.5 quintal, Time-141 days, Height-110 cm), PR 129 (Yield-30 quintal, Time- 138 days, height-105 cm) and HKR-47 (yield-29.5 quintal time-134 days, height-117 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE MINIMUM HOURS REQUIRED FOR INSECTICIDE?,"It takes at least 6-8 hours for the insecticide to kill insects, if it does not rain for 6-8 hours after spraying, the spray will be effective to a large extent.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE NUTRIENT COMPOSITION IN DAP AND 12:32:16?,"DAP contains 18% nitrogen and 46% phosphorus and NPK 12:32:16 contains 12% nitrogen, 32% phosphorus and 16% potash.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN PADDY?,"No medicine is recommended to solve the problem of blight disease in paddy crop. To prevent this disease, cultivate the recommended varieties of PAU, do not keep standing water in the field, use disease free seeds and After 6 weeks and do not apply more nitrogen content than recommended there is no fixed solution if the paddy is wilted then spraying with 80 grams of Nativo in 200 liters of water can make a small difference.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MATURITY TIME OF PADDY VARIETIES?,Different species have different durations,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACKENING OF HUSK OF PADDY?,"There can be several reasons for black spots on the husk of paddy grain Such as: weather, mixing multiple sprays, or using more than one spray. For these reasons there is no recommendation for blackheads","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN BASMATI?,Spray 500 g Blytox and 6 g Sutrareptocycline in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT IN PADDY?,Spray 200 ml amistar top with 80 gm nativo mixed in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PROBLEM IN PADDY?,"If there is any problem in the paddy plants, check the signs well and you can call later.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF PESTICIDE NEAR HARVESTING STAGE?,It is not recommended to spray any medicine when the paddy crop is close to maturity,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF NECK BLAST IN PADDY CROP?,200 ml of Amistar Top 325 SC (Ezoxystrobin 18.2% + Difenconazole 11.4%) or 500 gm quantity of Z 78 mixed with 200 liters of water in one acre and sprayed at emergence.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME REASONS FOR EARLY MATURITY OF PADDY?,One of the reasons for early ripening of paddy is if the paddy is planted at an older age,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF STEM BORER OR LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY AND BASMATI?,"Spray 170 gm mortar (Cartop Hydrochloride 75 SG), 20 ml FEM (Flubedamide 480 SC) or 1 liter Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF PADDY MOTHA AND BOARD LEAF WEEDS IN PADDY/BASMATI?,30 g Algrip 20 W for control of paddy moths and broadleaf weeds in paddy/basmati. G (Metsulfuron) or 50 g Sunrise 15 WG (Ethoxysulfuron) or 40 gm Londax 60 DF (Bensulfuron) or 16 gm Segment 50 DF (Azimesulfuron) added to 150 liters of water for 20-25 Spray days later or spray 8 g Elmix 20 WP (metsulfuron methyl 10%+Chlorimuron ethyl 10%) in 150 liters of water per acre 20-25 days after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF TWO PESTICIDES?,It is not recommended to mix two medicines in paddy/basmati I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ROOT ROT IN PADDY?,Mix 500 gm of sofilizer (Carbendazim + Mancozeb) in 15-16 kg of soil and sprinkle it according to the kilo for the prevention of paddy and gall.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO CONTROL BLAST IN PADDY CROP?,"Bavistin @ 500 grams or Amistar top 325 SC (Azoxystrobin + Difenoconazole) 200 ml for prevention of blast in paddy crop. Or Tricyclazole 75% WP, 120 gm. Mix the drug in 200 liters of water and spray","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION MANAGEMENT IN PADDY CROP.?,Irrigation in paddy crop should be kept up to 5 cm from the panicle initial stage to the time of germination.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISEASE MANAGEMENT IN PADDY?,No spray required in paddy crop if no disease appears on plant.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME AMISTAR TOP 325 SC DOSE IN RICE?,"In paddy, spray 200 ml of Amistar Top 325 SC (Ezoxystrobin 18.2% + Difenconazole 11.4%) in 200 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER YIELD OF PADDY?,Spray 1 kg NPK (19:19:19) dissolved in 100 liters of water for paddy growth.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FALSE SMUT DISEASE?,"To control this disease, give spray of 400 ml Galileo Way 18.76 SC (picoxystrobin + propiconazole) or 500 g Kocide 46 DF (copper hydroxide) in 200 liters of water per acre at boot stage of the crop in disease prone areas.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE OVER HEIGHT OF BASMATI?,"By adding more urea than recommended in Basmati, its height increases, so the amount of urea should be used as per the recommendation.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DAMAGE OF CROP DUE TO RAIN?,"Heavy rain may damage the crop, but its damage cannot be estimated","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF PADDY NURSERY?,"Before spraying the crop, check for signs of disease and nutrient deficiency and call again or show up at the nearest agriculturist office.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN BASMATI?,Spray 500 grams of Blytox and 3 grams of Sutrareptocycline in 200 liters of water per acre and spray at an interval of 15 to 20 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOSE OF NATIVO 75WG AND CHESS 50WG IN PADDY CROP?,"Spray 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) in 200 liters of water per acre, repeat spraying after 15 days. For control of grasshopper (oil)/grasshopper in paddy/basmati, spray 120 gm of Ches 50 WG (Pymetrogin) in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF TECHNICAL?,"If it has been three or four days since the spray has been dissolved, then the effect of that spray is greatly reduced","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DISCOLORATION OF GRAIN PADDY?,"When the paddy grains are stained, you can spray 200 ml of Folikar by mixing it in a liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN PADDY AFTER TILLERING STAGE?,"After the paddy crop comes into the medium level, there is no need to continuously water it more than necessary, when the soil absorbs water, apply water after 2-3 days and make sure that the soil is not hard. Stop watering 10-15 days before the crop matures depending on the type of soil","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF INSECTICIDE FOR LEAF FOLDER?,"Before applying insecticides in paddy, check leafhopper attack well, if attack is 10% then spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SHEATH BLIGHT DISEASE CONTROL IN PADDY CROP?,Spray of 150 ml Pulsor 24 SC (thifluzamide) or 26.8 g Epic 75 WG (hexaconazole) or 400 ml Galileo Way 18.76 SC (picoxystrobin + propiconazole) or 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC or Tilt/Bumper /Pikapika 25 EC (propiconazole) or Folicur/Orius (tebuconazole) 25 EC or 80 g Nativo 75 WG (trifloxystrobin+tebuconazole) or 320 ml Lusture 37.5 SE (flusilazole + carbendazim) or 200 ml Monceren 250 SC (pencycuron) in 200 liters of water per acre. Give second spray 15 days thereafter.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF BASMATI?,"To control the flag disease, apply 15 grams of Trichoderma harzianum per kg of seed and before planting in cheese field, soak its roots in 15 grams of Trichoderma harzianum per liter of water for 6 hours, in paddy field Before planting, mix 2 kg of Trichoderma harzianum with 100 kg of manure and keep it in the shade for a week and make a light mulch, dry the water and sprinkle it in the field.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HIGHLY YIELD VARIETY OF MUSTARD?,The most popular type of mustard is gsc-7,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY TO CONTROL STEM BORER?,"If the stem borer is attacked when the paddy grain is hard, then no spray is needed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF BASMATI WITH THEIR YIELD?,"Light sensitive varieties of Basmati- Pusa Basmati 1718 (Yield-17 quintal) Pusa Basmati 1637 (17.5 quintal), Pusa Basmati 1509 (15.7 quintal), Pusa Basmati 1121 (Yield-13.7 quintal) Light sensitive varieties of Basmati- Punjab Basmati 7 ( Yield-19 quintal), Punjab Basmati 5 (Yield-15 quintal), Punjab Basmati 4 (Yield-17 quintal), CSR (Yield-13.5), Punjab Basmati 3 (Yield-16 quintal), Basmati 386 ( yield-9 quintal) and Basmati 370 (yield-12 quintal)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT CAN WE SPRAY INSECTICIDE IN PADDY IN STANDING WATER?,There should be no standing water in the field while spraying the insecticide in paddy,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT CAN WE MIX 2 HERBICIDES FOR SPRAY ON PADDY/BASMATI?,Never mix 2 herbicides for spraying on paddy/basmati.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT OF PADDY?,Spray 200 ml of Folicure + 30 g of streptomycin or 3 g of streptocycline in 200 liters of water for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF PESTICIDES WITHOUT ANY PROBLEM IN PADDY/BASMATI CROP?,Do not use any insecticides and fungicides in paddy/basmati crop without any problem.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLACK COLOR SPOT ON PANICLE OF PADDY/BASMATI CROP?,200 ml Folicer 25 EC (Tabuconazole) should be sprayed in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF APHID IN PADDY?,Mix 40 ml of Confidoor or 40 g of Ektra in 100 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH REGULATOR IN PADDY?,"For paddy growth, spray 1 KG powder NPK (19:19:19) in 100 liters of water(@10 grams per liter) for one acre. Can also spray in stagnant water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED TREATMENT IN BASMATI?,"To protect the basmati crop from flagellar disease, apply 15 grams of Trichoderma herginum per kg of seed before sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEEDLING TREATMENT IN BASMATI?,"Before planting in the field, soak the roots in 15 grams of Trichoderma herginum per liter (as many liters of water as the roots of the cheese can be well submerged) for 6 hours.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT-KNOT NEMATODES IN PADDY/BASMATI IN STANDING CROP?,Spray 8-10 kg Furadan 3g (Carbofuran) or 2 kg Nematoferi (Verticillium chlamydosporium) mixed with 15-20 kg sand per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF INSECTICIDE IN PADDY CROP?,"Before spraying, check the insect attack thoroughly","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GAP BETWEEN NUTRIENT APPLICATION AND PESTICIDE APPLICATION?,You can apply insecticide and fungicide one day after spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE MIXING OF 2 CHEMICALS FOR SPRAY ON PADDY?,Never mix two drugs together for spraying on paddy,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF PADDY NURSERY?,"To prevent leaf yellowing in paddy, spray 1 kg of NPK19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per canal.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF NECK BLAST IN PADDY?,Spray 200 ml of Amistar Top 325 SC (Azoxystrobin + Difenconazole) or 500 g of Indophil Z-78 (Jineb 75 WP) in 200 liters of water at the time of budding and emergence. do,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PROCESSING OF WASTE DECOMPOSER?,"To prepare a solution of waste decomposer, mix a jar of waste decomposer with 2 kg jaggery and 200 liters of water and keep for 5 days, then add 1 liter of solution after 10 liters of water and spray it and keep 2 liters of solution for next time use.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PROTECTION OF ECULEPTOUS PLANTS FROM TERMITES?,Apply 5-10 ml of chlorpyrifos per liter to protect against whitefly attack at the time of planting.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOSE OF TAKUMI, ACTARA AND AVTAR PESTICIDE IN PADDY?","Takumi, Aktara and Avatar pesticides are not recommended in paddy","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE LAST IRRIGATION PADDY?,Apply last water to paddy 10-15 days before harvest depending on soil type.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF BASMATI WITH THEIR HEIGHT AND MATURITY DAYS?,"Light sensitive varieties of Basmati- Punjab Basmati 7 (Height-111 cm, Day-131), Punjab Basmati 5 (Height-112 cm, Day-137), Punjab Basmati 4 (Height- 96 cm, Day-146), C. SR (height-139 cm, day-142), Punjab Basmati 3 (height-105 cm, day-139), Basmati 386 (height-180 cm, day-155) and Basmati 370 (height-165 cm, day-155) - 150) Light insensitive varieties of Basmati- Pusa Basmati 1718 (Height-121 cm, Day-144) Pusa Basmati 1637 (Height-139 cm, Day-138), Pusa Basmati 1509 (Height-92 cm, Day-120), Pusa Basmati 1121 (Height-120 cm, Day-137)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY IN PADDY?,If there is no problem in the paddy crop then there is no need to spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DOSE OF TEBUCONAZOLE 25 EC IN PADDY?,Application of Tabuconazole 25 EC at 200 ml per acre in paddy crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BURNING OF PADDY STRAW?,Burning paddy straw is prohibited,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE TOTAL TIME PERIOD OF PUSA BASMATI 1509?,Pusa Basmati 1509 variety takes 120 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME POTASSIUM DEFICIENCY?,Spray 1 kg of NPK (0:52:34) in 100 liters of water for one acre to meet potash deficiency in paddy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF RICE EAR CUT CATERPILLER IN PADDY/BASMATI?,80 ml Ecotene 5% EC (Azadirachtin) 60 ml Corajan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 20 ml FEM 480 SC (Flubendamide) or 170 g Mortar 75 SG ( Cartop Hydrochloride) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF ROTTING IN CAULIFLOWER?,"To prevent mildew in cauliflower, you can spray half a kilo of Saafilizer mixed in 200 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETIES OF PADDY?,"New varieties of paddy-PR 128 (yield-30.5 quintal time-141 days, height-110 cm), PR 129 (yield-30 quintal time-138 days, height-105 cm) and HKR - 47 (yield-29.5 quintal time-134 days, height-117 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR ANY PESTICIDE IN PADDY/BASMATI BEFORE 15-20 DAYS OF HARVESTING?,"If the paddy/basmati crop is ready for harvest in the next 15-20 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR ANY PESTICIDE IN PADDY/BASMATI BEFORE 20 DAYS OF HARVESTING?,"If the paddy/basmati crop is ready for harvest within the next 20 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF FALSE SMUT IN PADDY CROP?,Adding 400 ml of Galileo Whey 18.76 SC (picoxystrobin 7% + propiconazole 12%) or 500 gm Cocide 46 DF (copper hydroxide) in 200 liters of water at the time of crop emergence. Spray per acre | There is no control of the disease once it occurs,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PUSA DECOMPOSER CAPSULES?,"To prepare Pusa Decomposer take 5 liters of water in a vessel add 150 gm jaggery and stir it well and boil it to make syrup. Dissolve the besan, after that open the capsules of Pusa decomposer and put it in it and stir it well and keep it covered with a gauze cloth for 4 days. After 4 days, a layer of different colors will form on this solution Mix it with honey Now 5 liters of solution will be ready After that, prepare the solution by adding jaggery and besan in 4 other pots and add 1.25 liters of capsule solution in each pot. Later keep it covered for 4 days and mix the prepared solution with honey Now add all this 25 liters of solution in 500 liters of water and spray it on the shredded straw lying in the field per hectare and kill the rotavator.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME AVAILABILITY OF SPRAY TECHNOLOGY FOR DECOMPOSITION OF PADDY STRAW?,Spraying equipment for mass mulching of stubble can be obtained from your Agricultural Development Officer,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAIL ABOUT VARIETY OF PUSA BASMATI 1718?,"Varieties of Basmati - Pusa Basmati 1718 (yield-17 quintal, duration-144 days, height-121 cm).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR IN PADDY?,Spray 60 ml of Korajan or 70 g of Proclam in 100-125 liters of water per acre to prevent rust.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME REDUCE THE ADVERSE EFFECT OF GRAMOXONE ON PADDY?,Spray 2 kg of urea diluted in 100 liters to reduce the flow of neidicide.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF FALSE SMUT AND SHEATH BLIGHT IN PADDY?,Spray 400 ml of Galileo Whey 18.76 SC (picoxystrobin 7% + propiconazole 12%) in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DYING OF LEAVES OF PADDY?,"Before spraying the crop, check for signs of disease and nutrient deficiency and show it to the nearest agriculturist office","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DEFICIENCY OF BORON IN PADDY?,Spray 200 grams of borax (sodium borate) per 200 liters of water to compensate for boron deficiency in paddy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BAD EFFECT OF RAIN OF PADDY?,"If the paddy crop has fallen and it rains, sometimes this will cause the fall of the fallow.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME USE OF PESTICIDE MIXTURE AFTER 3 DAYS?,Do not use three day old spray rupee solution,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR APHID CONTROL ALL CROPS?,Spray of 1.5ml/1L Rogor 30EC (dimethoate) or 1ml/2.5L Confider 17.8SL (imidaclopride) or 1gm/2.5L Actara 25WG (thiamethozam).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BACTERIAL PANIC BLIGHT?,Paddy/Basmati 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC 200 ml Foliker 25 EC (Tabuconazole),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BACTERIAL PANICLE BLIGHT IN PADDY?,There is no definitive solution after the occurrence of bacterial panicle blight disease in rice crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF STEM ROT IN PADDY/BASMATI?,"No medicine is recommended to solve the problem of stem rot in paddy crop. To prevent this disease, do not keep standing water in the field and do not apply nitrogen content more than recommended after 6 weeks.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY?,There is no recommendation to mix fungicides with pesticides,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN WE MIX OF SPRAY?,Never mix the medicine,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREPARATION OF WASTE DECOMPOSER?,"To prepare a solution of waste decomposer, mix a bottle of waste decomposer and 2 kg of jaggery in 200 liters of water and keep it for 5 days, then add 1 liter of solution to 10 liters of water and spray it and keep 2 liters of solution for next time use.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CO 51 PADDY VARIETIES DETAILS?,"105-110 days. Centrally resistant to downy mildew, green leafy bugs, and powdery mildew.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY DIRECT SOWING SEED RATE?,24 kg/acre required for hand seeding and 15 kg for roller seeding,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CR 1009 PADDY SOWING SEASON?,August (Samba) can be sown in September (Pin Samba).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY VARIETY CR 1009?,"155 - 160 days, yield 2120 kg/acre, resistant to powdery mildew","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ADT 38 PADDY VARIETIES DETAILS?,"Harvesting days is 130-135. Average yield is 2480 kg per acre. It has long thin rice, medium, tall growing short crop and bacterial leaf blight, resistant to many pests, short seed storage period.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CR1009 PADDY DETAILS?,It has an average age of 155-166 days and an average yield of 2100 kg per acre. Smoke resistant. It is mild.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED PADDY TREATMENT?,Mix and apply 10 grams of Pseudomonas per kg of rice seed. No need to soak,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY VARIETY ADT 43 SEED TO HARVEST DURATION?,110 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VGD 1 PADDY VARIETY INFORMATION?,"Short variety is 130 days old, non-dying, yield 2340 kg per acre, resistant to leaf curler, black spot disease","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ADT 53 PADDY VARIETY INFORMATION?,"Short variety is 105-110 days old, non-dying, yield 2533 kg per acre, resistant to leaf spot, leaf sheath blight and red spot.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY SEED RATE CR 1009 VARIETY?,"Thanjavur District CR 1009 Sub 1 Proof Seed 40.3/kg, Certificate Seed 37/kg","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY SOWING SEASON AND VARIETIES?,"Samba (August) CR 1009 Sub1, ATTD 50, ATTD 51, CR 1009, TRY 3 , Bin Samba / Taladi (Sep-Oct ) VGD 1, TKM 13, Go 52, Go (R ) 50, ATTD 39, ATTD 38, ATTD 49, Go 43, Imp.Vellai Ponni , ATTD (R) 46, TRY 3*,","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE VARIETIES FOR PADDY (SEPTEMBER -OCTOBER MONTHS : LATE SAMBA / THALADI)?,"ADT 38, ADT 39, TRY 1*, TRY 3*, ADT (R) 46, ADT (R) 49, CO (R) 48, CO (R) 49, CO (R) 50","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SWARNA SUB 1 PADDY TOTAL DURATION?,145 days ; Samba (August) season is ideal,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEERAGA SAMBA PADDY VARIETY DURATION?,125 -130 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY VARIETIES SUITABLE FOR THANJAVUR DISTRICT IN KURUVAI?,"ADT 53, CO 51, ADT 43, ADT (R) 45, TPS 5 , MDU 6, ADT 36, ADT 37, CORH 3, ASD 16, TKM 9","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY VARIETIES SUITABLE FOR THANJAVUR DISTRICT IN SAMBA?,"CR 1009 Sub1, TNAU Rice ADT 50, ADT 51, CR 1009, TRY 3","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE FOR PADDY (DIRECT SOWING)?,24 kg/acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
