Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY RAT MANAGEMENT?,"For the first three days, keep drug-free food in an artificial hiding place along the path of rats, then on the fourth day, mix 2 parts drug (zinc-phosphide) with 95 parts food, 2 parts oil, 1 part sugar.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CO 52 PADDY SPECIAL FEATURES?,"It is one of the medium and long term rice crops and is considered to be ready for harvest in 130 - 135 days. The yield is 2751 kg per acre. And for the cultivation of such rice crops, the titles (seasons) like samba, mun samba, pin samba, Bisanam, Bin Bisanam, and Taladi are suitable. has","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
