Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ADT 39 PADDY SPECIAL FEATURES?,"Produced method IR 8/ IR 20 ,Age (days) 120 - 125 ,Average yield (kg/ha) 5000 ,Weight of 1000 kernels (kg) 18 ,Grain structure medium Small variety of rice,Crop Character Medium short crop, Color of rice White, Special Characteristic Resistant to blast and leaf sheath rot.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
