Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT FOR PADDY?,"Take a vessel or drum and take 25-30 liters of water in it, add 250-300 grams of Pseudomonas and mix it, then put 25-30 kg of rice seeds and soak them for 8-12 hours and then sow them in a wet konichka crop. Tie it and keep it in a dark room for 8 hours and then sow it in the field","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
