Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE VARIETIES FOR PADDY (LATE SAMBA / THALADI)?,"ADT 38, ADT 39, TRY 1*, TRY 3*, ADT (R) 46, ADT (R) 49, CO (R) 48, CO (R) 49, CO (R) 50","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER APPLICATION (MICRO)?,Take 5 kg of rice micronutrient mixture per acre and mix it with 20 kg of sand.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY STEM BORER MANAGEMENT IN PADDY?,Mix and spray chlorpyrifos at the rate of 2 ml per liter of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SRI PADDY WATER MANAGEMENT?,"Irrigate only for wetting the soil during initial 10 days. Irrigate to a maximum depth of 2.5 cm if hairline cracks occur in the soil till the formation of inflorescence. After the stagnant water disappears, 5 cm after planting. Deeper irrigation should be increased.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY ACTIVE TILLERING STAGE FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT MEDIUM DURATION CROP?,Apply Urea 25 kg + Potash 15 kg per acre at 50 to 55 days from seedling.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASING MORE TILLERS IN PADDY?,Fertilizer mix 5 kg per acre and applied in 10 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE VARIETIES FOR PADDY SAMBA SEASON?,"White Bonny , CO 43, CR 1009, CR 1009 Sub1, ADT 38, TRY 1*, TRY 3*, ADT (R) 44, CORH 4, CO (R) 48, CO (R) 49, CO (R) 50, ADT (R) 49,TNAU Rice ADT 50,ADT 51 and Swarna Sub 1","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY PREVENT PEST OCCURRENCE FROM HOST WEEDS IN BUNDS?,"Planting away from the range,","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY MN MIXTURE APPLICATION?,Mix 5 kg of rice micro-nutrient fertilizer with 20 sand and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY VARIETY BPT SOWING SEASON & DURATION?,BPT Sowing Season August & Duration 150 Days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ADT 51 PADDY VARIETIES DURATION?,It is a long duration crop (154 days) and you can expect an average yield of 2633 kg per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEEDLING TREATMENT IN BASMATI
?","Before planting in the field, soak the roots in 15 grams of Trichoderma herginum per liter (as many liters of water as the roots of the cheese can be well submerged) for 6 hours.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR ANY PESTICIDE IN PADDY BEFORE 20 DAYS OF HARVESTING 
?","If the paddy crop is ready for harvest in the next 15-20 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SUFFICIENT TIME GAP BETWEEN THE APPLICATION OF ANY FUNGICIDE AND RAIN FOR BETTER RESULT
?","For any fungicide to be effective, there should be at least 8-10 hours between spraying and rainfall.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF PADDY WITH THEIR YIELD 
?","Advanced varieties of paddy- PR 129 (Yield- 30 quintal), PR 128 (Yield- 30.5 quintal), PR 127 (Yield- 30 quintal), PR 126 (Yield- 30 quintal), P .R 124 (Yield- 30.5 quintal), PR 123 (Yield- 29 quintal), PR 122 (Yield- 31.5 quintal), PR 121 (Yield- 30.5 quintal), PR 114 (Yield - 27.5 quintals, ), PR 113 (Yield- 28 quintals), HKR 47 (Yield- 29.5 quintals)|","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION MANAGEMENT IN PADDY AFTER BOOT STAGE OF CROP  
?","There is no need to keep water standing in the paddy during the rainy season, but the land should not feel dry, as soon as the land becomes waterlogged, it should be irrigated within 2-3 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF STEM BORER IN PADDY 
?",For prevention of stem borer in paddy/basmati 80 ml Ecotin 5% EC (Azadirachtin) 60 ml Corajan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 20 ml FEM 480 SC (Flubendamide) or 170 g Mortar 75 SG (cartop hydrochloride) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER YIELD OF PADDY 
?","For best yield of paddy, spray 1 kg NPK at 13:0:45 in 100 liters of water per acre at the time of emergence.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BLAST IN PADDY/BASMATI
?","200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) or 500 g Indophil Z-78 (Jineb 75 WP) in 200 liters of water per acre. Spray, the first spray when the crop is in bud and the second spray at the beginning of budding.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BROWN SPOT IN PADDY/BASMATI
?","Spray 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) in 200 liters of water per acre, repeat spraying after 15 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BUNT/ KARNAL BUNT IN PADDY/BASMATI
?","There is no sure solution for prevention of bunt in paddy/basmati crop.To prevent its occurrence, nitrogen fertilizers should not be applied more than recommended and if the crop is in bud and after 10 days if 200 ml tilt 25 EC (Propiconazole) can be avoided to a large extent if sprayed in 200 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF POTASH DEFICIENCY IN PADDY 
?","If there are signs of potassium deficiency during the initial growth of the paddy crop, spray 1 kg of NPK 00:00:50 in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN PADDY
?",Water the paddy crop as required. There is no need to keep the water standing continuously. You can water after 2 or 3 days when the soil absorbs water. Stop the water about 15 days before harvesting the crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION  REGARDING POOR FILLING OF GRAINS IN  PADDY CROP
?","At the time of ripening, rain and wind causes the grain to remain empty in the paddy crop","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF FUNGICIDE IN PADDY CROP
?","Before spraying the crop, check for signs of disease or you can show it to the nearest agriculturist office, if there is no disease, do not apply any fungicide.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DISCOLOURATION OF SPIKE IN PADDY?,You can spray 200 ml of folicur in the paddy when the fungus is infected,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF FOLDER AND STEM BORER IN PADDY OR RICE CROP
?","Add 170 gm mortar (cartop hydrochloride 75 SG), 20 ml FEM (flubedamide 480 SC) in 100 liters of water and spray one acre for leaf blight on basmati. For prevention of blight , spray 170 g mortar (cartop hydrochloride 75 SG) or 60 ml Corazan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 1 liter Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF NECK BLAST IN BASMATI CROP
?",Make a solution of Indofil Z-78 500 grams or 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC (Azoxystrobin + Difenconazole) in 200 liters of water and spray according to the number.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DEFICIENCY OF BORON IN PADDY CROP
?",Boron deficiency in paddy Mix 100 grams of borax in 100 liters of water and spray in one acre. Spraying is recommended only when boron deficiency occurs.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETIES OF RICE 
?","New varieties of rice- Bala,Kiran,Krishna,Padma","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH AND CONTROL NITROGEN DEFICIENCY AFTER APPLIED THE RECOMMENDED AMOUNT OF UREA TO THE PADDY CROP
?",Spray 1 kg NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre to meet crop growth and nitrogen deficiency after applying the recommended amount of urea to the paddy crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BLAST IN PADDY/BASMATI
?","Spray 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) in 200 liters of water per acre, first spray at crop emergence and second Spray at the beginning of the budding.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BUNT IN PADDY 
?",To prevent bunt in paddy apply only recommended amount of nitrogen fertilizer or 200 ml Tilt/Bumper 25 EC (propiconazole) in 200 liters of water first spray at emergence and second spray after 10 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF HISPA IN PADDY 
?","For the control of paddy hispa, spray 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos or 800 ml of Acalx in 100 liters of water for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF PADDY HISPA
?",Spray 800 ml of Acalx 25 EC (Quinlphas) or 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SHEATH BLIGHT IN PADDY/BASMATI 
?",150 ml Pulsar 24 SC (Thifluzamide) or 26.8 g Epic 75 WG (Hexaconazole) or 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%)) for prevention of stem leaf blight in paddy/Basmati. Or spray 200 ml Folicer 25 EC (Tabuconazole) or 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) or 200 ml Monseron 250 SC (Pencicuron) in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAIL ABOUT THE PR127 OF PADDY 
?","PR 127 (yield-30 quintals, time-137 days, height 104 cm).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE GAP BETWEEN TWO SPRAY IN PADDY
?",There should be a gap of at least 2-3 days between the spraying of the elements and the fungicide in the crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR CONTROL OF FUNGAL DISEASE IN PADDY BEFORE 20-25 DAYS OF HARVESTING 
?","If the paddy crop is ready for harvest in the next 20-25 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SUFFICIENT TIME GAP BETWEEN THE APPLICATION OF ANY CHEMICAL AND RAIN FOR BETTER RESULT
?",For the best effect of any medicine there should be a gap of at least 6-8 hours between spraying and rain,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOW OR RED COLOUR OF TIPS OF LEAVES IN PADDY
?","Due to change in the weather, the tips of paddy leaves start to curl, so there is no need for any special medicine.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOTAL FERTILIZER APPLICATION IN WHEAT CROP
?","Fertilizers for wheat - 90 kg urea, 55 kg DAP or 155 kg super phosphate and 40 kg muriate of potash (in Gurdaspur, Hoshiarpur, Ropar and Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar districts) or 20 kg muriate of potash (rest of PUNJAB) Add as per soil test report in districts)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR ANY PESTICIDE IN PADDY/BASMATI BEFORE 15-20 DAYS OF HARVESTING 
?","If the paddy/basmati crop is ready for harvest in the next 15-20 days, no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY FOR CONTROL OF FUNGAL DISEASE IN PADDY BEFORE 15-20 DAYS OF HARVESTING 
?","If the paddy crop is ready for harvest in the next 15-20 days, then no spray is required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PUSA DECOMPOSER CAPSULES
?","To prepare Pusa Kopost capsules, boil 150 gm of old jaggery in water, cool the jaggery, add 5 liters of water and 150 grams of besan, then mix 4 pusa capsules in the prepared solution, after that, drink it for 5 days and keep it in a refrigerator. After this, 10 quintals of straw can be diluted with the prepared 5 liter solution. For more information about Pusa Capsules contact -IARI Pusa New Delhi Contact -01125847375","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RODENT IN PADDY
?","To prepare rat bait, mix 1 kg of grain, 20 ml of vegetable oil, 20 g of sugar and 25 g of zinc phosphide and keep near the pit.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LAND REQUIRES FOR PADDY NURSERY
?",Sow 8 kg of seed in 6.5 marla (1.23 kg per marla) to plant paddy in one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF STOMP WEEDICIDE
?","The best time to apply stop herbicide is within 3 days of paddy planting, repeated application of stop herbicide is not recommended.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER GROWTH OF BOTTLE GOURD CROP
?","For good growth, spray 1 kg NPK at 19:19:19 per 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WEED IN PADDY 
?","For weed control in paddy, apply 100 ml Nomini Gold/Macho (Bespyribac-Sodium 10 SC) for swack grass or 400 ml Rystar 6.7 (Finoxaprop) for spider grass in 150 liters of water 20-25 days after sowing. Make a solution and spray it in one acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN PADDY NURSERY 
?","Apply 60 kg super phosphate, 26 kg urea, 40 kg zinc 21% or 25 kg zinc 33% before sowing and 26 kg urea per acre after 15 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME Cultural Practices FOR TRANSPLANTATION OF PADDY
?","Before planting the pumpkin, level the field with a laser harrow very fine and well so that the fertilizer and other materials can be used properly and fix all the bumps. Planting good pumpkin will reduce the number of weeds and will save water because it will reduce water seepage into the ground.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NURSERY SOWING AND TRANSPLANTING TIME OF BASMATI VARIETIES
?","Pusa Basmati 1718,Pusa Basmati 1121,Pusa Basmati 1637,PUNJAB Basmati-1,PUNJAB Basmati 2,PUNJAB Basmati-3,PUNJAB Basmati 4. July is","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN LAND WHERE UPPER LAYER IS REMOVED OR ADDED
?","Apply fertilizers based on soil test in the field from which the soil is tilled or placed, add green manure or manure every year, check the signs of the weeds and spray a mixture of nutrients for good yield.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY VARIETY PUSA-44
?","Pusa 44 is an uncertified variety of paddy, it is more susceptible to diseases and pests and takes longer to mature.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF PADDY FOR DIRECT SOWING 
?",Use 8-10 kg of seed for direct sowing of paddy,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PADDY NURSERY
?",Sow paddy field in May 10-30,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PR 126 PADDY VARIETY
?",The sowing time of PR 126 is from 20th May to 5th June and 25-30 days old seedlings are planted in the field.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT CAN WE USE THE SEED OF PADDY FROM PREVIOUS YEAR CROP
?",Parmal paddy seed can be saved for the next year but if the crop has any seed borne disease then the seed cannot be saved.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COLLECT A SOIL SAMPLE FOR SOIL TESTING FOR FERTILIZER RECOMMENDATION
?","To take a soil sample to determine the need for fertilizers, remove the grass from the top layer of the soil, make a 'V' shape with the help of a hoe to a depth of 6 inches and dig an inch thick layer evenly on one side. Take 5-7 samples from one field and mix the soil of all the samples at one place and take half kg of it as soil sample to the soil testing laboratory.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DATE ANNOUNCED BY PUNJAB GOVERNMENT FOR TRANSPLANTING OF PADDY 
?",The PUNJAB government has announced that paddy harvesting will be done from June 10,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAIL ABOUT THE VARIETIES OF PADDY PR-127, PR-128 AND PR-129
?","Paddy Varieties PR 128 (yield-30.5 quintal time-141 days, height-110 cm), PR 129 (yield-30 quintal time-138 days, height-105 cm) and PR 127 (Yield-30 quintals, time-137 days, height 104 cm:).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAIL ABOUT VARIETIES OF BASMATI 
?","Varieties of Basmati - -PUNJAB Basmati 7 (2021) (yield-19 quintals, time-131 days), Pusa Basmati 1121 (yield-13.7 quintals, height-120 cm:, time-137 days), Pusa Basmati 1509 ( Yield-15.7 quintal, height-92 cm, time-120 days), Pusa Basmati 1637 (yield-17.5 quintal, height-109 cm, time-138 days), Pusa Basmati 1718 (yield-17 quintal, time -144 days, Height-121 cm), PUNJAB Basmati 5 (Yield-15 quintal, Height-112 cm, Time-137 days), PUNJAB Basmati 4 (Yield-17 quintal, Height-96 cm, Time-146 days, PUNJAB Basmati 3 (Yield-16 quintal, Height-105 cm, Time-139 days), PUNJAB Basmati 2 (Yield-12.6 quintal, Height-125 cm, Time-140 days), C SR 30 (Yield-13.5 quintal, Height-139 cm, Time-142 days), Basmati 386 (Yield-9 quintal, Height-180 cm, Time-155 days), Basmati 370 (Yield-12 quintal) , height-165 cm, time-150 days)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAIL OF CR-212 VARIETY OF PADDY 
?","CR 212 variety of paddy is not recommended by PUNJAB Agriculture University, Ludhiana, contact the respective dealer for information.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN DIRECT SEEDED PADDY/BASMATI IN DRY FIELDS
?",If paddy is sown in dry field then apply first irrigation immediately after sowing and second irrigation after 4-5 days and subsequent irrigation at 5-7 days interval depending on soil type and weather.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE METHOD OF LAND PREPARATION FOR DIRECT SOWING AFTER RAUNI 
?","To prepare the field, after plowing twice with Taviyans, one should plow and harrow again, after that level the field with a laser harrow and water the field, after that one plow and harrow Sow after","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PRE-EMERGENCE WEED MANAGEMENT IN DIRECT SOWING OF PADDY/BASMATI 
?","To prevent weed growth in paddy and basmati direct seeded fields, spray 1 liter of Stomp 30 EC (pendimethalin) in 200 liters of water per acre within 2 days of sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PRE-EMERGENCE WEED MANAGEMENT IN PADDY/ BASMATI NURSERY
?",62.5 ml of Sofit 37.5 EC (Pertylachlor+Sefner) after 3 days or 150 ml of Butachlor 50 EC after 7 days mixed with 7-8 kg of sand per kanal to prevent weed growth in paddy/basmati plantation. give up,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED AND FERTILIZERS REQUIREMENT FOR PADDY/ BASMATI NURSERY IF THE NURSERY IS SOWN IN 6.5 MARLAS (SUFFICIENT FOR 1 ACRE)
?","If paddy field is sown in 6.5 marla (1770 sq ft) then 8 kg seed is required and for this apply 1050 g urea, 2.5 kg superphosphate, 1625 g zinc sulphate 21% or 1 kg zinc sulphate 33% per 6.5 marla at sowing. and add 1050 kg urea after 15 days and 30 days (if required)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED AND LAND REQUIREMENT FOR SOWING OF PADDY/ BASMATI NURSERY
?",Sow 8 kg of seed per acre of paddy in 6.5 marla (about 160 square meters or 1770 square feet).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF PADDY FOR DIRECT SOWING 
?","For direct sowing of paddy, the seed quantity should be 8-10 kg of seed per acre, do not use more than 10 kg of seed because it will make the crop more dense and not a good fertilizer.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPECIAL VARIETY OF PADDY SUITABLE UNDER POOR QUALITY IRRIGATION WATER
?","No particular variety of paddy is recommended in poor water fields, PR 127 variety should be avoided and gypsum should be used based on water test report for other varieties.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF BASMATI WITH THEIR YIELD
?","Light sensitive varieties of Basmati- PUNJAB Basmati 7 (Yield-19 quintal), PUNJAB Basmati 5 (Yield- 15 quintal), PUNJAB Basmati 4 (Yield-17 quintal), CSR (Yield-13.5), PUNJAB Basmati 3 (Yield-16 quintal), Basmati 386 (Yield-9 quintal) and Basmati 370 (Yield-12 quintal)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE IN DIRECT SEEDED RICE
?","For direct sowing of paddy, 8-10 kg of seed should be applied per acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL BLIGHT IN PADDY
?",Spray 200 ml Folicure + 30 gm streptomycin or 6 gm sutrareptocycline in 200 liters water for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BACTERIAL LEAF BLIGHT OF PADDY
?",Spray 80 g of Nativo 75 WG (Trifloxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole 50%) in 200 liters of water for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BORON DEFICIENCY IN PADDY 
?",Spray 100 grams of boron in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SHEATH BLIGHT IN PADDY/BASMATI?",150 ml Pulsar 24 SC (Thifluzamide) or 26.8 g Epic 75 WG (Hexaconazole) or 400 ml Galileo Whey 18.76 SC (Peoxystrobin 7%+ Propiconazole 12%) for prevention of stem leaf blight disease in Paddy/Basmati. ) or 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC ((azoxystrobin 18.2%+ difenaconazole 11.4%) or 200 ml Tilt 25 EC (propiconazole) or 200 ml Foliker 25 EC (tabuconazole) or 80 g Nativo 75 WG (trifluxystrobin 25% + Tabuconazole 50%) or 320 ml Luscher 37.5 SE (Flujilazole 25% + Carbendazim 12.5%) or 200 ml Monseron 250 SC (Pencicuron) in 200 liters of water and spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY IN PADDY BEFORE 15-20 DAYS OF HARVESTING?",The crop is ready to harvest in the next 15-20 days so no spraying is required.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO CONTROL ADULTS OF STEM BORER AND LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY?","Do not spray based on the number of leafhoppers and cabbage moths in the field, start spraying at 10% infestation of leafhoppers and 5% infestations of cabbage moths.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO  CONTROL OF STEM BORER AND LEAF FOLDER  IN PADDY S?,Spray 170 gm mortar (Cartop Hydrochloride 75 SG) or 60 ml Corazan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 1 liter Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN  BASMATI 1637,1121 & 1718?","Basmati 1637,1121 & 1718 Fertilizers - 36 kg Urea, 27 kg DAP or 75 kg Super Phosphate and 20 kg MOP per acre. If DAP has been applied in rubber crop then do not apply in kharif crop, use potash only on the basis of soil test, apply urea in equal proportion, apply in 3rd and 6th week.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION PROCESS IN PADDY AFTER BOOT STAGE OF CROP?,"There is no need to keep water standing in the paddy for a short period of time, but the land should not feel dry, as soon as the land becomes waterlogged, it should be irrigated within 2-3 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF FUNGICIDE AND INSECTICIDE?,Never mix fungicides and insecticides.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SHEATH BLIGHT IN PADDY?,150 ml Pulsar 24 SC (Thifluzamide) OR 26.8 g Epic 75 WG (Hexaconazole) OR 400 ml Galileo Whey 18.76 SC (Peoxystrobin 7%+ Propiconazole 12%) OR For prevention of stem leaf blight disease in Paddy/Basmati. 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC ((Azoxystrobin 18.2%+ Difenconazole 11.4%) or 200 ml Tilt 25 EC (Propiconazole) or 200 ml Foliker 25 EC (Tabuconazole) or 80 g Nativo 75 WG (Trifluoxystrobin 25%+Tabuconazole) 50%) or 320 ml Luscher 37.5 SE (Flujilazole 25%+Carbendazim 12.5%) or 200 ml Monseron 250 SC (Pencicuron) in 200 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PEST IN CROPS?,You can apply chloropyriphos 20% EC to kill insects in the field,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE LAST IRRIGATION IN PADDY?,Apply last water to paddy 10-15 days before harvest depending on soil type.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APHID CONTROL IN PADDY?,Spray 1 liter of chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 100 liters of water for oil control in paddy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WEED IN DIRECT SOWING PADDY?,"For control of weeds in direct sowing of paddy, 1 liter Stomp 30 EC can be mixed in 200 liters of water and sprayed per acre within two days of sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN DIRECT SEEDED RICE?,"Application of fertilizers in direct sowing of paddy - 130 kg Urea, 27 kg DAP and 20 kg MOP per acre. If DAP has been applied in rubber crop then do not apply in kharif crop and use potash only based on soil test. Apply urea in three equal parts, 6 and 9 weeks after sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL ZINC DEFICIENCY IN PADDY  NURSERY?,Spray 5 grams of Zinc Sulphate 21% per liter of water to meet the deficiency of zinc on paddy and basmati.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BEST SUITABLE VARIETY OF PADDY FOR DIRECT SOWING?,Parmal paddy variety PR 126 is most suitable for direct sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH OF PADDY/BASMATI NURSERY?,Recommended Fertilizers for Good Growth of Paddy/Basmati Plant If still growth is not good then add 125g NPK 19:19:19 in 12.5 liters of water (10g per liter) per kanal. Spray sparingly,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF IRON DEFICIENCY IN PADDY/BASMATI?,Spray 125 g of ferrous sulphate (19%) in 15 liters of water per canal.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ZINC DEFICIENCY IN PADDY/BASMATI NURSERY?,Spray 5 gm zinc sulphate heptahydrate 21% or 3 gm zinc sulphate monohydrate 33% per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ANY FUNGICIDE SPRAY ON PADDY?,If there is no problem on paddy then no spray is needed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN WE MIX  INSECTICIDE AND FUNGICIDE?,Never use fungicides and insecticides together,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY TO CONTROL OF STEM BORER?,"If the stem borer is attacked when the paddy grain is hard, then no spray is needed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE HELPLINE NUMBER FOR COMPLAINT AGAINST THE DEALER WHO SALES DUPLICATE SEEDS, FERTILIZERS AND PESTICIDES?","The helpline number to complain about dealers selling fake seeds, fertilizers and pesticides is 84373-12288.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BPH , WBPH AND GRASSHOPPER?",120 gm Chas (Pymetrozine 50 WG) or 40 ml Confidor (Imidacloprid 200 SL (17.8 % w/w)) or 800 ml Acalx (Quinalphos 25% EC) or 1 liter Chlorpyrifos 20 EC to 100 liters of water for control of tide and oil. Dissolve in and spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN DIRECT SEEDED PADDY/BASMATI SOWN AFTER PRE-SOWING IRRIGATION?,"If paddy is sown in field, first irrigation should be done after 21 days of sowing and after that subsequent irrigation should be done at 5-7 days interval depending on soil type and weather. If done in dry field, apply first irrigation immediately after sowing and second irrigation after 4-5 days and subsequent irrigation at 5-7 days interval depending on soil type and weather.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETY OF PADDY PR-126?,"Advanced variety of paddy- PR 126 (Yield- 30 quintal, days- 123, height- 102 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEBAD AND RAINY WEATHER LEADS TO POOR FILLING OF GRAINS IN PADDY CROP?,"At the time of ripening, rain and wind in the paddy crop causes the grains to remain empty and stained","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FAVOUABLE TEMPRATURE FOR PADDY IN ANTHSIS STAGE?,The temperature should be 30-33 degrees during the ripening of paddy,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DILA AND MOTHA OR BOOTI  IN PADDY ANDWATER MANAGEMENT?,"20-25 days after sowing, 8 grams of Almix (metsulfuran methyl + chlorimuron ethyl) or 30 grams of Algrip 20 wg (metsulfuran) dissolved in 150 liters of water per acre. Spray in, do not water for a day after spraying","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME POOR FILLING OF GRAINS IN  PADDY CROP?,"At the time of ripening, rain and wind causes the grain to remain empty in the paddy crop","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BUNT IN PADDY?,Apply only the recommended amount of nitrogen fertilizer to protect paddy from bunt disease,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAIL ABOUT DBW 187 AND RECOMMENDATION?,"The average yield of wheat variety DBW-187 is 22.6 quintals per acre, it matures in 148 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY NURSERY FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT	?",Spray 2 grams of DAP with a liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY  SWARNA SUB1 VARIETY DURATION (DAYS)?,Duration: 155 - 160 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY CR 1009& SWARNA SUB1  VARIETY SOWING SEASON?,Time: (August),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME EAR HEAD BUG MANAGEMENT IN PADDY	?",Spray 2 ml of malathion with one liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW DO YOU USE HUMIC ACID IN PADDY?,The optimal formula is the solution of humic acid 0.03 percent and it should be sprayed earlier at the time of tillerage or it is better at the time of tillerage and rice booting stage.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHICH IS THE BEST PADDY VARIETY?,"Paddy Pooja Gold. 
Hy Paddy 13555. 
Research Paddy Shree-101
Hybrid Paddy 7576
Hy Paddy 788
Paddy Bharti
Paddy Geet
Research Paddy Shree-101.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ADT 39 PADDY  SPECIAL FEATURES?,"Created Method - I R8/ I R20 Survey paddy, crop nature - medium puddle, color of rice - whitening, special characteristic","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY NURSERY AREA REQUIRE FOR ONE ACRE PLANTING?,The nursery area required for planting one acre of paddy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL RICE GUNDHI BUGS?,"Fermented snails as a bait controlled the gundhi bugs effectively, demonstrated by the lowest post treatment population, per cent grain damage (8.37%) and highest grain yield (2279 Kg/ha) of paddy cv.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MICRO NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN PADDY  ?,Use 5 kg of micronutrients per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT	?",Use 5 kg of urea 25 kg + potash 15 kg + neem.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY FERTILIZER (MN) MANAGEMENT	?",Use the micronutrients a mixture of 5 kg fifteen days per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEPADDY VARIETY CR 1009 SUB 1 VARIETY?,"Information on Paddy CR 1009 Sub 1 variety: 155 days, yields 2320 kg / acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEPADDY ACTIVE TILLERING STAGE FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Urea 32 kg + potash 8 kg per acre from seedlings in 55 to 60 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MAIZE BORER?,Spray 40 ml of Corajan mixed with 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF MAIZE CROP AFTER HEAVY IRRIGATION?,Spray 2 kg of urea mixed with 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF MAIZE BORER?,Spray 40 ml of Corazan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) mixed with 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF MAIZE?,"Recommended varieties ofMaize- J-1006, J-1007 are I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH OF MAIZE CROP?,"For crop growth, spray 1 kg of NPK19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF ARMY-WORM AND SILK CUTTER IN MAIZE CROP?,Spray 40 ml of Corazan (chlorantraniliprole 18.5 SC) or 80 grams of Proclam in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME FORMAIZE?,The sowing time forMaize is from March to mid-September,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR INMAIZE?,Spray 16 ml of Decis 2.8 EC (Deltamethrin) in 20 liters of water for prevention of scurvy.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF JASSID, THRIPS, PYRILLA, GRAY WEEVIL AND LEAF-FEEDING INSECTS INMAIZE?",You can spray 200 ml of Rogor mixed with 50-60 liters of water for sap sucking insects inMaize.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MAIZE BORER INMAIZE?,Spray 40 ml of Corajan mixed with 60-80 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT OFMAIZE?,ForMaize apply 10 tonnes of manure fifteen days before and 50 kg urea at sowing and 50 kg urea 4-5 weeks after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OFMAIZE?,The sowing period ofMaize (J-1006) is from the first week of March to mid-September.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEMAIZE VARIETY AND SOWING TIME?,"fodder maize variety and sowing time is J 1007, J 1006 and sowing time is till mid September.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL INMAIZE?,"For weed control inMaize, 800 g of atrazine in medium or heavy soils and 500 g of atrazine in 200 liters of water in light soils can be sprayed within 2 days of sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL ON MAIZE?,Spray 105 grams of Lodis in 200 liters of water within 20 days of sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF ARMY WORM IN MAIZE?,Spray 40 ml of Corgen or 80 ml of Decis in 80 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF FALL ARMYWORM INMAIZE?,Spray 0.4 ml Corazan 18.5 SC (chlorantraniliprole) per liter of water to control fall armyworm in forage corn. Use of 120 liters of water per acre for up to 20 days crop I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETY OF MAIZE SUITABLE FOR SOWING IN SEPTEMBER MONTH?,There is no type of ripe corn for sowing in September,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OFMAIZE?,Use 30 kg of seed per acre for fodder corn.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF BLIGHT IN MAIZE?,Spray 200 grams of Indofil M-45 mixed with 100 liters of water to prevent blight disease in maize.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF ZINC DEFICIENCY IN MAIZE?,Spray 1200 g zinc sulphate 21% + 600 g quicklime or 750 g zinc sulphate 33% + 375 g quicklime in 200 liters of water to meet zinc deficiency in maize.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOBACCO CATERPILLAR IN MAIZE?,Apply 400 ml of Eclux in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF SPRING MAIZE?,The sowing period for outdoor maize is between January 20 and February 15,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING TIME OF SPRING MAIZE?,Spring corn sowing time is from January 20 to February 15,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO MAKE SILAGE FOR CATTLE FEED?,"Dig a pit 10 meters long, 3 meters wide and 1.5 meters deep and chop the harvested crop to the extent of 5 to 8 cm and fill the pit, this pit can hold 350 to 400 quintals of green fodder. Close the pit well from the top. For this purpose, a plastic sheet can be spread over the buried fodder and its edges can be closed with manured soil. So that there is no air in it, put soil on it and cover it and monitor it from time to time so that if any crack occurs then it should be covered. After exactly 45 days after that the pickle will be ready if every half meter surface of fodder is covered. Achar is good if it is pressed well","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETY OF MAIZE?,"Recommended varieties ofMaize- J-1006, J-1007 are I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE AND SEED TREATMENT OFMAIZE?,Apply 30 kg of seed per acre for Maize,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MOTHA WEED CONTROL IN MAIZE?,Sspray 105 ml of Tembotrione (Laudiso or 400 ml of 2;4-D sodium salt (58%) dissolved in 150 liters of water per acre of crops older than 25 days. yes,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN MAIZE?,Dissolve Atrataf 50 WP (Atrazine) 800 grams in 200 liters of water and spray in two days of sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO CONTROL CATERPILLAR OR GRASS HOPPER IN MAIZE FODDER?,You can spray 800 ml Acalx (quinalphos) 25 EC in 100 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YIELD OF VARIETIES OFMAIZE?,The average fodder yield of J-1007 variety ofMaize is 168 quintals per acre and the average fodder yield of J-1006 variety ofMaize is 165 quintals per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN MAIZE IN STANDING CROP?,"For control of weeds in maize crop after 20-25 days, spray 105 ml of Laudis 420 SC (Tanbotrine) in 150 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PHOSPHORUS DEFICIENCY IN MAIZE CROP?,Spray 1 kg of NPK(0:52:34) in 100 liters of water for one acre(@10 grams per liter) to complete phosphorus deficiency in maize.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DISEASES STEM ROT?,Mix 500 grams of Bavistin in 200 liters of water and spray per acre to control stem rot disease in maize.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Urea 60 kg + Potash 25 kg per acre should be applied 30 days after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT (60 DAYS)?,Urea 30 kg per acre should be applied 60 days after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE FERTILIZER (MN) MANAGEMENT?,5 kg of micronutrient mixture should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RESISTANT TO FALL ARMY WORM VARIETIES (FOR MAIZE)?,There are no resistant varieties,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE SEED TREATMENT AND WATER IS ADDED?,Biopesticide Bavaria Baciana 10gm/kg seed mixed with water and treated,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREVENT FALL ARMY WORM IN MAIZE?,"All the farmers should sow at the same time, apply 100 kg of neem per acre in the last plowing, monitor the movement of insects by using one solar lamp trap and 12 attractor traps per hectare, plantain, sunflower, sesame, sorghum and marigold crops as cover crops, sorghum, Increasing the number of beneficial insects by growing algal intercrops.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEMIYA LIKE PESTICIDE INFORMATION?,Find out what the drug is,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HYDROPONICS GOOD SEEDS AVAILABILITY INFORMATION?,Consult the nearest agriculture department,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE SEED TREATMENT (PRECAUTION FALL ARMY WORM)?,Treat biopesticide Bavaria Paciana 10 gm/kg seed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WAITING PERIOD FOR PESTICIDE SPRAY?,The interval for spraying should be at least 10-12 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FALL ARMY WORM IN MAIZE?,Spray Indoxacarb 8 ml in 10 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT FOR MAIZE?,Atrazine 400 grams per acre in 200 liters of water and spray on 3rd day.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE SEED RATE AND SPACING?,8 kg seed required per acre and 8 kg seed required per acre 2 feet per row and 25 cm per plant,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT IN MAIZE?,Apply imidacloprid 70 WS 5 g/kg as seed treatment and sow.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE SUITABLE SEASON?,Puratasipattam (September - October) is best for sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING SEASON FOR MAIZE?,July - August,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FALL ARMY WORM MANAGEMENT?,"Plantain, sunflower, marigold, sesame can be planted as future crops.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME STEM BORER MANAGEMENT IN MAIZE (8 DAYS)?,Mix neem oil 3 ml + sticky liquid 1 ml in one liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT (RAINFED)?,Manure 5 tons + Urea 16 kg + DAP 26 kg + Potash 19 kg should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE VARIETIES INFORMATION?,"Go 6, Go 1, Go (PC) 1, Gohach (M) 4.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE MAIZE VARIETIES?,"Co 1, CoH(M) 4 and DWB Maize hybrid Co 6","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME AVERAGE YIELD FOR COHM6 MAIZE VARIETY?,2960 kg/acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT FOR MAIZE (RAINFED)?,Urea 26 kg + Super Phosphate 75 kg + Potash 20 kg/acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOP FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT IN MAIZE (RAINFED)?,Urea 26 kg/acre should be applied on 30th day after sowing (if sufficient moisture is available).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOP FERTILIZERS FOR PLANTING TREES?,Apply 10 kg of compost or half a kg of heat per pit.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER AND IRRIGATION MANAGEMENT IN MAIZE?,Ensure that water does not stagnate and provide drainage if it does.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE SOWING SEASON AND VARIETIES?,"Season : July - August Varieties: Go 6, Go 1, Go (PC) 1, Gohach (M) 4.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ARMY WORM IN MAIZE?,Indoxacarb should be mixed with 1 ml of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FALL ARMY WORM CONTROL IN MAIZE?,Spinodoram (Delicate) mixed and sprayed at 0.9 ml/l of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAIZE BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Manure 10 tons + Urea 30 kg + Super Phosphate 150 kg + Potash 30 kg + Zinc Sulphate 15 kg should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SHOOT BORER ON MAIZE?,Spray Corazan 5 ml/15 liters of water.(Chlorantraniliprole 15.8% EC),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON MAIZE?,(Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) should be sprayed with clean 30 g / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREPARATION OF MURGHAS?,"Method of preparation of murghas :- Charapikas are cut into small pieces by Kadbakutti machine when they are 50% flower. A ratio of 4:1 is used to make chicken from monoecious and dioecious crops. It makes delicious chicken. One kg of urea is mixed with 100 liters of water and this mixture is sprinkled on the charakutti while making murghas from monocots. While making murghas from the dicotyledonous crop, a mixture of jaggery solution is sprinkled on it. For this, one kg of jaggery is dissolved in 100 liters of water and a solution is prepared. After each layer the solution mentioned above is sprinkled. A layer of fodder is pressed while filling the pit, so no air remains in the fodder. In this way, the pit is filled by layer upon layer. They cover it with the help of dried grass or kadaba. A mixture of dung and soil is then plastered and given a spherical shape. After about two months, good, tasty and nutritious chicken is produced.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF AMERICAN FALL WORM IN MAIZE?,Control of American Armyworm on Maize Crop :- Lambada-cyhothothin 150 ml per acre in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR ATTACK ON MAIZE?,Preventive measures for control of aphids on Maize - Neemboli extract should be taken in 30 ml /15 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR MAIZE?,Maize -Fertilizer at sowing- 10:26:26 50 kg per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Maize,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF AMERICAN ARMY FALL WORM ON MAIZE CROP?,For American armyworm control on maize crop :- Emamectin benzoate 7 g per 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOTAL FERTILIZER APPLICATION IN RAPESEED-TORIA?,"Apply Urea 55 kg, Super Phosphate 50 kg before sowing for senju conditions for torii crop.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF RAYA?,"Improved varieties of rye - RCH-1 (Yield-9.2 quintals/acre), PHR-126 (Yield-9.1 quintals/acre), Giriraj (Yield-7.7 quintals/acre), RLC-3 ( Canola variety) (yield-7.3 quintals/acre), PBR-357 (yield-8.5 quintals/acre), PBR-210 (yield-6 quintals/acre), PBR-97 (yield-5.2 quintals /acre), PBR-91 (Yield-8.1 quintals/acre), RLM-619 (Yield-8 quintals/acre).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF GOBHI SARSON?,Sowing Time - October 10 to October 30,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF GOBHI SARSON?,"Improved Varieties - PGSH 1707 (Yield-8.8 quintals/acre Time-162 days) GSC-7, GSC-6, Hyola PAC 401, GSL-2, GS L1","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF INTERCROPPING OF TORIA AND GOBHI SARSON?,The time of mixed sowing of Toriya and Saron is the second-third week of September.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FERTILIZER DOSE IN RAYA?,"Apply 45 kg urea and 75 kg superphosphate per acre before sowing for Raya,African mustard. Add 45 kg urea to first water and add potash as per soil test.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN MUSTARD CROP?,No herbicide is recommended for weed control in mustard crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WEEDS IN ZERO TILLAGE SOWING OF RAYA?,Weed Control - Spray 500 ml of gramexone 24 SL in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE APPLICATION OF UREA BY FOLIAR METHOD?,"After applying the recommended amount of urea in mustard, spray 2% urea (2 kg urea in 100 liters of water) per acre to prevent yellowing of mustard.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF TARAMIRA?,Improved Varieties of Taramira- TMLC-2,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SULFUR DEFICIENCY IN MUSTARD?,"Add 100 kg of gypsum per acre at the time of land preparation in sulfur deficient soils. If the phosphorus content in the form of single superphosphate is given to the wheat crop, gypsum is not required and if sulfur deficiency is found, gypsum can be added to the standing crop as well. Or spray 500 grams of soluble sulfur 80% in 200 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN MUSTARD CROP?,"No herbicide recommendation in mustard crop, you can do weeding hoeing in mustard crop to control weeds.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH OF MUSTARD CROP?,"For mustard growth, spray 1 KG powder NPK (17:44:00) in 100 liters of water for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NIPPING IN MUSTARD CROP?,"Do not break the dirt of the mustard, doing so does not give much benefit in the yield","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MUSTARD SAWFLY IN MUSTARD (TORIA)?,"For the prevention of gray borer in Toria Saron, dilute 250 ml of Acalx (Quinlfas 25 EC) in 80 liters of water and spray per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN MUSTARD CROP?,NPK 17:44:00 (Phosphate 44% & Nitrogen 17 %) Dose in mustard crop 1 kg per acre dilute in 100 liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITE RUST IN MUSTARD?,Spray 250 grams of Ridomil Gold (Metalaxal 4% + Mencozeb 64 WP) in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PROVIDE SOLUTION FOR CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN MUSTARD CROP?,For control of root rot broadcast saafilizer (carbendazim + mencozeb) 500 gram mixed with sand,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PHOSPHORUS DEFICIENCY IN MUSTARD?,"NPK 12:61:00 can be used to meet phosphorus deficiency in mustard, just spray 1 kg in 100 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THRIPS IN MUSTARD CONTROL?,Spray 200 ml of Rogor (Dimethoate 30 EC) in 100 liters of water per acre to control aphids.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MATURITY PERIOD OF MUSTARD VARIETY AND YIELD?,Maturity period of variety PGSH 1707 is 162 and yield 8.8 quintal per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT IN MUSTARD?,It is not recommended to sow mustard seeds after modification,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF MUSTARD?,"Improved Mustard Varieties - PGSH 1707 (Yield-8.8 quintals/acre time-162 days) GSC-7 (Yield-8.9 quintals/acre time-154 days), GSC-6 (Yield- 6.10 quintal/acre time-145 days), Hyola PAC 401, GSL-2, GSL-1","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED DEPTH OF MUSTARD?,Mustard seeds should be sown 4 to 5 cm deep,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES  OF MUSTARD?,"Advanced varieties of mustard RH-30, T-59, RH-8113, RB-50, RH 8812, RH 781, RH-819, RH 9304, RH 9801, RH 0406, RB 9901, RH-0749, RH-761","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF TORIA?,"Improved varieties of Toray - TL-17 (Yield-5.2 quintals/acre), TL-15 (Yield-4.5 quintals/acre).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,"	Water Management	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN OILSEED CROPS?,"Sow toria crop at flowering and Raya, African mustard first watering after 3-4 weeks and second watering at flowering.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Weed Management,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN MUSTARD CROP?",No herbicide is recommended for weed control in mustard crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF MUSTARD DUE TO HEAVY IRRIGATION?",Spray 2% urea (2 kg urea in 100 liters of water) per acre to prevent mustard yellowing after heavy waterlogging.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF AFRICAN SARSON IS PC 6.?,Improved varieties of African mustard - PC-6,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOTAL FERTILIZER APPLICATION IN RAPESEED-RAYA FOR BARANI?,Apply 33 kg urea and 50 kg super phosphate at the time of sowing for rainfed conditions of Raya.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF RAYA AND AFRICAN SARSON AND DAYS TO MATURE?,Sowing time of Raya and African mustard is from mid-October to mid-November. These varieties take about 145 to 150 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FIELD PREPARATION FOR THE SOWING METHOD OF MUSTARD?,"Plow the field 2 to 3 times as needed to sow Raya and after each ploughing, make sure to turn the soil.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF GOBHI SARSON?","Improved Varieties - PGSH 1707 (Yield-8.8 quintals/acre Time-162 days) GSC-7, GSC-6, Hyola PAC 401, GSL-2, GS L1","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,"
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF GOBHI SARSON?",October 10 to October 30,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF GOBHI SARSON?,Seed quantity of oilseed crops is 1.5 kg per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL SHOOT BORER IN SUGARCANE?,"Spray 10 kg Regent 0.3g (Fipronil) or Padan 4g (Cartop Hydrochloride) mixed with 20 kg sand or 45 ml imidaclod 17.8 SL or 2 liters Chloropephos 20 EC at 400 Dissolve in a liter of water and spray. Apply about 20,000 eggs per acre of Corcyra pre-parasitized for seven days by the friendly insect Trichogramma chilonis between mid-April and June.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MID-LATE MATURING VARIETIES OF SUGARCANE?,"Medium maturing varieties of sugarcane COPB 93,COPB 94, CO 238, COPB 91, COJ 88","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RED ROT IN SUGARCANE CROP?,"Plant disease free sugarcane only, do not plant sugarcane in the field where there is disease, remove the diseased plants from the field and plant them in the non-cultivating field.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PYRILLA IN SUGARCANE?,Spray 600 ml of chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 400 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FERTILIZERS USED IN SEEDED CROP OF SUGARCANE?,"Apply 8 tons of manure to the seed crop of kamad 15 days before, add 130 kg of urea in two parts, first part after the germination of kamad, first water with Laina, add the second part in May to June. Add DAP and potash as per soil test","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT IN SUGARCANE?,"To improve the root of the crop, soak the kamad seeds in 250ml tilt 25EC solution in 100 liters of water and take out immediately.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN SUGARCANE AUTUMN SEASON?,"Apply 195 kg urea in autumn fall in three parts, first part at sowing, second part in March and third part in April.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN SUGARCANE?,"Spray 800 grams of 2,4-D sodium salt 80 WP or 400 ml of 2,4-D amine salt 58 SL (post emergence) in 200 liters of water for weed control in Kamad.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MICRONUTRIENT SPRAY IN SUGARCANE?,Micronutrient mixture should be mixed with 5 grams per liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUGARCANE FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT INFORMATION?,5 kg of micronutrient mixture should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GRASSY SHOOT DISEASE MANAGEMENT IN SUGARCANE?,Dimethoate 2 ml per liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME EARLY SHOOT BORER MANAGEMENT IN SUGARCANE?,Spray Bipronil 1.5 ml/1 liter of water; Apply Carbofuron 3 kg per acre mixed with 20 kg sand.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CARBOFURAN APPLICATION PROCEDURE?,Carbofuran powder can be sprinkled on the soil.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME EARLY SHOOT BORER MANAGEMENT IN SUGARCANE (ADULT)?,One lamp trap per acre should be used to attract and kill moths,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MINIMUM WAITING PERIOD BETWEEN TO SPRAY TEO PESTICIDES?,10 to15 days is ideal,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF RUST IN SUGAR CANE?,Sugarcane tambora control - Ridomil Gold 30 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL BLIGHT ATTACK ON SUGARCANE?,Control of sugarcane borer - Tubeconazole 50% 7 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR SUGARCANE?,Sugarcane -Fertilizers 10: 26: 26- 1 bags + Urea 1 bags + 5 kg micro nutrients / acre should be applied.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH?,60 g + microla 30 ml + full gripe ml / 15 liters of water for spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT INCREASE GROWTH IN SUGARCANE CROP?,19:19:19 60gm + Microla 30ml+ for more budding and balanced growth in sugarcane crop. Humic acid should be taken in 30 ml / 15 liters of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INTERCROPPING IN CROP?,"Pre-Season Sugarcane Intercrops: Potato, Onion, Garlic, Cauliflower, Cauliflower, Leaf Vegetables, Gram, Pea in Sugarcane","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH OF SUGAR CANE?,For sugarcane growth -19:19:19 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Humic acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN SUGAR CANE?,"Sugarcane - Weedicide - 25 to 35 days after planting - 2,4-D (amine salt 58 %) 40 ml + Cencor (Metribuzin 70 WP) 30 g /15 liters of water sprayed","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON SUGARCANE?,Sap-sucking Insect Control - Spray Reagent 20 ml /15 liters of water.(Fipronil 5 SC (5% w/w),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT TO SUGAR CANE SETS?,100 grams of carbendazim and 300 ml for sugarcane weaving process. Mix Malathion / 100 liters of water and soak the weed for 10-15 minutes. Then Acetobacter 10 kg + Phosphorus Dissolving Bacteria 1.25 kg / 100 liters of water should be mixed with tipri for 30 minutes and then planted.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR SUGARCANE?,"Sugarcane feeding - Apply 10 26 26, 1 bag + Urea 1 bag / acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SHOOT BORER IN SUGAR CANE?,In sugarcane crop - Chlorpyrifos 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF APHID ON SUGARCANE CROP?,Powdery mildew control on sugarcane - Thiemethoxam 7 gm/acre in 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR SUGARCANE?,"12:61:00-80 gm should be sprayed with Mikrolla 30 ml in 15 liters of water to break sugarcane crop, .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF SUGARCANE CROP?,Sugarcane Crop - Varieties - Ko-86032 Ko-10001 Flowers 265 Ko-03102 Ko-94012,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SHOOT BORER ON SUGAR CANE?,Cutworm control on sugarcane crop should be sprayed with Chlorpyrifos 30 ml/15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL MEASURE ON MEALY BUG OF SUGARCANE?,Chlorpyrifos 50% + Cypermethrin 5% e.c. 30 ml per 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH OF SUGARCANE?,Sugarcane - 19:19:19 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Humic acid 30 ml per 15 liters of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILT ATTACK OF SUGARCANE?,Sugarcane blight -Radomil Gold 45 gm + humic acid 30 ml/15 liters of water should be treated.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF SUGAR CANE?,"Sugarcane - Varieties - Ko - 86032 , Ko - 10001, Flowers 265, Ko - 03102, Ko - 94012.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR ATTACK ON SUGAR CANE?,Chlorpyrifos 30 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed for control of weed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME STEM BORER?,Spray sugarcane with Trizophos 30 ml + Bavistin 30 g / 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DRENCHING FOR SUGARCANE GROWTH?,19:19:19 3 kg+microla 300 ml+humic acid 300 ml by drip.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT TO SUGARCANE SETS?,100 grams of carbendazim and 300 ml. Malathion mixed with 100 liters of water and soaked for 10 minutes. Then Acetobacter 10 kg + Phosphorus dissolving bacteria 1.25 kg /100 liters of water should be mixed with tipri for 30 minutes and then planted.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF APHIDS OF SUGARCANE?,Sugarcane Mava Control Admire 5 gm/15 liters of water should be sprayed (Imidacloprid) Bayer Crop Science,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL MEASURE ON CUTWORM OF SUGARCANE?,350-400 ml per acre area should be applied in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATTERPILLAR ON SUGARCANE?,Chlorpyrifos 20 EC 30ml + clean 30g/15ltr of water should be applied in sugarcane crops.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF APHIDS ON SUGARCANE?,Actra 5 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR SUGARCANE CROP?,Fertilizers for sugarcane growth - 10 26 26 2 bags + Urea 2 bags + Micronutrients 10 kg + Humic acid 5 kg + Nimboli powder 40 kg / acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF STEM BORER IN SUGARCANE?,Nuvan (Dichlorvos 76%) 15 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN SUGAR CANE?,Sugarcane - Fertilizer - 10:26:26 - 2 bags + Urea - 1 bag + Micronutrients - 10 kg + Nimboli meal - 40 kg / acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUGARCANE FERTILIZER DOSE?,Sugarcane fertilizer 10:26:26 125 kg + Urea - 75 kg + Micronutrient - 10 kg + Humic acid - 10 kg + Secondary - 1 bag per acre Soda.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO DECOMPOSE SUGAR CANE TRASH?,Crush the sugarcane pulp. Apply acid rot bacteria 4 kg + urea 32 kg + SSP 40 kg per acre and water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT FOR SUGARCANE?,100 grams of carbendazim and 300 ml for sugarcane weaving process. Malathion should be mixed per 100 liters of water and soaked in that solution for 10 minutes.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHICH INTERCROP SOWING IN SUGARCANE?,"Cultivate guar, okra crop as intercrop in sugarcane","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUCKING PEST ATTACK ON SUGARCANE?,In sugarcane crop - Actra 5 gm (Thiomithoxom 25%)/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING FOR GROWTH ON SUGARACANE?,For sugarcane growth 19:19:19 60 g + Microla 30 ml/ Nutribild 20 g + Humic acid 30 ml /15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH ON SUGAR CANE?,For sugarcane growth -19:19:19 60 g + Microla 40 ml + Humic acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING FOR GROWTH ON SUGAR CANE?,For sugarcane growth 19:19:19 60 gm + sugarcane special 30 ml /15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ASKED FOR FERTILIZER DOSE FOR SUGARCANE?,Sugarcane should be given 50 kg 10 26 26 / acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF SUGAR CANE?,"Planting season starts 15th December to 15th February, Pre-season 15th October to 15th November, Off-season 15th July to 15th August","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME EARLY SOWN VARIETIES OF POTATO AND THEIR MATURITY TIME?,"Kufri Surya (90-100 days), Kufri Chandramukhi (90 days), Kufri Ashoka (75-80) and Kufri Pukhraj (70 days).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF POTATO CROP?,The best time to plant potatoes is late September to mid-October for fall season and second fortnight of January for spring season.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANURES AND FERTILIZERS USED IN POTATO CROP?,"Fertilizer rate in potatoes - Apply 20 tons of cow dung manure 10-15 days before sowing, 83 kg of urea, 155 kg of superphosphate or 55 kg of DAP and 40 kg of potash per acre at sowing and 82 kg of urea per acre. Acres of soil added at the time of plowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF BIOZYME IN POTATO APPLY 8 KG GRANULE PER ACRE AT THE TIME OF PLANTING AND EARTHING UP AND SPRAY OF BIOZYME LIQUID FORMULATION AT TUBER INITIATION STAGE @200ML/ACRE INCREASES THE YIELD OF POTATO.?,Apply Biozyme 8 kg granular at sowing and tilling or spray 200 ml of liquid Biozyme.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING AND DEPTH FOR SOWING OF POTATO CROP?,"For planting potato, the space should be 60 cm wide and the potatoes should be 20 cm apart, the depth of potato seed should be 6-7 inches.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED PRODUCTION OF POTATO CROP?,"In the potato field in which you have to keep potatoes for seed, the fields should be disease-free and if the number of oil on the plants is 20 per 100 plants in January, then cut the leaves and the potato should be sown at a distance of 50*15 cm. Potatoes of size are obtained more |","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BIOFERTILIZER USESIN POTATO?,"At the time of potato planting, adding 4 kg of Consortium organic fertilizer to the soil per acre increases the yield.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE IN POTATO?,Seed quantity for potato use 12-18 quintal per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT FOR CONTROL OF BLACK SCURF IN POTATO CROP?,"To prevent potato blight, treat potato seeds by soaking them in 2.5 ml of Monseron (Pencicuran 250 SC (22.9%w/w)) per liter of water for 10 minutes. Do not sow store potatoes directly, for 8-10 days. Let the shade dry","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF EARLY BLIGHT AND LATE BLIGHT IN POTATO CROP?,Spray 500-700 grams of Indofil M45 or 750-1000 grams of copper oxychloride in 250-350 liters of water per acre. 3rd and 4th spraying Spray 700 g Ridomil Gold in 250 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HARVESTING OF POTATO CROP?,"No medicine is recommended to dry the side of the potato crop, you can cut the side","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MOSAIC AND LEAF ROLL IN POTATO CROP?,Sow disease-free seeds to prevent chitkabra and cluster mustache disease in potato.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN POTATO CROP?,No herbicide is recommended if the potato crop is more than 10% frozen.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PROTECTION OF POTATO CROP FROM FROST?,Apply light water to protect the potato crop from blight,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FERTILIZER USESIN POTATO?,"Fertilizer rate in potatoes - Apply 20 tons of cow dung manure 10-15 days before sowing, 83 kg of urea, 155 kg of superphosphate or 55 kg of DAP and 40 kg of potash per acre at sowing and 82 kg of urea per acre. Apply at the time of acre tilling. Instead of superphosphate, you can add NPK (12:32:16) 80 kg per acre and add urea 145 kg and potash 20 kg only.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BURSTING OF POTATOES IN THE FIELD?,Spray 200 grams of boron per 100 liters of water per acre in the potato crop to prevent potato blight.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREPARATION OF HOMEMADE NEEM EXTRACT?,"Boil 4-5 kg of neem crumbles, leaves and stems in 10 liters of water for 30 minutes, filter the solution with a cloth and spray 1200 ml per 100 liters of water for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF LASSI IN CROP FOR FUNGUS CONTROL?,Spray 1 liter of lassi per 5 liters of water to prevent fungal disease,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOSE OF NPK(12:32:16) IN POTATO?,Instead of superphosphate you can add NPK (12:32:16) 80 kg per acre and apply urea 145 kg and potash 20 kg only.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF FERTILIZER AND BROADCAST IN POTATO?,Do not mix different fertilizers and put them in the field,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSES IN POTATO CROP?,"Twenty tonnes of farmyard manure or green manure along with 75 kg of N (165 kg of Urea), 25 kg of P2O5 (155kg of Single Superphosphate) and 25 kg of K2O (40 kg of Muriate of Potash) per acre should be used. Application of paddy straw mulch @ 25 q/acre saves 18 kg nitrogen.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION OF POTATO?,Apply water after sowing of potato. Light irrigation is good for potato. Total 7-8 irrigations are sufficient for potato.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INTERVAL BETWEEN TWO SPRAYS ON A CROP?,There should be a gap of at least 5-6 days between two sprays on the crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CROPS SUITABLE FOR INTERCROPPING IN POTATO?,"Pepper, garlic and turnip can be intercropped with potato.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF POTATO?,Potato Cultivation: 1500 to 2000 kg of seed is required per hectare.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING SEASON OF POTATO?,"Potato can be planted in June, July, October- November.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME QUERRY ABOUT WEED MANAGEMENT IN POTATO?,Intercropping - Weeding and weeding are important tasks in potato intercropping. The land should be weeded three to four times and kept humus. Add soil to the plants while giving the second installment of fertilizer.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING DISTANCE OF POTATO?,"The weight of an average ben should be at most 25 to 30 grams. The size of the seed is medium and the distance between two rows should be 45 to 60 cm and the distance between two seeds should be 15 to 20 cm depending on the size of the potato. With the help of a tractor, planting should be done in the Varamba method","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON POTATO?,Sap-sucking insects :- Actra (Thiomithozome 25%) 5 gm + M-45 30 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ASKING CULTIVATION OF POTATO?,"cool temperature of 18 to 21 degrees is ideal for good growth of potatoes. Potato cultivation can be done well in low rainfall areas. Kufri Chandramukhi, Kufri Jawahar, Kufri Ashoka, Kufri Jyoti, Kufri Bhi, Kufri Sindhuri are improved varieties of potato. Seeds 2.5 to 4 cm. size and weight of 25 to 40 grams and 25 to 30 quintals per hectare should be used.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON POTATO?,In control of fungal infection on potato crop - Fungicide containing Propaneb 70% WP - 30 gm / 15 liters of water should be sprayed..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR POTATO?,"Fertilizer management - Potato crop requires 100 kg of nitrogen and 60 kg of palash per hectare before planting. After 1 month after planting, 50 kg per hectare or second dose of fertilizer should be applied.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT TO POTATO?,"Potato Cultivation Information -Potato -Seed Process -100 Ltr. Take water and soak 1 liter of germinator in it for 5 to 10 minutes, take it out and dry it and use it for planting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR POTATO CROP?,"Fertilizers for potato crop - 10:26:2660 kg + Mahadhan Kranti 4 kg/acre, .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN POTATO?,Irrigation of the potato crop should be stopped for 15 days before potato harvest.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE OF POTATO?,For growth - 12:61:00 60 gm + Micro in 30 ml /15 liter water should be diluted.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HARVESTING POTATO CROP?,"The crop can be harvested when the leaves turn yellow and fall to the ground. Uproot the crop 15-20 days after harvesting the stalks when the soil moisture is correct. Digging can be done with a tractor and a potato digging machine or with a harrow. After peeling, spread the potatoes on the ground to dry and keep them for 10-15 days so that they can peel. Throw out the damaged and rotten potatoes.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL MANAGEMENT IN POTATO CROP?,"To control weeds and after first watering 1 liter Stomp 30 EC, Isoproteuran 70WP 500g, Atrazine 200g, Sancor (Metribuzin) 70WP, Lasso 50 strength (Alchlor) + Atrataf 50 strength (1 liter + 100g) to 200 liters Dissolve in water and spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF POTATO?,"For seed treatment in potato, 2.5 ml of Monseron per liter of water should be mixed and the seeds should be immersed in this solution for 10 minutes.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH OF POTATO?,Spray 10 grams of NPK 19:19:19 per liter of water for potato growth.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DOSE OF CALCIUM NITRATE IN POTATO?,The dose of calcium nitrate in potatoes is 500 grams per 200 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FOLIAR SPRAY FOR INCREASING SIZE OF POTATO?,"To increase the size of potato, dissolve 1 kg of NPK (00.00.50) in 100 liters of water and spray per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREPARATION OF  HOMEMADE NEEM EXTRACT?,"Boil 4-5 kg of neem crumbles, leaves and stems in 10 liters of water for 30 minutes, filter the solution with a cloth and spray 1200 ml per 100 liters of water for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME OF FERTILIZER DOSES IN POTATO CROP?,"Twenty tonnes of farmyard manure or green manure along with 75 kg of N (165 kg of Urea), 25 kg of P2O5 (155kg of Single Superphosphate) and 25 kg of K2O (40 kg of Muriate of Potash) per acre should be used. Application of paddy straw mulch @ 25 q/acre saves 18 kg nitrogen.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION IN POTATO?,Apply water after sowing of potato. Light irrigation is good for potato. Total 7-8 irrigations are sufficient for potato.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ALL ABOUT THE FERTILIZER USESIN POTATO?,"Fertilizer rate in potatoes - Apply 20 tons of cow dung manure 10-15 days before sowing, 83 kg of urea, 155 kg of superphosphate or 55 kg of DAP and 40 kg of potash per acre at sowing and 82 kg of urea per acre. Apply at the time of tilling the acre of soil. Instead of superphosphate, you can add NPK (12:32:16) 80 kg per acre and apply urea 145 kg and potash 20 kg only.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO APPLY OF BIOZYME IN POTATO?,Apply Biozyme 8 kg granular at sowing and tilling or spray 200 ml of liquid Biozyme.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BLIGHT PROBLEM IN POTATO?,Spray 500-700 grams of Indofil M45 or 750-1000 grams of copper oxychloride in 250-350 liters of water per acre. 3rd and 4th spraying Spray 700 g Ridomil Gold in 250 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF EALRY BLIGHT AND LATE BLIGHT IN POTATO CROP?,Spray 500-700 grams of Indofil M45 or 750-1000 grams of copper oxychloride in 250-350 liters of water per acre. 3rd and 4th Spraying 700 grams of Ridomil Gold in 250 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEEARLY SOWN VARIETIES OF POTATO?,"Early varieties of potato- Kufri Suraya (Average yield: 100-125 quintal), Kufri Chandramukhi (Average yield: 100 quintal), Kufri Ashoka (Average yield: 110 quintal) and Kufri Pukhraj (Average yield: 130 quintal)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PROCESSING SOWN VARIETIES OF POTATO?,"Potato varieties used for chips are Kufri Chipsona-1, Kufri Chipsona-3, Kufri Frisona.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ROOT ROT IN POTATO?,Control of root rot - Broadcast 500g SAAF (12% carbendazim 63% WP mancozeb) with sand.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPCAING AND DEPTH FOR SOWING OF POTATO CROP?,"For planting potato, the space should be 60 cm wide and the potatoes should be 20 cm apart, the depth of potato seed should be 6-7 inches.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED QUANTITY IN POTATO?,Seed quantity for potato use 13-18 quintal per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WHITE FLY IN POTATO CROP?,Bio 303 - Spray 22 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CUT WORM IN POTATO?,"Apply Chlorpyrifos 20%, 2ml per liter of water for potato cutworm control.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Plant Protection, INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON POTATO?,Potato Spray - Spray with clean 30 g/15 liter of water (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) UPL,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPACING OF ROPE?,"While planting turmeric, keep row spacing 30 cm and plant to plant spacing 20 cm.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF?,"Plant turmeric till the last week of April, it takes 215-240 days to mature.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YIELD OF TURMERIC?,The yield of turmeric is up to 150 quintals per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF TURMERIC?,"Plant turmeric in the last week of April, it takes 215-240 days to mature.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR BETTER GROWTH OF?,For good growth of turmeric you can spray one kg of NPK 19:19:19 by mixing it in liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
