Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TURMERIC RHIZOME ROT MANAGEMENT?,Pseudomonas florescence - 1 kg/ 20 kg manure should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
