Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOWING OF LEAVES?,For growth -19:19:19 40 g + Microla 30 ml + M-45 30 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
