Spices,Turmeric,Fertilizer Uses,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF APHIDS, CATERPILLAR ON TURMERIC?",Mava control - Alika 8 ml + Bavistein 30 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed. (Thiomethaxam 12.6 %+ Lambda Cilothrene 9.5%).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
