Spices,Turmeric,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR TURMERIC?,Third spray: (in September): 500 ml on thri. + Krampshiner 500 ml. + Ripner 250 ml. + Protectant 250 g + Prism 500 ml. + Nutratone 250 ml. + Harmony 250 ml + 150 l. water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
