Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF STEM BORER IN TURMERIC?,Turmeric should be sprayed with Nuvan 20 ml/15 liters of water (Dichlorvos 76% EC) on turmeric.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
