Spices,Turmeric,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR TURMERIC THROUGH DRIP?,Turmeric - Fertilizer through drip - 12:61:00 - 3 kg should be released through drip,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR GROWTH OF TURMERIC?,For growth of turmeric crop :-00:52:34 3 kg +micronutrient 300 ml +humic acid 300 ml /acre should be given by drip..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATERPILLAR IN TURMERIC?,Hald Ali Control - Hamala 550 40 ml / 15 liters of water to apply (Chlorpyrifos 20%EC + Cypermethrin 4%),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR ATTACK ON TURMERIC?,Solution for worm control on turmeric crop -Chlorpyrifos 30 ml + Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63% WP. Take 30 grams / 15 liters of water and filter.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNAL ATTACK ON TURMERIC?,Spraying Ridomil Gold 30g + Micro with 30 ml / 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME Cultural Practices OF TURMERIC?,"Turmeric Cultivation Season and Cultivation Turmeric should be cultivated generally from the middle of April to the first week of June. The duration of cultivation varies according to the local conditions of the place. The seeds used for cultivation should be dormant. The seed's eyes must be bulging unconsciously. Rotten, partially rotten seeds should not be used for planting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH SPRAY FOR TURMERIC CROP?,For Turmeric Growth - 00:52:34 (Mono Potassium Phosphate) 3000 gm + Microla 1000 ml + Saf (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) 400 gm /200 liter water should be sprayed for 1 acre..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Turmeric,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF TURMERIC- SELUM RAJAPURI PHULE SWARUP KRUSHNA?,Turmeric - Varieties - Salem Rajapuri Phule Swaroop Krishna,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PEA?,The sowing time of peas is from mid-October to mid-November.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED PEA VARIETY PUNJAB-89?,The Punjab-89 variety of peas takes 90 days for first harvest and yields 60 quintals per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT?,Treatment of the seed with Thiram @ 2.5g per kg seed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE WEED MANAGEMENT IN PEA CROP?,Spray 1 liter of Stop 30 EC dissolved in 150-200 liters of water per acre and spray within 2 days of sowing. No herbicide is recommended after weed emergence.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION MANAGEMENT IN PEA CROP?,Apply first water to pea crop 15 days after sowing and second water at flowering and third water at fruiting.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE IN PEA?,Seed quantity for pea crop is 45 kg for early crop and 30 kg for main crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER USESIN PEA CROP?,"Fertilizers in pea crop- Apply 8 tons of manure 10-15 days before sowing, 45 kg of urea and 155 kg of single superphosphate per acre before sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF THE YELLOWING ON PEA CROP?,"To prevent yellowing of peas, spray 1 kg of NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANURES AND FERTILIZERS USED IN PEA?,"Fertilizers in pea crop- Apply 8 tons of manure 10-15 days before sowing, 45 kg of urea and 155 kg of single superphosphate per acre before sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT, ROOT ROT AND COLLAR ROT IN PEA?",Apply 500 grams of Baviston mixed with 200 liters of water per acre to protect the pea crop from uprooting and root and shoot rot diseases.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN PEAS?,No herbicides are recommended for weed control in peas.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGUS IN PEA>?,You can put half a kilo of clear in the peas to prevent the pods from drying up,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN PEA?,Sprinkle 500 g of clear (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15 kg of sand per acre or drench at the rate of 3 g of Bavistin per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR BETTER GROWTH OF PEA?,For good growth of peas you can spray one kg of NPK 19:19:19 by mixing it in a liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BEST TIME OF NUTRIENT APPLICATION?,Apply the medicine from the dew and it is more beneficial in clear weather than on a foggy day,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PURPLE BLOTCH AND DOWNY MILDEW IN ONION?,Spray 600 g Indofil M-45 and 200 ml linseed oil dissolved in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN RADISH?,Plant for weed control in radish crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PEA CROP AND CORIANDER?,Sowing time of Pea crop and coriander is Pea (Mid October to Mid November) and Coriander (Last September to October).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT FOR QUICK GROWTH AND HIGH YIELD?,Use of Rhizobium inoculation to improve seed for pea crops.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PEA LEAF MINER, THRIPS AND APHID?","Spray 400 ml Roger (dimethoate)30EC dissolved in 80-100 liters of water for control of borer, aphid and oil in pea crop.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF CATERPILLARS AND BORERS IN PEA CROP?,Spray 80 g Proclaim or 200 ml Avant or 150 ml Densis or 20 ml Fame or 40 g Corazan per 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY FOR GROWTH OF PEA?,"After the recommended fertilizers, if the height of the peas does not increase, you can spray NPK 19:19:19 at the rate of 1 kg in 100 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPACING AND SEED RATE OF PEA?,30 15 cm in rain-fed or flat steam when planting peas. Do it at a distance. 40 kg of seed per hectare is required for sowing method and 80 kg per hectare for sowing method.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING PERIOD OF PEA CROP?,"In Maharashtra, peas are a crop in Kharif season in June-July and as this crop comes in cold weather, it is advisable to plant it in early October or early November.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON PEA?,Fungus control on potato crop :- Carbendazim 12 % + Mancozeb 63 % WP should be sprayed with 30 g/15 liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WILT ON PEA?,30 gm of Alvani + humic acid 30 ml/15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF FRUIT DROP IN CITRUS?,"In Kinnu, if there is a problem of fruit drop, spray 1 ml Tilt or 1 gram Bavistin or 2.5 ml germ per liter of water in the months of April, August and September.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREPARATION OF BORDEAUX MIXTURE?,"To prepare Bordeaux mixture 2:2:250 dissolve 2 kg of copper sulphate (blue thotha) in 125 liters of hot water and in another vessel dissolve 2 kg of quicklime in 125 liters of water. After the lime cools down, mix the two solutions and spray. .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FRUIT SUCKING MOTHS IN CITRUS?,Dissolve one kg of Sevin (Carbaryl) in 500 liters of water and spray it.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN CITRUS CROP?,"In Kinnu's garden, do light irrigation every 10-15 days in summer and do not water when the flowers come.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVING FRUIT SIZE?,Spray 10 grams of NPK (13:0:45) dissolved in 1 liter of water to improve fruit quality.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF TERMITES?,Apply 5 ml of chlorpyrifos per liter to prevent the attack of cyanobacteria.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FRUIT DROP IN KINNOW?,2 grams of M45 per liter of water can be sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF TERMITES IN CITRUS?,Dissolve 10 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in a liter of water for prevention of syringing in Kinnu.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FRUIT FLY IN KINNOW FRUIT?,Break the damaged fruit and press it in a deep pit and apply 16 PAU fruit fly trap per acre when the fruit is ripe.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BORDEAUX PAINT?,Monohydrated copper sulphate (blue thotha) :1 kg +hydrated lime dust (lime):2 kg +boiled linseed oil : 3 liters use for making bordeaux paint.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSES IN KINNOW?,"Apply potash in Kinnu garden according to soil test, in addition recommended fertilizers for Kinnu - (1-3 years) - Manure - 10-30 kg, Urea - 240-730 grams per plant, (4-7 years) - Manure 40-80 kg, Urea-960-1680 gm and Super Phosphate-1360-2400 gm per plant, (8 years or above)- Manure-100 kg, Urea-1940 gm and Super Phosphate 2730 gm. All Manure fertilizers are applied in the month of December. give Apply the first portion of nitrogenous fertilizer and complete superphosphate in February and the remaining nitrogenous fertilizer in April to May.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVING FRUIT SIZE AND QUALITY?,"Dissolve 10 grams of NPK (13:0:45) in every liter of water and spray in the months of May, June and July to increase the quality of quinoa fruit.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FRUIT DROP IN CITRUS?,Spray 1250 ml Germ 27 SC or 500 gm Baviston 50 WP or 500 ml propiconazole 25 EC mixed with 500 liters water in last July and last September.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF FOLDER?,Spray 1250 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC or Acalx 25 EC (Cunelphos) in 500 liters of water for prevention of leaf blight in citrus fruits.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF FERTILIZERS IN NIMBO?,"Recommended Fertilizers For citrus fruits -(1-3 years)-Manure-5-20 kg, Urea-110-330 gm per plant, (4-6 years)-Manure 25-50 kg, Urea-440-550 gm, (7-9 years)- Manure-60-90 kg, Urea-660-880 gm and (10 years and above) Manure 100 kg, Urea-880-1760 gm. Apply all the manure in the month of December. Apply the first portion of nitrogenous fertilizer and complete superphosphate in February and the remaining nitrogenous fertilizer in April to May.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FRUIT OR FLOWER DROPPING IN CITRUS?,Spray 1 ml of Planofix in 4.5 liters of water to prevent leaf drop of lemon.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOOT ROT CONTROL IN FRUIT CROPS?,Mix 100 gm of phatkadi with 15-20 liters of water and sprinkle under the canopy of the plant.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DIE BACK IN CITRUS?,"For its effective prevention, periodically remove dry branches and apply bordeaux paste on the cut parts. Spray copper oxychloride (Blytox) 3 g per liter of water in March, July and September.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CITRUS PSYLLA, APHIDS AND CITRUS LEAF MINER?","Control of Citrus psylla, Aphids and Citrus leaf miner spray- 1.5ml/1L Rogor 30EC (dimethoate) or 1ml/2.5L Confider 17.8SL (imidaclopride)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TRAINING AND PRUNING IN CITRUS?,"For lemons, remove dry and diseased shoots from the plants in December to January, immediately after harvesting, spray with Bordeaux mixture (2:2:250) or 2.5 g Blytox per liter.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SAP SUCKING INSECTS IN CITRUS?,Spray at the rate of 1 g Actara per 3 liters of water or 1 ml of Confidor per 2.5 liters of water or 3 ml of malathion or 3 ml of Roger or 10 ml of Nimbicidin per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOWING OF LEAVES KINNOW?,"For yellow spot disease in Kinno, you spray 2.5 grams of Bavistan per liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CITRUS LEAF MINER?,Spray 200 ml of Confidor 17.8 SL (Imidacloprid) in 500 liters of water per acre during April-May and September-October.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING TIME FOR KINNOW FRUIT?,"Kinnu and PAU Kinnu-1 are seasonal recommended varieties, February-March and August-September are the best time to plant seasonal seedlings, buy seedlings from Punjab Agricultural University Ludhiana, Krishi Vigyan Kendra or registered nursery only.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DYING OF LEAVES GUAVA PLANT?,"Check the leaves of the plant for signs of drying, if there is disease attack in the crop, spray 1.5 grams of Bavistan per liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MEALY BUG?,Spray 500 ml of Upload 25 EC (buprofengin) in 100-125 liters of water per acre to control mealy bugs.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITEFLY, THRIPS AND MITES?","Spray 1000 ml of Fosmite 30 EC (Ethane) mixed with 500 liters of water for control of whitefly, aphid and mite in citrus fruits.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASE FLOWERING IN CITRUS (ORGANIC)?,Mix fermented buttermilk 200 ml with 10 liters of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREVENTION ROOT GRUB PEST IN CITRUS?,Apply 500 kg of Neem Punna per tree.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INDUCING FLOWERING IN CITRUS?,Mix fermented buttermilk 200 ml in 10 liters of water or Nitrobenzene 2 ml in 1 liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CITY COMPOST APPLICATION FOR CITRUS TREES?,Apply 5 kg per tree.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEEM CAKE APPLICATION DOSE FOR CITRUS TREE?,Apply 200 grams of neem per tree,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR SPRY IN CITRUS?,Mix 5 grams of 19:19:19 fertilizer per liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN I USE FOLIAR SPRAY OF DAP IN CITRUS?,Lemon leaf spray DAP can be used,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CITRUS GREENING MANAGEMENT?,Mix and spray tetracycline 5 ml per 10 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MN DEFICIENCY MANAGEMENT IN CITRUS?,Mix and spray micronutrient mixture at the rate of 5 grams per liter of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CITRUS TREE FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT (2 YEARS)?,Manure 20 kg + Urea 800 kg + Super Phosphate 1.2 kg + Potash 300 g/tree/year twice separately.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WHITE GRUB IN CITRUS?,"Hoomnasur (organic) at a dose of 3 kg/acre and can be spread by drip, spreading or mixing with well-rotted dung manure or composted manure.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON CITRUS?,Blue Copper (copper oxychloride 50% WP)-30 g/15 liters of water should be applied for control of blight on orange crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON ORANGE?,For fungus control in orange crop - Ridomil Gold- 30 gms /15 liters of water should be sprayed. Syngenta,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Turnip,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETY OF TURNIP?,Improved variety of Turnip is L-1.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Turnip,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANURES AND FERTILIZERS USED IN RADISH AND TURNIP?,"For turnip and radish crops, apply 15 tonnes of manure, 55 kg of urea and 75 kg of super phosphate at sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Turnip,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF TURNIP?,"For indigenous varieties of turnip, the sowing time is August-September and for exotic varieties the sowing time is October-November. L-1 is the recommended variety of turnip.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Turnip,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION IN TURNIP?,Water the turnip immediately after sowing and later water according to the weather,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Turnip,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPACING IN TURNIP?,"In turnip, row to row spacing should be 45 cm and plant to plant spacing should be 7.5 cm.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Turnip,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF TURNIP?,L-1 is the recommended type of turnip,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF JASSID, APHIDS AND WHITEFLY IN CHILI CROP?",Spray 400 ml of Melathion (to control oil and whitefly) or 300 ml of Roger 30 EC (Dimethoate) mixed with 100 liters of water for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER USED IN CHILLI?,"For pepper crop, apply 28 kg urea, 75 kg superphosphate and 20 kg potash at sowing and 28 kg urea per acre after first sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW MANY PROTRAYS REQUIRED FOR CHILLI NURSERY PREPARATION PER ACRE?,120 pits/acre is required,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI VARIETY SEED RATE?,400 g/acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VEGETABLES SUITABLE FOR SEPTEMBER?,"Chili, Radish, Chili, Cauliflower, Cabbage, Cauliflower and Spinach.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BASAL FERTILIZER FOR CHILLI NURSERY (BIO FERTILIZER)?,"Add compost, azospirillum, phosphobacteria and earthworms.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREVENTION OF DAMPING OFF DISEASE IN CHILLI NURSERY?,Pseudomonas mixed with compost.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI SOWING SEASON INFORMATION?,June - July,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWING MEDIUM PREPARATION FOR VEGETABLE?,"Soil 2 parts + cow manure 1 part + coir waste 1 part + Azospirillum 10 grams, Phosphobacteria 10 grams can be prepared and the pots can be filled three-quarters and planted.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI SEEDS (VARIETIES)?,Trichy Horticulture College Phone 0431-2918033,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING SEASON FOR CHILLI?,January-February June-July and September-October.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE FOR CHILLI (VARIETIES) AND PLANTING SPACING?,400 g/acre and 60 cm row to row and 45 cm plant to plant.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI CO 1 (HYBRID) AND K 2 VARIETIES DETAIL?,"K2 variety crop period 210 days, Chilli yield 800 kg/acre and Co 1 (robust graft variety) crop period 195-205 days, yield Chilli 11.2 ton/acre Cattle 2.5 ton/acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI SUITABLE SEASON AND VARIETIES?,"September - October and K 1, K 2, CO 1,CO 2,CO 3, CO 4, PKM 1, PMK 1 , are suitable for planting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI SEED RATE AND SPACING?,Vigorous graft variety Seed rate 100 g/acre is sufficient and 75 x 60 cm spacing is sufficient.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREVENTING SOIL BORNE PATHOGEN IN CHILLI?,Pseudomonas and Trichoderma 1 kg/acre mixed with 25 kg cow dung manure,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI ROOT ROT MANAGEMENT?,Mix Carpentazim 50 % WP 1 gm / 1 liter of water on the root and give 2 times at 10 to 15 days interval.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI SEED TREATMENT?,"There is no need to treat the seed purchased in the store, otherwise it can be treated by mixing 1 gram of carpentazim per 1 kg of seed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ROOT ROT IN CHILLI?,Mix one gram of copper oxychloride in one liter of water and pour it to soak the root part.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BUD ROT AND LEAF SPOT MANAGEMENT FOR CHILLI PLANT?,Can be sprayed for growth; Does not flower,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUCKING PEST ATTACK CONTROL ON CHILLY?,Confidor (Imidacloprid 17.8%) - 10 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF LEAF CURL ON CHILLI?,Goat control on pepper -Pegasus (Difenthuron 96%) 25g +M-45 30g/15 liters of water should be sprayed..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH SPRAY FOR CHILLIES CROP?,If for Chilli growth - 12:61:00 (Mono Ammonium Phosphate) 3000 gm + Mikrolla 1000 ml /200 liters of water should be sprayed for 1 acre..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZE DOSE CHILLI?,Manure management: 20 to 25 tonnes of well-rotted cow dung should be mixed per hectare of soil before steaming for cultivation. For chilli crop 100:50:50 kg N:P:P/ha should be applied and half of N should be applied 4 to 6 weeks after planting i.e. at the time of flowering and fruiting. Water should be given immediately after applying the quantity of fertilizers.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI CULTIVATION SEASON?,"Cultivation Season: Chilli is grown in Kharif and Summer season. In kharif season, seeds are sown from the second fortnight of May to the end of June. For summer season, seeds are sown in January-February.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR INCREASING FLOWERING IN CHILI?,"To increase the quantity of flowers in chilli crop :-Bumflower should be taken in 30 ml/15 liters of water and sprayed. (Nitrobenzene 20 %), !","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT ATTACK ON CHILLI?,Chilli Picavril Fungus Control :- Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63% 30 gms / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.!,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT ATTACK IN CHILLI CROP?,Blue Copper (copper oxychloride 50% WP)-30 gm + humic acid in 30 ml/15 liter of water should be applied for control of dead disease in chilli crop. !,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN CHILI CROP?,Weed killer in chilli crop:- Chemical weed killer is not recommended in this stage of the crop so weeding should be done now.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN CHILLI?,Fertilizer in Chilli Pika - 19:19:19 - 60 grams + Microla - 30 ml + Humic acid - 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be mixed. !,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF SUCKING PEST ON CHILLIES?,"1) Imidacloprid (17.8%) 10 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed. 2) Apply 5-6 sticky traps per acre, .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME JASSIDS AND APHIDS ATTACK ON CHILLI?,Nimboli extract 1500 PPM in 50 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed for control of leaf spot on chilli crop..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUCKING PEST IN CHILLI?,Ulla should be sprayed with 8 grams /15 liters of water. (Flonicamid 50% WG) Upl,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON CHILLI?,Bavistein 30 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed for control of blight on chillies,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUCKING PEST ATTACK ON CHILLIES?,Chili Juice Absorbent Pest Control - Spray 20 ml / 15 liters of water with Karate. Lambda Cilothrene - Syngenta,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT?,"Chemical herbicides are not recommended at this stage of the crop, so weeding should be done now.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CHILLI CULTIVATION?,"Tall and spreading varieties should be planted at a spacing of 60 by 60 cm and short varieties should be planted at a spacing of 60 by 45 cm. Dry chillies should be planted at a distance of 45 cm by 45 cm. Seedlings should be planted in succession. After removing the seedlings from the mat, before planting, the tops of the seedlings should be dipped in a solution of 15 ml monocrophos 36 per cent flux plus 25 g dithanum 45 plus 30 g water-soluble sulfur 80 per cent in 10 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF CHILLI?,"Chilli - Varieties - Pant C - 1-Fruits are 8 to 10 cm long and the bark is thick, Pusa Evergreen, Pusa Jwala, Agnirekha.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WHITE FLY ON CHILLIES CROP?,Ulla (flonicamid) 8 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO CONTROL YELLOW SPOT ON CHILLY CROP?,To reduce yellowness on Chilli : 12:61:00 2 kg + Microla 300 ml + Saf 500 g per 15 liter of water spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ROLE OF ROCK PHOSPHATE?,Insoluble in water and citric acidock phosphate 20 to 40 Phosphorus content (percent),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH SPRAY ON CHILLI?,Fertilizer in Chilli Pika - 19:19:19 - 60 grams + Microla - 30 ml + Humic acid - 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be mixed. !,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST IN CHILLIES?,Chilli - Succulent Pest Control - Spray Lancer Gold 30 g /15 liters of water (Acephate 50 + Imidacloprid 1.8 SP),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON CHILLIES?,For Chilli Crop : Avatar (Zineb 68% + Hexaconazole 4% WP) 30g /15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF POWDERY MILDEW ON CHILLI?,Chili Brown Control - Spray with Kantaf 1ml/L of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOWNEY MILLDEW ON CHILLI?,Downy Control on Chilli - Spray with Folikur 7 ml/15 liters of water (Tubeconazole 50%) Bayer Crop Science,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Chilli,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUCKING PEST ATTACK ON CHILLI?,Spray Regent (Fipronil 5% sc)-20 ml /15 liter of water. Bayer Crop Science,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
