Fodder Crops,Barseem,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF BARSEEM?,The best time to plant Berseem is from the last week of September to the first week of October. But Berseem can be sown up to the month of February.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF BARSEEM?,"Advanced Varieties of Berseem BL 44, BL 43, BL 42, BL 10, BL 1","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN BARSEEM?,Apply 22 kg urea and 185 kg super phosphate per acre at sowing time for Berseem.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF BARSEEM?,Use 8-10 kg of seeds per acre for sowing Barsim,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS FROM THE VACANT FIELD BEFORE SOWING OF BARSEEM?,Spray 500 ml of gramoxone 24 SL (Paraquat) in 200 liters of water per acre for control of weeds from bare field before sowing of bersim.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED PRODUCTION OF BERSEEM?,"If the crop is sown for seed in April, then 2 quintals per acre can be obtained.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MOTHA IN NON CULTIVATED AREA?,Spray 500 ml of 200 liters per acre to control moths in open fields.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN BERSEEM?,No weed killer is recommended in Bersim,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN FODDER CROPS?,There is no recommendation for the use of any herbicide in forage crops.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN BARSEEM?,Keep watering at intervals of 10-15 days in winter and 8-10 days in summer in bersim crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE GROWTH OF BARSEEM CROP?,Spray 1 kg of NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre for growth of bersim crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MANGANESE DEFICIENCY?,"To meet manganese deficiency in Berseem, spray 1 kg of manganese sulphate dissolved in 200 liters of water per acre.,Forage can be cut two days after spraying of manganese.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH OF BARSEEM CROP?,Spray 1 kg NPK19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre to remove yellowing of bersim leaves.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DRAINING OF WATER FROM BARSEEM?,Sulfur can be added to absorb water from Bersim,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN BARSEEM CROP?,"Advised to farmer if you can do spray of NPK, zinc and also apply DAP. Now you have no need to spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF STEM ROT IN BERSEEM?,"To prevent root rot in Bersim, spray 400 g of Bavistan (Carbendazim) 50 WP in 200 liters of water after harvesting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF GRAM CATERPILLAR IN BARSEEM?,Spray 50 ml of Corazan (Chlorantraniliprole 18.5 SL) or 200 ml of Avant or 160 ml of Dacis with 100 liters of water solution to control chickpea borer in bersim.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PHOSPHORUS DEFICIENCY?,Spray 1 kg (NPK 17:44:00) in 100 liters of water per acre to overcome phosphorus deficiency in Bersim.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PROVIDE ME SOLUTION FOR BERSEEM LEAF APPEARING PURPLE COLOR (JAMUNI)?,Spray of magnesium sulphate 1 kg per 150-200 liter water for complete of nutrient deficiency.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GAP BETWEEN SPRAY OF GRAMOXONE 24 SL (PARAQUAT) AND SOWING OF BERSEEM?,15 days after spraying gramoxone 24 SL (Paraquat) plant the bersim.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS FROM THE VACANT FIELD BEFORE SOWING OF BERSEEM?,"15 days before sowing of bersim, spray 500 ml Gramoxone 24 SL (Paraquat) in 200 liters of water per acre for weed control from bare field.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FODDER BERSEEM SOWING TIME?,fodder berseem sowing time is The last week of September to first week of October is the best time of sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BERSEEM VARIETY?,New Variery:-BL 44 (Berseem): It is a quick growing variety with high tillering. BL 44 out yielded the check variety BL 43 by 6.0 percent for green fodder yield and also possess better nutritional characters. Harvesting for green fodder should stop in mid-April for better seed yield.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INOCULATION OF BERSEEM SEED?,"Inoculation of seeds with organic fertilizers - Bersim If sowing in new fields, it is very important to inoculate the seeds of Bersim, it gives more green fodder yield. Mix one packet of this soaked seed thoroughly. Do this on a firm, clean floor/tarpaulin. Then dry the seeds in the shade and on the same day (evening if possible) sprinkle them with standing water so that the sun shines. I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING METHOD OF BARSEEM?,"Berseem can be sown in standing water with a harrow, if the wind is blowing, water the dry field by harrowing the harrow.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BLACK ANTS IN BARSEEM SEED?,"For prevention, destroy the seeds of insects near the field","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Barseem,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN BERSEEM?,"Herbicide is not recommended for weed control in basil crop, weed growth is low in sowing done till second week of October I Soak basil seed in water, coriander seed will float to the top, separate it with a sieve. let i","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF GRAM POD BORER?,Spray 150 ml of Rimon 10 EC (Novaluran) or 50 ml of Corazan or 80 g of Proclam in 100 liters of water to control green borer.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF GRAMOXONE FOR MOONG CROP?,Gramoxone herbicide is not recommended for defoliation of mung bean crop. Wait for the crop to mature.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO CONTROL BLISTER BEETLE?,Spray 200 ml Decis 2.8 EC (deltamethrin) or 200 ml Kingdoxa 14.5 SC (indoxacarb) in 80-100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANAGEMENT OF LEAF SPOT?,Spray 400g Zineb75 WP (dithanr Z-78) in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOBACCO CATERPILLAR IN SUMMER MASH?,Spray 150 ml Rimon 10 EC (Novaluran) or Chlorpyrifos 20 EC 1.5 liters in 100 liters of water to control tobacco borer in a month.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH REGULATOR USED TO IMPROVE POD FILLING IN MASH?,"For Musar, spray 1 KG NPK (13:0:45) mixed with 100 liters of water for one acre at the time of emergence.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL AND TOBACCO CATERPILLAR?,Spray 150 ml Rimon 10 EC(novaluron) or 800g Asataf 75 SP(acephate) or 1.5 liters Dursban 20 EC(chlorpyriphos) in 100 liters of water @per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF YELLOW MOSAIC VIRUS IN MOONG?,You can spray 40 grams of Actara by mixing it in a liter of water if the leaves get yellow spots.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CERCOSPORA LEAF SPOT IN MOONG CROP?,"For prevention of leaf spot disease in mongoose, spray 400 grams of Jineb 75 WG (Dithan Z-78) in 100 liters of water per acre and spray at 10 day intervals.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR IN MOONG?,You can spray 60 ml of Tresher in 1 liter of water to prevent smut.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF GROWN UP LARVAE AMERICAN BOLL WORM IN MOONG?,Control of large American weevils in mango Tracer 48 SC (Spinosad) 60 ml or 200 ml Avant 15 SC/ Avant 15 EC (Indoxacarb) or 60 ml Kaurjan 18.5 SC* (Chlorantraniliprole) Spray per acre in 125 liters of water do it,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CERCOSPORA LEAF SPOT IN MASH CROP?,Spray 400 gm Z-78 or 500 gm Bavistin and 20 gm Agrimycin or 3 gm Sutrareptocycline in 200 liters of water per acre and spray at 15 to 20 days interval.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF TOBACCO CATERPILLAR IN SUMMER MOONG?,Spray 150 ml Rimon 10 EC (Novaluran) or Chlorpyrifos 20 EC 1.5 liters in 100 liters of water to control tobacco borer in mongoose.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH REGULATOR USED TO IMPROVE POD FILLING IN GRAMS?,"For chickpeas, spray 1 KG NPK (13:0:45) mixed with 100 liters of water for one acre at the time of germination.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GREENGRAM BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Urea 23 kg + super phosphate 62.5 kg + potash 8 kg should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GREENGRAM SOWING SEASON AND VARIETY?,"June - July and varieties : Go 6, Go 7, Vampan (Gg) 2 , Vampan (Gg) 3","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GREENGRAM SEED RATE INFORMATION?,8 kg seed required per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GREEN GRAM CROP DURATION?,Average age : 65 - 80 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GREEN GRAM SEEDS AVAILABILITY?,February- March month is suitable,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE GREEN GRAM VARIETIES?,"Go 6, Go 7, Vamban 2 and Vamban 3","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GREEN GRAM?,Moong -Variety - Kopargaon Vaibhav PhuleM-2 BPMR- 145 Pusa Vishal,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF GREEN GRAM?,"Improved varieties of mung bean - Kopargaon - Duration 65 to 70 days, Mar and Karpa, Yellow Kevada disease resistant, Yield 3-10 quintals/ha","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT VARIETIES OF GREEN GRAM?,"Summer Mung Cultivation Varieties Kopargaon, Vaibhav, PhuleM-2, BPMR-145, Pusa Vishal","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSES IN MANGO?,"Recommended Fertilizers for Mango - (1-3 years) - Manure - 5-20 kg, Urea - 100-200 gm per plant, 250-500 gm Super Phosphate and Potash","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING TIME?,The time for planting chiku saplings is February-March and August-September,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO VARIETIES IN PUNJAB?,Dusheri: It bears 150 kg of fruit per tree. Langra: It bears 100 kg of fruit per tree. Alphonso: It bears 70 kg of fruit per tree. Gangian Sandhuri (GN-19): It yields 80 kg per tree.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DISEASES ROOT ROT IN MANGO?,"To prevent root rot in mango, spray Baviston at the rate of 3 grams per liter","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISEASE AND SYMPTOMS CONTROL MANGO MALFORMATION IN MANGO?,"Cut off diseased branches and bunches, first dissolve 100 grams of NAA (Naphthalene Acetic Acid) in 100-150 ml of alcohol and then dilute it in 500 liters of water and spray per acre of mango orchard in the month of October.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF BANANA?,Banana variety - Grand Nanan,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF TERMITE IN MANGO?,Dissolve 10 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in liter of water for prevention of smut.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO PRUNING INFORMATION?,"Pruning of mango tree should be done once in three years in August and September. In the tree, low branches, cross, overlapping branches, diseased and thin, dead or dry branches should be removed. Once a year in August and September, close branches should be cut and only healthy branches should be left.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR SPRAY IN MANGO?,"In February, spray non-flowering trees with potassium nitrate at the rate of 10 grams per liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PRUNING PROCESS FOR MANGO (LOWER BRANCH CAN BE PRUNED)?,"Pruning of mango tree should be done once in three years in August and September. In the tree, low branches, cross, overlapping branches, diseased and thin, dead or dry branches should be removed. This allows sunlight and air to reach the inner branches, allowing the tree to grow well and flower and bear fruit. A mango tree should not miss flowering for up to three years. Once a year in August and September, close branches should be cut and only healthy branches should be left.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER APPLICATION?,Apply Urea 1 kg + Super Phosphate 1.5 kg + Potash 800 g + Manure 25 kg / tree / once in 6 months,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT FOR MANGO?,Water should not be stopped near mango plant,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT FOR MANGO (RAIN HARVESTING)?,Water should not be stopped near mango plant,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO FLOWER SHEDDING MANAGEMENT?,Mix 4 ml Planopix in 10 liters of water and spray between 6-9 AM or 3-6 PM. Water sparingly during flowering.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO PLANTING SEASON?,July - December,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOP FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT FOR MANGO?,Fertilizer 50 kg + Urea 2.1 kg + Super Phosphate 6.25 kg + Potash 2.4 kg / tree / March and October divided into two,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MICRO-NUTRIENTS APPLIED FOR MANGO?,Micronutrient fertilizer can be applied; Micronutrient fertilizer can be applied at the rate of 500 g/tree.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IF APPLIED CHEMICAL FERTILIZERS TO KILL THE EARTHWORM (IN MANGO)?,Earthworm will be affected; So don't post,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO SEEDLING AVAILABILITY?,"Deputy Director of Horticulture, Trichy Phone : 0431-2423464","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWER SHED IN MANGO?,Mix 5 ml of Bilanofix in 10 liters of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO RIPENING METHOD?,Mango ripening method.Ans: Put an unripe mango in a sack and tie a ripe mango in the middle of the sack. All the fruit will ripen in a week.Or put mango fruit in an earthen pot and cover the mouth with straw and the fruit will ripen in a week.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FRUIT FLY MANAGEMENT IN MANGO?,Mix and spray dichlorvas at 2 ml/litre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Urea 2 kg + Super Phosphate 6.25 kg + Potash 2.4 kg + Manure 50 kg should be applied per tree during September - October.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK?,Karpa Rog Blue Copper (copper oxychloride 50 % WP ) 30 gm + thiomethozone 5 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed. Syngenta,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO FLOWER DROP IN MANGO?,Spray four ml of Planofix in 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANGO APHIDS ATTACK?,Spray the mango crop with triazophos-30 ml + together - 5 gm + twenty-two -30 gm / 15 liters of water. Apply ring method - Forte - 200 grams per tree. Ocher the tree,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK STEM BORER OF MANGO?,Dip a cotton ball in nuwan and slide it into the hole and cover the hole with soil.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER APPLICATION FOR NEWLY PLANTED MANGO TREE?,Mango - Fertilizers for newly planted trees - Manure 1 gram + Urea 1.5 kg + Single super phosphate 1.5 kg + Murate of potash 1200 + Humic acid g/tree,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR INCREASING FLOWERING OF MANGO?,Fertilizer quantity spraying for mango flowering :- 00:52:34 55 g + nitrobenzene 20% should be sprayed from 30 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWERING IN MANGO?,To increase the number of flowers - Boomflower should be taken in 20 ml/15 liters of water and sprayed. (Nitrobenzene 20 %) Devi Crop Science,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR MANGO?,Mango - 10:26:26 + eat rotted cow dung + give quantity of urea fertilizer.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL STEM BORER IN MANGO?,Dip a cotton ball in nuwan and slide it into the hole and cover the hole with soil.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWER DROP ON MANGO CROP?,Amba crop should be sprayed with Mohar Gal Sathi Planofix 5 ml/15 liters of water. Bayer Crop Science,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF STEM BORER ATTACK IN MANGO CROP?,For weevil take Nuwan 2 ml / 1 liter of water and inject where there is a hole and dip a cotton ball in kerosene or petrol and apply lipun,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWER DROP IN MANGO?,Spraying with Calcibor 30 g / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON MANGO?,Fungus control on mango crop Karpa disease control - Blue copper (copper oxychloride 50 % WP )- 30 gm + Microla should be taken in 30 ml /15 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN MANGO?,"15 kg of compost manure, 150 grams of nitrogen, 50 grams of phosphorus and 100 grams of palash should be dug at the beginning of monsoon. Every year this quantity should be increased equally and from the 10th year onwards, 50 kg of compost, 1.5 kg of nitrogen, 500 g of phosphorus and 1 kg of palash should be given to each tree in the month of June.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MNAGO FLOWER DROP AFTER BECOMES BLACK?,Mango gall control - Rogar 15 ml + Bavistein 15 g or Kantaf 7.5 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING FOR INCREASING FLOWERING IN MANGO?,10 ml of Kaltar should be mixed with three liters of water and left on one tree to make the mango tree bloom,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,"	Plant Protection	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF TERMITE?,Apply 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC mixed with 15 to 20 kg of soil per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,"	Plant Protection	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TREATMENT OF  MANGO PLANTS FROM TERMITE ATTACK?,"Check the signs of drying of the mango plant, if the crop is attacked by aphids, spray the stem with 5 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC per liter of water, apply the medicine again after 15 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING TIME  OF MANGO?,The time for planting mango saplings is February-March and August-September,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,"	Plant Protection	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MANGO MALFORMATION?,Cut and burn bunches of branches and first dissolve 100 grams of NAA (Naphthalene Acetic Acid) in 100-150 ml of alcohol and then make a solution in 500 liters of water. Sprinkle on the month of October I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,"	Fertilizer Uses	","
INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSES IN MANGO?","Recommended Fertilizers for Mango - (1-3 years) - Manure - 5-20 kg, Urea - 100-200 gm per plant, 250-500 gm Super Phosphate and Potash 175-500","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,"	Plant Protection	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEDIE BACK IN MANGO?,"Remove dry and diseased shoots from mango, immediately after harvesting spray with Bordeaux mixture (2:2:250) or 2.5 g Blytox per liter.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,"	Plant Protection	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL METHE CONTROL OF TERMITE IN MANGO?,Dissolve 10 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC in liter of water for prevention of termite,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Tomato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT IN TOMATO CROP?,Spray 600 g of Indofil M-45 (Mancozeb 75 WP) dissolved in 200 liters of water per acre at an interval of 7 days in case of blight problem in tomato.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Tomato,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERLIUZER USE IN TOMATO CROP?,"At the time of field preparation, apply well formulated manure at the rate of 10 tonnes per acre and mix well into the soil. Apply nitrogen 60 kg (130 kg urea), phosphorus 25 kg (155 kg SSP) and potash 25 kg (45 kg MOP) per acre. Apply half of nitrogen and full of phosphorus and potash as an initial dose before planting. Apply one-fourth of the remaining nitrogen 20-30 days after transplanting. After two months of planting Paneeri, apply the remaining urea.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Tomato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FROST DAMAGE OF TOMATO CROP?,"To protect the tomato crop from blight, cover the soil and apply light water","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Tomato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF TOMATO?,"Improved Tomato Varieties - TH-1, Punjab Varkha Bahar-4, Punjab Gaurav, Punjab Sartaj, Punjab Red Cherry, Punjab Varkha Bahr-1, Punjab Varkha Bahar-2, Punjab Rata.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Tomato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF TOMATO?,Sowing time of Tomato nursery planting in October and transplanting in November-December. (poly house) Mid February,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Tomato,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN TOMATO?,"You can spray the herbicide within 3-4 days of planting the tomato crop, after that there is no herbicide on the grown weeds.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Tomato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN TOMATO CROP IN GREENHOUSE?,"For information about tomato, Dr. R Sharda -98555-45189","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
