Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETY OF CORIANDER?,Improved recommended variety of Coriander -Punjab fragrance and you can also plant local varieties,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF CORIANDER?,The best time to sow coriander is first week of October and last week of October to first week of November is suitable for sowing by seed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN CORIANDER?,Apply to control weeds in coriander crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MANGANESE DEFICIENCY IN CORIANDER?,"For better growth of Coriander and to remove yellowing, you should spray NPK 19:19:19 with manganese sulpahte.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF CORIANDER?,"For Coriander, 8-10 kg of seeds per acre is I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORIANDER SEED GERMINATION?,"Coriander seeds should be split into two and sown. If whole seeds are planted without cracking, the seeds will not germinate.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF CORIANDER?,"Coimtoor-1, Coimtoor-2, Lam C.S.-2, Lam C.S.-4, local varieties, Jalgaon Dhana, Y Dhana should be selected. Before sowing the seeds, rub the coriander and cut it into two parts. If a crop is to be grown for rice, 15 kg of seed is required per hectare. 30 to 40 kg of seed per hectare is enough for coriander. If the seeds are soaked overnight before sowing, the seeds germinate quickly i.e. in ten days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YEILD OF CORIANDER?,Coriander yields 10 to 15 tonnes per hectare during monsoon and winter season and 6 to 8 tonnes per hectare during summer season.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FETILIZER FOR CORIANDER?,Fertilizer planning in Coriander - 10:26:26 - 1 bag /acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON CORIANDER?,Coriander - Trichoderma viridi 30 grams /15 liters of water should be taken and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR CORIANDER?,Coriander 12:61:00 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Bavistin 30 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORIANDER CROP GROWTH?,Spray 19: 19: 19 by spraying 30 grams of solution in 15 liter of water for the growth of coriander crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING OF CORIANDER?,You can grow coriander as a crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF APHIDS ON CORIANDER?,Mava Control - Daman Che Bio 303 - Spray 22 ml /15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF APHID ON CORIANDER?,Spray with Pride (Acetamapride 20 SP) 07 g / 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORIANDER FERTILIZER DOSES?,For Coriander crop apply 4 kg/acre before planting. After 10 - 15 days after planting - for growth -19:19:19 60 gm + microla 30 ml + humic acid 30 ml /15 liter of water should be sprayed. Okra crop should be sprayed by taking - 00 52 34 60 gm + humic acid -30 ml + twenty two -30 gm /15 liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWING OF CORIANDER IN SUMMER SEASON?,In summer season if you have water availability you can cultivate this crop of coriander,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORIANDER CULTIVATION?,"Coriander Cultivation -Coimtoor-1, Coimtoor-2, Lam C.S.-2, Lam C.S.-4, local varieties, Jalgaon Dhana, Y Dhana should be selected. Before sowing the seeds, rub the coriander and cut it into two parts. If a crop is to be grown for rice, 15 kg of seed is required per hectare. 30 to 40 kg of seed per hectare is enough for coriander. If the seeds are soaked overnight before sowing, the seeds germinate quickly i.e. in ten days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR CORIANDER?,For Coriander growth -19:19:19 40 gm + Micro in 30 ml /15 liter water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORIANDER VARIETIES FOR SUMMER CULTIVATION?,"Coriander Cultivation Improved Varieties= No. 65, T5365, NPJ 16, V1, V2, and Ko-1, D-92, D-94, J214, K45, are local and improved varieties of Coriander.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOWING OF CORIANDER?,Mikrolla 30ml +M-45 30g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH SPRAY FOR CORIANDER CROP?,19:19:19 3000 g + Microla 1000 ml + Bavistein 400 g + Humic acid 1000 ml / 200 L of water and spray for 1 acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF BLIGHT ON CORIANDER?,"KOTHIMBIR KARAPA NIYANTRAN -M-45, 30 gm/15 liters of water should be sprayed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses, INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR CORIANDER?,Coriander - 19:19:19 60 grams + humic acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGAL DISEASE ON CORINDER?,Coriander crop should be sprayed with Traizophos-30 ml + (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) 30 g/15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORIANDER BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,"When crop is grown for seed purpose, apply Nitrogen@30kg/acre i.e 65kg/acre in two doses, half at sowing time and remaining at time of flower initiation. To attain fast growth 15-20 days after germination take spray of Triacontanol hormone@20ml/10Ltr.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME AVERAGE YIELD FOR CORIANDER?,Get 120 -160 kg of coriander seed per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BIO- FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT FOR CORIANDER?,"1 kg of Azospirillum, 1 kg of phosphobacteria and 20 kg of fertilizer per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Coriander,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORIANDER SOWING SEASON AND DURATION?,October - November. Can sow and 90 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN VEGETABLES?,"Treat for weeds in vegetables, no herbicide recommended","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGUS IN CUCUMBER?,You can spray 40 ml of confidor in cucumber to prevent the leaves from turning,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF YELLOWNESS IN CUCUMBER AFTER RAIN?,You can spray 500 gm M-45 in 200 liters of water to prevent leaf yellowing in cucumber.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING TIME OF CUCUMBER?,The sowing time of cucumber is February-March,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT IN CUCUMBER?,Dilute 2 grams of Bavistan per liter of water to protect the cucumber crop from blight.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT-ROT IN CUCUMBER?,Mix 500 grams of clear (Carbendazim + Mancozeb) with 15-20 kg of sand and spread it per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DUMPING OFF DISEASE CONTROL IN CUCUMBER CROP?,"Spray of 500 g Indofil Z-78, 75 WP in 200 liter water or Bavistin (carbendazim 50% wp) 3 gm/ liter water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF VIRUS IN CUCUMBER?,Remove the diseased plants from the cucumber crop and spray 400 ml of Melathion (oil to control whitefly) in 100 liters of water for one acre to prevent the spread of the disease.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RED PUMPKIN BEETLE IN CUCURBITS?,Spray 3ml malathion per liter of water to control red blight in cucumber.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF APHIDS OR OTHER SUCKING PEST IN CUCUMBER?,Spray 250 ml of malathionon or 200 ml of Rogor mixed with 100 liters of water for one acre to control sap-sucking insects in cucumber.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO CONTROL FUNGAL DISEASES IN CUCUMBER?,Spray 3 grams of Indofil M45 per liter of water to prevent fungal disease in cucumber.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR CUCUMBER?,For Cucumber growth -19:19:19 40 g + microla 30 ml + humic acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be diluted.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON CUCUMBER/ TOMATO/ BRINJAL CROP?,Super Confidor / Confidor (Imidacloprid 17.8%) should be sprayed with 10 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR ON CUCUMBER?,Chlorpyrifos (20%) should be sprayed at 30 ml/15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF LEAF MINER ON CUCUMBER?,Spray Cucumber-Nagali-Nimboli extract 1500 ppm 2 ml/1 liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL FRUIT FLY ATTACK ON CUCUMBER CROP?,"Guard trap, Navroji stone trap and fly tea trap etc. for fruit fly control in cucumber crop. Yellow round dome traps are available.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF CUCUMBER?,"Cucumber Cultivation Varieties Himangi, Phule Shubhangi, Poona Khira, Sheetal Priya JK-Manali","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF CUCUMBER CROP?,"Cultivated Varieties of Cucumber Crop Himangi, Phule Shubhangi, Poona Khira, Sheetal Priya JK-Manali","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR CUCUMBER?,For Cucumber crop - Fertilize 19:19:19 2 kg + Microlla 200 ml + Humic acid 200 ml per acre through drip.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING OF CUCUMBER SEED?,Cucumber seeds should be planted in the soil at a depth of three to five centimeters,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF THRIPS, APHIDS, JASSIDS ON CUCUMBER?",Actra (Thiomithosome 25%) 5 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed and after this spraying cucumber should not be taken to market for 8-10 days..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CULTIVATION OF CUCUMBER?,"Cucumber planting - should be done in the months of January-February. This crop requires 2.5 to 4 kg of seeds per hectare. Cucumber - Varieties - Himangi, Phule Shubhangi, Poona Khira, Sheetal Priya JK- Manali Gypsy","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ASK FOR CUCUMBER PLANTATION?,"Cucumber Planting Period - It is important to plant cucumber crop in the months of June or July and January or February of the year. Before planting, the field should be tilled well and proper quantity of dung should be supplied. Better if the soil is tested. 50 kg Palash 50 kg Phosphorus should be supplied in proper quantity. The supply of nitrogen should be divided into two phases rather than simultaneously. Supply of chemical fertilizers 1st dose should be given about 3 weeks after weeding and 2nd dose after 6 weeks.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cucumber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF CUCUMBER?,Cucumber is cultivated in Kharif and Summer season. Cucumbers are planted in the month of June-July for the Kharif season and in the month of January for the summer season.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE ROW TO ROW SPACING AND DEPTH FOR SOWING OF WHEAT?,"For sowing of wheat, keep row to row spacing of 15-20 cm and seed depth of 4-6 cm. During subsequent sowing, keep row spacing of 15 cm only.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE ROW TO ROW SPACING AND DEPTH FOR SOWING OF WHEAT WITH HAPPY SEEDER?,"For wheat sowing with Happy Seeder, keep row to row spacing of 15-20 cm and seeding depth of 3.5-5.5 cm.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE NEW VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,"New varieties of wheat-P. B. W 869 (average yield-23.2, days-158, height-101 cm), p. B. W 824 (average yield-23.3, days-156, height-104 cm), p. B. W 803 (average yield-22.7, days-151, height-100 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT HD-3226 AND RECOMMENDATION?,"Average yield of HD-3226 variety of wheat is 23 quintals per acre, it matures in 142 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT DBW 222 AND AVAILABILITY OF SEED OF THIS VARIETY?,"The average yield of DBW-222 variety of wheat is 22.3 quintals per acre, it matures in 152 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT DBW 187 AND RECOMMENDATION?,"The average yield of wheat variety DBW-187 is 22.6 quintals per acre, it matures in 148 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT DBW 173 AND RECOMMENDATION?,"The average yield of DBW-173 wheat variety is 18.8 quintals per acre, it matures in 122 days and this variety has not yet been recommended by Punjab Agricultural University.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETY PBW824 OF WHEAT?,P. B. W824: Its average height is 104 cm. and this variety takes 156 days to mature. This variety is free from brown rot and moderately resistant to yellow rot. Its average yield is 23.3 quintals per acre. Hectoliter weight of this type of grain is more.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETY PBW803 OF WHEAT?,"P. B. W803: Its average height is 100 cm. and this variety takes 151 days to mature. This variety is fully resistant to brown fungus and moderately resistant to yellow fungus. Its average yield is 22.7 quintals per acre. This variety is recommended for the South West region of Punjab (Bathinda, Faridkot Fazilka, Mansa and Sri Muktsar Sahib).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETIES OF WHEAT (2021)?,"New varieties of wheat- PBW 869 (Yield-23.2 quintal), PBW 824 (Yield-23.3 quintal), PBW 803 (Yield-22.7 quintal), Golden PBW 766 (Yield-23.1 quintal), PBW 1 Chapati (Yield-17.2 quintals), DBW 222 (Yield-22.3 quintals), DBW 187 (Yield-22.6 quintals), HD 3226 (21.9 quintals), PBW 771 (Yield-19.0 quintal) and PBW 757 (yield-15.8 quintal).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOTAL FERTILIZER APPLICATION IN WHEAT CROP FERTILIZERS FOR WHEAT CROP-APPLY 90 KG UREA, 55 KG DAP OR 155 KG SUPER PHOSPHATE, 40 KG MURIATE OF POTASH (IN GURDASPUR, HOSHIARPUR ROPAR AND SHAHEED BHAGAT SINGH NAGAR DISTRICTS) OR 20 KG MURIATE OF POTASH IN OTHER AREAS OF PUNJAB BASED ON THE SOIL TESTING REPORT. IF DAP IS USED FOR PHOSPHOROUS REDUCE UREA 20 KG. YOU CAN ALSO APPLY NPK (12:32:16) 80 KG PER ACRE RATHER THAN DAP, THEN APPLY 90 KILO UREA AT FIRST AND SECOND IRRIGATION.?","Fertilizers for wheat - 90 kg urea, 55 kg DAP or 155 kg super phosphate and 40 kg muriate of potash (in Gurdaspur, Hoshiarpur, Ropar and Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar districts) or 20 kg muriate of potash (rest of Punjab) Apply as per soil test report in districts), replace DAP with NPK (12:32:16) 80 kg per acre and apply urea only at 90 kg","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CROP DURATION OF PR 128 VARIETY?,crop duration of PR 128 variety 111 days after transplanting.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS FROM THE VACANT FIELD BEFORE SOWING OF WHEAT?,"Before sowing of wheat, spray 500 ml Gramoxone 24 SL (Paraquat) in 200 liters of water per acre to prevent weevils from the empty field.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PRE-EMERGENCE HERBICIDES USED IN THE WHEAT?,To control weeds in wheat crop 1.5 liter Stomp 30 EC (Pedimethalin) or 60 g Avkira 85 WG (Pyroxasulfone) or 1 liter Platform 38.5 SE (Pedimethalin 35%+Metribugin 3.5% SE) to 200 liters of water. Put it in and spray it within 2 days of wheat sowing,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT FOR PROTECTION FROM LOOSE SMUT AND FLAG SMUT?,Treat 40 kg of seed with 13 ml of Rexyl EG/Oreas 6 FS (Tabuconazole) dissolved in 400 ml of water or 120 g of Vitawax Power 75 WS (Carboxin+Tetra Methylthiurum Disulfide) to prevent leaf spot and leaf blight. ) or amend with 80 gm Vitavax 75 WP (Carboxin) or 40 gm Tabusid/Cedex/Exzol 2DS (Tabuconazole) per 40 kg of seed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW VARIETIES OF WHEAT RELEASED BY PAU?,"PBW 803, PBW 824, PBW 869","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LODGING OF WHEAT CROP?,"Select short statured variety Complete the recommended amount of urea fertilizer for 60 days and in addition apply light water during irrigation as per weather information, stunting does not affect grain quality much.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF GRASSY LEAF WEEDS IN WHEAT BEFORE FIRST IRRIGATION?,"Apply Arilon Isoproteuron 75 WP (300 gms for light soils, 400 gms for medium soils and 500 gms for heavy soils) or 13 gm Leader 75 WG (sulfosulfuran) in 150 liters of water. Spray 2-3 days prior to first watering in fields where any broad leaf crop is intersown with wheat Do not spray Sulfosulfuran In fields where Sulfosulfuran has been sprayed Do not sow Chari or Maize in kharif |","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE COMBINED CONTROL OF GRASSY WEEDS AND BROAD LEAF WEEDS IN WHEAT?,"16 g Total/Markpower 75 Wg (Sulfosulfuran 75 W + Metsulfuran 5 Wg) or 160 g Atlantis 3.6 WDG (Mizosulfuran 3% WDG + Idosulfuran) for control of grassy weeds and broadleaf weeds in wheat crop. 0.6% WDG) or 500 ml Accord Plus 22 EC (Finoxaprop 8% EC+ Metribugin 14%) or 200 g Shagun 21-11 (Clodinafop 12%+ Metribugin 42%) or 240 g ACM- 9 WP (Clodinafop 9%+Metribugin 20%) OR 500 g Arilon/Delron/Hilproturon/Ronak/Wonder/Isoheat/Kanak etc. (Isoproteuron 75 WP) OR 160 g Topic/Point/Moulah/Rakshak Plus/Jai Vijay/ Topal/Markclodina/Columbus (clodinafop 15 WP) or 400 ml Puma Power (Finoxaprop-p-ethyl 10 EC) 250 g 2,4-D sodium salt 80 WP or 250 ml ethyl ester 38 EC or 10 g Algrip/Algrip Royal/Markgrip/Makoto (Metsulphuran 20 WP) tank mix Spray within 35-45 days of wheat sowing after first watering Accord Plus 22 EC, ACM-9 and Shagun 21-11 PB of wheat Do not spray on W550, and advanced PBW550 type","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF GRASSY LEAF WEEDS IN WHEAT AFTER FIRST IRRIGATION?,500 g Arilon (Isoproteuron 75 WP) or 160 g Topical (Clodinafap 15 WP) or 400 ml Axial (Pinoxadin 5 EC) or 400 ml Puma Power (Finoxaprop-p-ethyl) for control of grassy weeds in wheat crop. 10 EC) or 13 g Leader 75 WG (sulfosulfuran) in 150 liters of water and spray within 30-35 days of wheat sowing after the first watering in fields where any broad leaf crop is mixed with wheat. Do not spray Sulfosulfuran where it has been sown.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FIRST IRRIGATION IN WHEAT?,First water should be given to wheat crop 21-25 days after sowing,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF POTASH DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT?,"If there are signs of deficiency of potash in the crop, sprinkle NPK 00:00:50 in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF PINK STEM BORER WHEAT?,800 ml Acalx 25 EC (Quinlphas) or 20 ml FEM (Flubedamide 480 SC) or 50 ml Corazan (Chlorantraniliprole 18.5 SC) or 1 liter Chlorpyrifas 20 EC or 80 g Spray Proclaim (Amamectin Benzoate 5SG) in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT THE LATE VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,"Late varieties of wheat- PBW 752 (Yield-19.2 quintal), PBW 771 (Yield- 19 quintal) and PBW 757 (Yield-15.8 quintal) | If sowing is to be done by mid-January, give preference to PBW 757","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BROAD LEAF WEEDS IN WHEAT CROP?,"250 g 2,4-D sodium salt 80 WP or 250 ml ethyl ester 38 EC or 10 g Algrip (metsulfuran 20 WP) or 20 g Am/affinity (carfentrazone ethyl) for control of broadleaf weeds in wheat crop. 40 DF) or 20 g of Lamphida (metsulfuran + carfentrazone) in 150 liters of water within 30-35 days of crop sowing after the first watering and if any broadleaf crop is planted with wheat, No herbicides can be used","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SULFUR DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT?,"Add 100 kg of gypsum per acre at the time of land preparation in sulfur deficient soils. If the phosphorus content in the form of single superphosphate is given to the wheat crop, gypsum is not required and if sulfur deficiency is found, gypsum can be added to the standing crop as well. is","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE USE OF GYPSUM IN WHEAT?,Gypsum is applied to the field before planting and is applied at the rate of 100 kg per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF MANGANESE DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT?,"If the wheat crop shows signs of manganese deficiency, spray 1 kg manganese sulphate (containing 30.5% manganese and 17% sulfur) in 200 liters of water per acre at 3 weekly intervals. - 4 sprayings are required. The first spraying should be done before the first water and after the remaining water It should be noted that the spraying of manganese should be done only on sunny days","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TERMITE CONTROL IN WHEAT CROP?,Apply 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC mixed with 15-20 kg of sand in moist vehicle or after light irrigation.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GULLI DANDA CONTROL IN WHEAT CROP IF CROP IS ON 30-35 DAYS OLD?,"Spray of Isoproturon 75 WP 500 g for all types of soil, Topik 15 WP (clodinafop) 160 g, Axial 5 EC (pinoxaden*) 400 ml, Puma Power 10 EC (fenoxaprop-p-ethyl) 400 ml, Leader/SF- 10/Safal/ Marksulfo (sulfosulfuron*) 75 WG 13 g on 30-35 days of sowing, using 150 liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GULLI DANDA WEED CONTROL IN WHEAT IF CROP IS 20 DAYS OLD AND WEED ARE 2-3 LEAF STAGES?,Advised to farmer to control of gulli danda in wheat field if crop 20 days old and weed is 2-3 leaf stage spray before irrigation of Arelon (isoproturon) 300 g in light textued; 400 g in medium textured and 500 g in heavy textured soils using 150 liter.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF WHEAT?,"40 kg seed per acre for all wheat varieties but 45 kg seed per acre for advanced PBW 550, and PBW 869.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT IN HOW MANY DAYS THE RECOMMENDED DOSE OF UREA SHOULD BE NECESSARY TO COMPLETE IN WHEAT CROP?,Apply the recommended amount of urea to the wheat crop within 55 days of wheat sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ARMY WORM IN WHEAT?,"For wheat borer control, spray 400 ml of Acalx 25 EC (Quinalfas) in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN WHEAT WHERE OTHER HERBICIDE CAN'T CONTROL THE WEEDS?,200 g of Shagun 21-11 (Clodinafop 12%+Metribugin 42%) or 240 g of ACM-9 WP (Clodinafop 9%+Metribugin 20%) at 150 g in fields where other herbicides are not controlling weeds. Spray in liter water within 35-45 days of sowing wheat,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF BROAD LEAF WEEDS IN WHEAT BEFORE FIRST IRRIGATION?,"For control of grassy weeds before first watering in wheat crop, spray 13 g Leader 75 WG (Sulfosulfuran) in 150 liters of water 2-3 days before first watering.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR IN ROOTS OF WHEAT?,Mix one liter of chloroperiphos 20 EC with 20 kg of sand and sprinkle it with water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE TIME OF FIRST IRRIGATION IN WHEAT CROP?,Advised to farmers that apply first irrigation in wheat crop on 21 days crop after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF MANGANESE DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT CROP?,In manganese deficient soils first spray 0.5% manganese sulphate (1 kg manganese sulphate in 200 liters of water) 3-4 days before first watering and remaining 3 more sprays after first watering on sunny days at weekly intervals. do,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF AMERICAN CATERPILLAR IN WHEAT?,"For control of American blight in wheat crop, spray 800 ml of Acalx 25 EC (Quinalfas) in 100-125 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TIMELY SOWN VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,"Timely sowing varieties of wheat-Advanced PBW 343 (Yield-23.2 quintals), Advanced PBW 550 (Yield-23 quintals), PBW1 Zinc (Yield-22.5 quintals), PBW 725 (Yield-23 quintals) -22.9 quintals), PBW 677 (Yield-22.4 quintals), HD 3086 (Yield-23 quintals), HD 2967 (21.4 quintals), WH 1105 (Yield-23.1 quintals), PBW 621 (Yield -21.1 quintal), PBW 550 (Yield-20.8 quintal), p. B. W 869 (average yield-23.2), p. B. W 824 (average yield-23.3 quintal), p. B. W 803 (average yield-22.7 quintals), Golden PBW 766 (average yield-23.1 quintals), PBW 1 Chapati (average yield-17.2 quintals), DBW 222 (average yield-22.3 quintals), DBW 187 (average yield-22.6 quintals), HD 3226 (average yield-21.9 quintals)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FERTILIZER REQUIREMENT FOR WHEAT CROP SOWN WITH HAPPY SEEDER AND SUPER SEEDER?,"65 kg DAP per acre if wheat is sown under happy seeder or super seeder and in potash deficient lands apply murate of potash at sowing based on soil test report and 40-40 of urea. Add 2 installments of 1 kg first and second with water If the soil is very heavy, then add the first installment of 35 kg of urea at the time of sowing and add the remaining 45 kg of urea with the first water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ZINC DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT?,"If the crop is found to be deficient in zinc, spray 1 kg zinc sulphate heptahydrate 21% and 500 g quicklime or 600 g zinc sulphate monohydrate 33% and 300 g quicklime in 200 liters of water per acre 10- Apply 2-3 sprays at an interval of 15 days","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF NITROGEN DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT?,If the wheat crop shows signs of deficiency of nitrogen element then add the recommended quantity of urea and if deficiency is found even after adding the recommended quantity of urea then 100 at 1 kg N:P:K 19:19:19 Put in liter of water and spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CORRECT TIME FOR FIRST IRRIGATION TO THE WHEAT CROP?,First water the wheat crop after 20-25 days of sowing,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BEST TIME TO APPLY UREA IN WHEAT CROP EVENING OR MORNING?,"Apply the fertilizer at any time in the morning or in the evening, but take care that if the fertilizer is to be applied in the morning, there is no dew on the leaves of the crop at that time, otherwise, if the fertilizer is applied on the dewy leaves, the leaves will start to curl. However, it is better if the fertilizer is applied in the evening because the dew that falls at night helps the fertilizer to dissolve quickly.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CORRECT TIMING OF UREA APPLICATION BEFORE OR AFTER THE IRRIGATION?,If it is light soil then apply water first and then apply fertilizer and if it is heavy soil then urea should be applied first then water should be applied and there should be a gap of at least 4-5 days between irrigation and urea.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE USAGE OF PRE-EMERGENCE HERBICIDES IN WHEAT SOWN WITH HAPPY SEEDER?,"If sowing of wheat is to be done with Happy Seeder, before sowing 1.5 liter Stomp 30 EC (Pedimethanalin) or 60 gm Avkira 85 WG (Pyroxasulfone) or 1 liter Platform 38.5 SE (Pedimethanalin 35%+Metribugin 3.5% SE) ) mix one of the herbicides with urea and spray per acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE GAP BETWEEN THE HERBICIDE SPRAY AND UREA APPLICATION?,Urea can be added when the weed starts to turn yellow after spraying the herbicide,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF PHOSPHOROUS DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT?,"If there are signs of phosphorus deficiency in the wheat crop, spray 1 kg of NPK in 100 liters of water at 17:44:00 per acre to meet it.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE TIMING OF FERTILIZER APPLICATION IN WHEAT CROP?,In wheat crop apply all phosphorus and all potash at sowing and half nitrogen 7 days before or 5 days after first watering and in light soils half nitrogen at last tillage and remaining nitrogen in 2 equal installments after first and second watering. put |,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE HEIGHT OF WHEAT VARIETIES?,"Timely sowing varieties of wheat- Advanced PBW 343 (Height-100 cm), Advanced PBW 550 (Height-86 cm), PBW 1 Zinc (Height-103 cm), PBW 725 (Height -105 cm), PBW 677 (Height-107 cm), HD 3086 (Height-96 cm), HD 2967 (Height-101 cm), WH 1105 (Height 97 cm), PBW 621 ( Height-100 cm) and PBW 550 (height 86 cm), p. B. W 869 (height-101 cm), p. B. W 824 (height-104 cm), p. B. W 803 (Height-100 cm), Golden PBW 766 (Day-155, Height-106 cm), PBW1 Chapati (Height-103 cm), DBW 222 (Height-103 cm), DB W 187 (Height-104 cm), HD 3226 (Height-106 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO COMPLETE THE NITROGEN DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT CROP?,"To complete nitrogen deficiency in wheat crop, mix 2 kg of urea with 100 liters of water and spray for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED GROWTH IN WHEAT?,Spray NPK (19:19:19) @ 1 kg in 100 liters of water for growth of wheat.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH OF WHEAT AFTER APPLIED RECOMMENDED DOSE OF UREA?,"Recommended amount of Urea Even after applying the crop, if crop growth is not complete, spray 1 kg of NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOWING OF WHEAT AFTER HERBICIDE APPLICATION?,"If the wheat starts turning yellow after spraying the herbicide, then to prevent it, add 1 kg of NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water and spray per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF WHEAT AFTER IRRIGATION IN HEAVY SOILS?,"If wheat starts turning yellow after irrigation in heavy lands, then to prevent it, add 2 kg of urea in 100 liters of water and spray per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HERBICIDE TIME OF EFFECT ON WHEAT CROP AFTER RAIN?,"No effect be on wheat crop if rain comes after herbicide spraying, weedicide effect could be low on weeds after rain.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH REGULATOR USED IN MUSTARD CROP AT THE TIME OF FLOWERING STAGE?,"To increase the quality of mustard seeds, spray 1 KG NPK (0:0:50) mixed with 100 liters of water for one acre during germination.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE APPLICATION OF SULFUR IN WHEAT CROP?,"Add 100 kg gypsum or 18 kg bentonite-sulphur (90%) per acre during soil preparation in sulfur deficient soils. Gypsum is not required if phosphorus is supplied to the wheat crop in the form of single superphosphate and if sulfur is found to be deficient, gypsum can be added to the standing crop as well.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE MATURITY PERIOD OF WHEAT VARIETIES?,"Maturity time of different varieties of wheat- Advanced PBW 343 (Time-155 days), Advanced PBW 550 (Time-145 days), PBW1 Zinc (Time-151 days), PBW 725 (time-154 days), PBW 677 (time-157 days), HD 3086 (time-156 days), HD 2967 (time-157 days), WH 1105 (time-157 days), P BW 621 (time-158 days) and PBW 550 (time-146 days), p. B. W 869 (day-158), p. B. W 824 (Day-156), p. B. W 803 (Day-151), Golden PBW 766 (Day-155), PBW1 Chapati (Day-154), DBW 222 (Day-152), DBW 187 (Day-153), HD 3226 (Day-155)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PINK STEM BORER, TERMITE AND ROOT BORER IN WHEAT CROP?","For control of pink stem borer on wheat, spray 800 ml Acalx (Cunelphos 25 EC) or 80 gm Proclam or 60 gm Coragen mixed with 100-120 liters of water per acre and 1 liter for root or stem borer. Mix 15-20 kg of soil with Chlorpyrifos 20 EC and spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF WHEAT FOR RAINFED CONDITIONS?,Use 40 kg of seed per acre for sowing wheat under rainy conditions,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SUFFICIENT GAP BETWEEN HERBICIDE APPLICATION AND UREA?,"Urea can be applied when the weed starts to turn yellow after spraying the herbicide, because once the weed turns yellow, it is less likely to re-emerge. If put, the weed starts growing again","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH AND CONTROL NITROGEN DEFICIENCY AFTER APPLYING THE RECOMMENDED AMOUNT OF UREA TO THE WHEAT CROP?,Spray 1 kg NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liters of water per acre to meet crop growth and nitrogen deficiency after applying the recommended amount of urea to the wheat crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CUTTING OF WHEAT LEAVES FROM TOP?,"In the wheat crop, the leaves do not need to be cut from the top","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BROAD LEAF WEED CONTROL ON 35-45 DAYS OLD CROP?,"Spray of tank mix Topik/Puma Power 160 g with 2,4-D/Algrip 6 g or Tank-mix of isoproturon 500 g and 2,4-D sodium salt or ethyl ester 250ml on 35-45 days old crop in 150 liter water","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN WHEAT CROP?,Spray of NPK 19:19:19 in 100 liter water per acre for nutrient management in wheat crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT WHY THE HERBICIDE IS NOT PROPERLY CONTROL THE WEEDS?,"No herbicide will ever kill 100% of the weeds, it will kill about 80% of the weeds and the remaining weeds not killed by the herbicide should be pulled by hand.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN WHEAT?,"For prevention of root rot problem in wheat, 500 grams of clear (Carbendazim 12%+Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15-20 kg of sand and sprinkled per acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOSE OF NANO UREA?,500 ml of nano urea can be sprayed in one acre according to 100-125 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPRAY OF GROWTH REGULATOR IN WHEAT VARIETY HD-3226 FOR HEIGHT CONTROL?,0.2% lihocin (chlormiquat chloride 50% SL) 200 ml in 100 liters of water per acre to control stunting of HD 3226 variety. 2 sprays are necessary at the first tillering stage about 70 days after sowing. -After 75 days and the second spraying should be done at the time of flag leaf emergence.I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAGNESIUM DEFICIENCY CONTROL IN WHEAT CROP?,Spray of 1 kg magnesium sulfate dilute in 200 liter water for deficiency control in wheat crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TIME OF FIRST IRRIGATION IN WHEAT CROP?,The first watering of wheat should be done between 21 days and 25 days!,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT WHICH TYPE OF NOZZLE IS USED FOR BETTER RESULT OF HERBICIDES?,Use flat fan or flood jet nozzles during pre-emergent herbicide application for weed control in wheat crop and flat fan nozzles for post-emergent weed control.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT WHY CAN'T WE SPRAY ANY HERBICIDE ON WHEAT CROP AFTER 2 MONTHS OF SOWING?,You cannot spray any herbicide in a 2 month wheat crop because if the weed grows late then by that time the wheat crop covers the whole field and the weed is below the crop and the herbicide does not reach the weed. In reaching or later crop usually 2 month crop if weed above wheat it will be more than 5 leaves and most herbicides are capable of killing weeds till 3-4 leaf stage only.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GRASS WEED & BROAD LEAF WEED CONTROL ON 35-45 DAYS OLD CROP?,"Spray of tank mix Topik/Puma Power 160 g with 2,4-D/Algrip 6 g or Tank-mix of isoproturon 500 g and 2,4-D sodium salt or ethyl ester 250ml on 35-45 days old crop in 150 liter water or Spray of 2, 4-D sodium salt 80 WP 250 g or 2, 4-D ethyl ester 38 EC 250 ml to control bathu, billi booti, jangli hallon, pitpapra, jangli senji, maina, maini, jangli palak on 35 -45 days old crop in 150 liter water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BEST TIME OF GIVEN UREA FERTILIZER IN WHEAT CROP?,Advised to farmer if field soil is heavy then farmer can give urea before 2-3 days of irrigation & if field soil texture is light then give urea after irrigation.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FOLIAR SPRAY FOR INCREASING GRAIN YIELD OF WHEAT?,2% potassium nitrate NPK 13:00:45 (2 kg NPK 13:00:45 in 100 liters of water) at the time of leaf emergence and Spray at bud break,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF WHEAT AFTER FIRST IRRIGATION IN HEAVY SOILS?,Spray 2% urea (2 kg urea in 100 liters of water) per acre to prevent yellowing of wheat after waterlogging in heavy soils.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOTAL FERTILIZER APPLICATION IN WHEAT CROP?,"Fertilizer for wheat crop - 90 kg urea, 55 kg DAP or 155 kg super phosphate, 40 kg muriate of potash (in Gurdaspur, Hoshiarpur Ropar and Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar districts) or 20 kg muriate of potash in other areas of Punjab. Soil test report If DAP is used to reduce phosphorus urea by 20 kg then you can apply NPK (12:32:16) 80 kg per acre instead of DAP, then apply 90 kg urea on first and second irrigation.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR BETTER GROWTH OF WHEAT?,"For good growth of wheat, you can spray Ifco powder by mixing it in a liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPOTENT POINTS KEPT IN MIND IF WE ARE USING ACCORD PLUS 22 EC, SHAGUN 21-11 (METRIBUZIN+CLODINAFOP) AND ACM-9 (METRIBUZIN+CLODINAFOP) HERBICIDES IN WHEAT CROP?","If you use Accord Plus 22 EC (Finoxaprop 8% EC+ Metribujin 14%), Shagun 21-11(Clodinafop 12%+ Metribujin 42%) and ACM-9 WP (Clodinafop 9%+ Metribujin 20%) ) when using herbicides in wheat, keep these special points in mind - use these herbicides where the common herbicides do not kill the shoot. Do not spray these herbicides on the Advanced PBW 550 variety, which has adverse effects. Do not use these herbicides in light soils","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LATE SOWING 2851 VARIETY?,Wheat variety 2851 suitable for sowing in December has an average yield of 23 quintals per acre and matures in 126 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SUFFICIENT GAP BETWEEN HERBICIDE APPLICATION AND NUTRIENT SPRAY?,"After spraying the herbicide, when the weed begins to turn yellow, the element can be sprayed because once the weed turns yellow, it is less likely to re-emerge. If the substance is sprayed, the weed starts growing again","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BEST TIME OF HERBICIDE APPLICATION?,Apply the medicine from the dew and it is more beneficial in clear weather than on a foggy day,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CUT WORM INSECT MANAGEMENT IN WHEAT CROP?,CUTWORM INSECT MANAGEMENT IN WHEAT CROP: IN STANDING CROP ADD CHLORPYRIPHOS 20 EC IN SAND AND BROADCAST THE MIXTURE IN THE INFECTED FIELD. HOEING IS MUST AFTER BROADCASTING. IN THE NEXT SEASON APPLY PHORATE @ 500 GRAM PER CANAL AREA OF LAND BEFORE SOWING OF CROP TO MANAGE THE CUT WORM INSECT PROBLEM IN THE FIELD.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOWING OF LEAVES IN WHEAT?,There is no need to spray yellow wheat due to frost,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE OPTIMUM LEVEL OF IRRIGATION IN WHEAT?,"First water after 20-25 days, second water after 55-60 days, third water after 95-100 days, fourth water after 130-135 days, but if only 1 water is possible then apply after 20-25 days, if 2 water Apply first after 20-25 days if possible, second after 90-95 days and if possible 3 waterings then first after 20-25 days, second after 70-75 days and third after 110-115 days","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF AFTER IRRIGATION WHEAT CROP BEING YELLOW?,If you have done irrigation and spray of nano urea you have no need to any spray. crop automatically retain.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF NUTRIENTS FOR BETTER GRAIN FILLING IN WHEAT?,"There is sometimes a problem in the wheat crop that if the temperature is high at the stage of grain filling, then either the grains are not formed completely in the stalks or the grain is left at all. To solve this problem, wheat crops 2% NPK 13:00:45 potassium nitrate (4 kg in 200 liters of water) should be sprayed at the time of flag leaf emergence and second bud fall.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN WHEAT AFTER 2 MONTHS OF SOWING OF CROP?,Spraying of any herbicide after 2 months of sowing in wheat crop is not recommended.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE APPLICATION OF ZINC IN WHEAT CROP?,In zinc deficient lands add 25 kg zinc sulphate heptahydrate 21% or 16 kg zinc sulphate monohydrate 33% at the time of land preparation. This quantity of zinc is sufficient for 2-3 years but if zinc is to be added for one year then 10 kg zinc sulphate. Add Heptahydrate 21% or 6.5 kg Zinc Sulphate Monohydrate 33% per acre Wheat does not require zinc application if the recommended amount of zinc has been applied to the saffron crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ZINC DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT CROP?,Spray 1 kg zinc (21%) mixed with 2 kg urea in 200 liters of water to meet zinc deficiency in wheat crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE MOISTURE CONDITION REQUIRED FOR HERBICIDE SPRAY?,"Weed killer can be sprayed when the soil becomes wet after applying water, i.e. when the foot is wet.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF DAP IN WHEAT CROP?,Spray 1 kg of DEP mixed with 100 liters of water for one acre to complete phosphorus deficiency in wheat crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SUFFICIENT GAP BETWEEN HERBICIDE APPLICATION AND IRRIGATION?,"Irrigation can be done when the weed begins to turn yellow after spraying the herbicide, because once the weed turns yellow, it is less likely to re-emerge if the weed is irrigated before the turn of the weed turns yellow. If done, the weed starts growing again","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHICH TIME APPLY UREA AFTER APPLYING HERBICIDE?,Advise to farmers that apply urea after 10-12 days of herbicide application.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE GAP BETWEEN THE HERBICIDE SPRAY AND NUTRIENT SPRAY?,"After the herbicide application, when the weed starts to turn yellow, the chemical spray can be applied.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE ALTERNATIVES OF UREA IF IT IS NOT AVAILABLE?,"If urea is not available, 200 kg of manure can be used to provide nitrogen to the wheat crop.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF WHEAT SOWING WITH ZERO TILL DRILL?,40 kg seed per acre for all wheat varieties but 45 kg seed per acre for advanced PBW 550 and PBW 550.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT AVAILABILITY FROM DAP?,"DAP contains 46% phosphorus and 18% nitrogen, use it as recommended.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT AVAILABILITY FROM NPK(12:32:16)?,"NPK (12:32:16) contains 32% phosphorus, 12% nitrogen and 16% potash.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR COMBINED CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR AND APHID IN WHEAT?,"To prevent rust and oil accumulation in wheat crop, spray 800 ml of Acalx 25 EC (Quinalfas) in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE METHOD OF SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT FOR TERMITE CONTROL?,"Dissolve 160 ml of chlorpyrifos 20 EC in 1 liter of water and spray 40 kg of seed in a thin layer on the paved floor, tarpaulin or plastic sheet.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW RECOMMENDED WHEAT VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,"New varieties of wheat-P. B. W 869 (average yield-23.2, days-158, height-101 cm), p. B. W 824 (average yield-23.3, days-156, height-104 cm), p. B. W803 (average yield-22.7, days-151, height-100 cm), Golden PBW 766 (average yield-23.1, days-155, height-106 cm), PBW1 Chapati (average yield-17.2, days-154, height-103 cm), DBW 222 (average yield-22.3, days-152, height-103 cm), DBW 187 (average yield-22.6, days-153, height-104 cm), HD 3226 (Avg yield-21.9, days-155, height-106 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING TIME OF WHEAT?,The sowing time of early sowing varieties of wheat is from the fourth week of October to the fourth week of November but the sowing time of advanced PBW 550 and PBW 550 varieties is from the second week of November to the fourth week of November.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FERTILIZER REQUIREMENT IN WHEAT SOWN WITH HAPPY SEEDER?,Fertilizers for wheat planted with Happy Seeder and Super Seeder-65 kg DAP. Apply at sowing I Apply two equal installments of 40 kg urea before first and second irrigation I Water immediately after application of urea I In saturated fields fearing late application of second irrigation 35 kg urea before sowing and 45 kg urea before sowing Add before water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF GYPSUM IN FIELD?,One ton of gypsum can be found in the field,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN WE SOW WHEAT WITH ROTAVATOR?,"Wheat can also be sown with a rotavator, it can also be plowed into stubble.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF WHEAT?,"40 kg seed per acre for all wheat varieties but 45 kg seed per acre for advanced PBW 550, PBW 869 and PBW 550.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING OF WHEAT BY SUPER SEEDER?,"It is important to have good moisture in the field while planting wheat with Super Seeder. If the moisture in the field is low, then the wheat does not grow fully and later there is no sure plow.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FERTILIZER REQUIREMENT FOR WHEAT CROP?,"Fertilizers for wheat - 110 kg urea, 55 kg DAP or 155 kg super phosphate and 40 kg muriate of potash (in Gurdaspur, Hoshiarpur, Ropar and Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar districts) or 20 kg muriate of potash (rest of Punjab) Add as per soil test report in districts) if 55 kg DAP is used then add 20 kg less urea per acre. So use phosphorus fertilizer and potash at the time of sowing and divide urea in 2 equal installments and add first and second water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SULFUR DEFICIENCY IN WHEAT?,"Sulfur deficiency causes yellowing of new leaves of wheat and to prevent this apply 100 kg gypsum or 18 kg bentonite-sulphur (90%) before sowing. If a single super phosphate is added for the phosphorus content, there is no need to add gypsum. Gypsum can be used in standing crop if sulfur deficiency is found","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHEAT TIMELY SOWN TIMELY SOWN (FROM FOURTH WEEK OF OCTOBER TO FOURTH WEEK OF NOVEMBER) IRRIGATED CONDITIONS. IRRIGATED CONDITIONS?,"For timely sowing of wheat (from the fourth week of October to the fourth week of November) the following varieties were planted in irrigated areas - PBW 869, PBW 824, PBW 803, PBW 766, Unnat PBW 343, PBW 725, PBW 677, HD 3086 , WH 1105 , HD 2967 , WHD 943 , PDW 291","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF WHEAT FOR SOWING WITH HAPPY SEEDER, SUPER SEEDER AND PAU SMART SEEDER?","If sowing wheat with Happy Seeder, Super Seeder or PAU Smart Seeder, 45 kg seed per acre for all varieties but 50 kg for advanced PBW 550, PBW 869 and PBW 550. The seed falls","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE ALTERNATIVES OF DI-AMMONIUM PHOSPHATE IF IT IS NOT AVAILABLE?,"If di-ammonium phosphate (DAP fertilizer) is not available to make phosphorus available to the wheat crop, then add 80 kg of N:P:K::12:32:16 and recommended amounts of urea and potash. 20 kg less than the amount done I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT SEED?,Seed treatment of wheat seed by thiamethoxam 70 WS doses is 1 gm/kg seed and 13 ml tebuconzole by dissolving in 400 ml water or 120 gm carboxin +tetrarum disulphide.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DAP FERTILIZER?,Instead of DAP you can use single superphosphate,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NEW RECOMMENDED LATE SOWING PBW 757 VARIETY OF WHEAT?,The new variety of wheat is PBW 757. It is suitable for sowing in the first fortnight of January. It has an average yield of 15.8 quintals per acre and matures in 114 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF WHEAT FOR VARIETIES UNNAT PBW 550 AND PBW 869?,The seed rate is 45kg per acre for advanced PBW 550 and PBW 869.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT TO PROTECT FROM TERMITE?,Treat wheat seed with 4 ml of chlorpyrifos 20 EC per kg of seed to protect the wheat crop from weevil attack. It also protects the seed from bird attack.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO PREPARE WASTE DECOMPOSER?,"To prepare a solution of waste decomposer, mix a jar of waste decomposer with 2 kg jaggery and 200 liters of water and keep for 5 days. take","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING TIME OF TIMELY SOWN VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,"The sowing time of early sowing varieties of wheat is from the fourth week of October to the fourth week of November, but the sowing time of the advanced PBW 550 variety is from the second week of November to the fourth week of November.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOIL REQUIREMENT FOR WHEAT CULTIVATION?,"Wheat can be grown in all types of land, except for cultivator and soybean lands Medium to heavy soils are suitable for seed wheat","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT WITH FUNGICIDE?,"About pre-sowing seed treatment for prevention of leaf blight and leaf blight in wheat crop. Yes, so apply 13ml of Oreus 6FS (Tabuconazole) dissolved in 400ml of water per 40kg of seed or 3g of Vitavax Power 75WS (Carboxin+Tetramethyl Thiurum Disulphide) or 2g of Vitavax 75WP. (Carboxin) or 1 gm Tabucid 2 DS (Tabuconazole) or 2 ml Neonix 20 FS (Imidacloprid+Hexaconazole) per kg seed. It is worth noting that if the seed is treated with Neonix 20 FS (Imidacloprid + Hexaconazole), then no separate treatment is required for sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,Wheat : Godavari (NIDW : 295) Tapovan (NIAW 917),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING FOR GROWTH ON WHEAT?,For wheat growth 12:61:00 60 g + Microla 30 ml/Nutribuild 20 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR WHEAT?,At sowing wheat fertilizers Urea 2 bags (in three equal installments 30 days after 65 days) Single superphosphate 125 kg + 35 kg murate of potash should be applied.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN WHEAT?,Wheat - Weedicide - Allagrip - Metsulfuron Methyl 20 % WG - Spray at 8 g/acre (20 g per ha) 25 to 35 days after planting DuPont India,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF WHEAT?,"Wheat Improved Varieties-Flower Solution, Tapovan, Trimbak, Godavari, Ajit 104, Myco-Pratham(70-70), Kordwahu-N 59, MACS 1967, NI 4539, AKDW 2997-16(Autumn)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHEAT CULTIVATION PERIOD?,Wheat Sowing Time: Field wheat should be sown in the second fortnight of October. Sowing should be done in the first fortnight of November. Late sowing should be done between November 16 and December 15. Delayed sowing of horticultural wheat after November 19 reduces wheat yield by 2.5 quintals per hectare for each fortnight of delay.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN BENGAL GRAM?,Gram weed killer - Chemical herbicide is not recommended at this stage of the crop so weeding should be done now.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH OF WHEAT CROP?,For growth of wheat crop - 19:19:19 60 g + Microla in 30 ml per 15 liters of water spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILT ATTACK ON WHEAT?,M-45 should be sprayed with 30 g/15 liters of water for control of blight on wheat crop. (Mancozeb 75% WP) (Indophil),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHEAT WEED MANAGEMENT?,Wheat - Weed killer - Allagrip - Metsulfuron methyl 20 % WG - Spray at 8 gm/acre at 25 to 35 days after planting DuPont India,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN WHEAT CROP?,"Water management should not be done immediately after spraying the herbicide in the wheat crop, as this may reduce the herbicide yield.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LATE SOWN VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,"wheat -breed -n. i. D. W - 15 (Panchavati) , N. i. A. W-301 (Trimbak)- N I Ye A W-1415 (Netravati) N. i. A. W-917 (Tapovan), Ajit-102,","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME POST EMERGENCE HERBICIDE FOR WHEAT?,"A pesticide called 2,4D can be used for wheat crop.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY ON WHEAT?,12:61:00 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Bavistin 30 g / 15 liters of water for spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASE GROWTH IN WHEAT C CROP?,19:19:19 60 gm + Microla should be sprayed with 30 ml / 15 l of water for more flowering and balanced growth in wheat crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON WHEAT?,Fungicides on wheat crop :- Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63% 30 gms / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHEAT VARIETIES?,Amber-28 duration 115-120 days Kedar 110-120 days duration,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOWING OF WHEAT?,"If wheat turns yellow, spray with Mikrolla 30 ml + Bavistin 30 gm / 15 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT FOR WHEAT?,"12:61:00, 60 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed in wheat crop.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF ROOT ROT ON WHEAT?,Root blight control on wheat crop -Radomil Gold 30 gm + humic acid 30 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR GROWTH OF WHEAT?,For growth - 19:19:19 - 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Bavistin 30 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR WHEAT CROP?,Urea 110 kg per acre (in three equal installments of 30 days after 65 days) single superphosphate 155 kg + 20 kg murate of potash should be given at the time of wheat sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RUST ATTACK ON WHEAT?,Tambera M-45 should be sprayed on wheat crop by taking 30 grams /15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR WHEAT?,For wheat growth 19:19:19 60 gm + microla 30 ml + clear 30 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR CONTROL YELLOWING LEAVES ON WHEAT CROP?,Carbendazim 50% 30 gm + Microla 30 ml per 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH ON WHEAT?,For growth -19:19:19 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Bavistein 30 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH SPRAY FOR WHEAT CROP?,For wheat growth =19:19:19 3000 g + Microla 1000 ml + Saf (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) 400 g + Humic acid 1000 ml /200 L of water and spray for 1 acre..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT ATTACK OF GRAM?,Death Control Spray 30 g / 15 liters of water (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR NUTRIENTS FOR WHEAT?,00:52:34 NPK Take 60 gms / 15 liters of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR ATTACK ON WHEAT?,Spray Nuwan 20 ml/15 liters of water (Dichlorvos 76% EC),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SHOOT BORER IN WHEAT?,Wheat :- Chlorpyrifos should be taken in 30 ml / 15 liters of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SHOOT BORER ON WHEAT?,Cutworms on wheat should be sprayed with Chlorpyrifos 30 ml/15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WILT IN WHEAT?,Control of blight in wheat crops :-Carbondenzyme 30 grams + humic acid 30 ml/15 liters of water should be applied. .,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WILT ON GRAM?,Blue Copper (copper oxychloride 50% WP)-30 g/15 liters of water should be mixed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME STEM BORER IN WHEAT?,Hamala 550 40 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed (Chlorpyrifos 20%EC + Cypermethrin 4%),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT ATTACK ON WHEAT?,"For control of blight on wheat, as soon as the outbreak of the disease appears, Mancozeb fungicide should be sprayed at the rate of 30 grams + 15 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL STEM BORER IN WHEAT?,Spray Trizophos 30 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RUST ATTACK ON WHEAT?,Tambera M-45 should be sprayed on wheat crop with 30 g/15 liters of water. (Mancozeb 75% WP) (Indophil),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO CONTROL RAT INFESTATION IN WHEAT FIELD?,Wheat - For rat control - Mix 6 grams of zinc phosphide (rat kill) with 100 grams of wheat flour to prepare its pellets and apply it in the field.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF RUST(TAMBERA) ON WHEAT?,"As soon as copper infection appears on the wheat crop, Mancozeb fungicide should be mixed with 30 g / 15 liters of water and sprayed. Spraying should be done at an interval of 10 to 15 days keeping in mind the severity of the disease.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF RUST ON WHEAT?,Wheat Karpa Control = 30 grams of blue copper mixed with 15 liters of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF BLIGHT ON WHEAT CROP?,Wheat Karpa :- Mancozeb (M-45) 30 gms/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATERPILLAR ON WHEAT?,Spray Alica (Thymethoxam (12.6%) + Lambdacyholothrin (9.5%)) at 80 ml per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON WHEAT CROP?,Saaf (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) 30 gms / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DESI GRAM VARIETIES FOR IRRIGATED CONDITIONS?,"Advanced Varieties of Desi Chhole (Barani) - PBG7, PGG5, GPF2, PDG4, PDG3.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF HAIRY CATERPILLAR IN MASH?,Spray 500 ml of Acalx 25 EC (Quinulfas) in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITE FLY IN MASH?,Spray 40 grams of Ektra 25 WG (thiamethoxam) in 100 liters of water per acre for the prevention of whitefly in a month.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WEED IN GRAM?,No weedicide is recommended in chickpea crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM SOWING SEASON AND VARIETY?,"September - November, Vamban 3, Vamban 4, Vamban 5, Vamban 6, Vamban 7, Vamban 8, Go 6, APK 1.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
