Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR IN BLACK GRAM?,Mix and spray propinophos at the rate of 2 ml per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF CATERPILLAR MANAGEMENT IN BLACK GRAM?,Mix propinophos 2 ml + neem oil 3 ml + sticky liquid 1 ml in 1 liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM SEASON AND VARIETY DETAILS?,"June - August , VBN (Bg) 4, VBN(Bg) 5, VBN 7","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACKGRAM TNAU FOLIAR APPLICATION?,TNAU crop onder 2 kg per acre mixed with 200 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM FOLIAR APPLICATION?,Soak DAP 2 kg per acre in 10 liters of water and take the clear water and mix it with 200 liters of water and spray it at the moment when the flower starts blooming.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR SPRAY IN BLACK GRAM?,DAP 2 kg/acre mixed with 200 liters of water should be sprayed on 30th and 45th day.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RODENT CONTROL IN THE FIELD?,Rye flour 100 gm + Sugar 50 gm + Coconut shell 2 + Bromotil 30 gm should be mixed and applied at 15 places per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT FOR BLACK GRAM?,Urea 22 kg + Super Phosphate 125 kg + Potash 17 kg/acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE BLACK GRAM VARIETIES IN ADIPATTAM?,"Vampan 4, Vampan 5, Vampan 7 and Vampan 8","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM SEED TREATMENT WITH AZOSPIRILLUM?,"250 grams of Azospirillum should be mixed with the required seed per acre, then rice porridge can be mixed little by little until it becomes waxy and then the seed can be dried and sown in a shady place.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM CROP INSURANCE INFORMATION?,Last date for crop insurance : 15-09-2020 Amount payable : Rs 327/ac Amount paid by Government : Rs 4823.72/ac Crop insurance amount : Rs 16351.6/ac,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHICH CROPS ARE GROWN AROUND THE BLACKGRAM FIELD?,"Maize, flat crop, green crop etc. can be cultivated.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM SEED TREATMENT INFORMATION?,Apply imidacloprid 70 WS at the rate of 5 gm per kg seed and sow.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE BLACK GRAM VARIETIES?,Urea 23 kg + super phosphate 62.5 kg + potash 8 kg should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACKGRAM FOLIAR NUTRIENT APPLICATION?,DAP 2 kg per acre should be soaked overnight and then sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM SOWING SEASON AND VARIETIES?,Season : Chitraipattam Variety : ATD 5,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR SPRAY AND TOP DRESSING APPLICATION FOR BLACK GRAM?,Foliar spraying and top dressing is not required.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISEASE MANAGEMENT IN BLACK GRAM?,Mix and spray wettable sulfur at the rate of 600 grams per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOW MOSAIC VIRUS IN BLACK GRAM?,Mix and spray Bipronil at the rate of 1.5 ml per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACKGRAM SOWING SEASON AND VARIETIES?,Adipattam (July-August) month is suitable,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLACK GRAM VARIETIES AND SEED RATE?,"VBN 6, VBN 8, 8 kg seed rate required per acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Black gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PEST MANAGEMENT IN STORED BLACK GRAM GRAINS?,Store at a height of one foot above the ground level and then apply Wasambu powder around the bundles.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FRUIT FLY IN GUAVA?,"Apply 16 PAU fruit fly traps per acre in the first week of July. To prevent fruit fly attack, the affected fruits should be removed from the field and destroyed. is Special attention should be paid to the cleanliness of the field. White non-woven envelopes can be put up in late June or mid-July to protect guava fruit from fruit fly.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FRUIT FLY IN FRUITS?,Mix 1250 ml Sumicidine 20EC (fenvalrate) in 500 liters of water and spray twice at the time of fruit ripening and apply 16 PAU fruit fly trap per acre in August.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF GUAVA?,"Varieties of guava are Punjab Shihta, Punjab Kiran, Shweta, Punjab Pink, Arka Amalia, Sardar, Allahabad Shihta and Punjab Apple Guava.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GUAVA?,"Recommended Varieties of Guava - Punjab Apple Guava, Punjab Shitha, Punjab Kiran, Punjab Pink, Punjab Sardar","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF GUAVA?,"Varieties of Guava - Punjab White, Punjab Kiran, Allahabad White, Punjab Pink, Shweta, Sardar","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME AVAILABILITY OF FRUIT FLY TRAP?,Fruit fly traps can be found from your nearest Krishi Vigyan Kendra,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PRUNING?,Cut the infected branches of the tree,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF FERTILIZERS IN GUAVA?,"In guava, full dose of Manure (country manure) and half dose of Urea, Single Super Phosphate and Murate of Potash should be applied in May to June and again in September to October.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAGNESIUM DEFICIENCY MANAGEMENT IN GUAVA?,Mix magnesium sulphate 10 gm/1 liter of water and spray foliar spray every two weeks,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GUAVA FOLIAR SPRAY APPLICATION?,19 :19 :19 Mix 5g + micronutrient mixture 5g / 1 liter of water and spray foliar at two week intervals.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEEDICIDE APPLICATION EFFECT IN GUAVA?,Spray water to reduce herbicide attack,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MEALY BUG MANAGEMENT IN GUAVA?,Propinophos 2 ml + Acetate 1 gm + Neem oil 3 ml + Grafting liquid 1 ml should be mixed with 1 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PRUNING FOR GUAVA INFORMATION?,"Generally, harvesting should be done in the months of September, October and March. Branches that occasionally appear at the base of the plants should be removed. The overgrown branches should be bent and their tip inserted into the soil to a depth of about one foot so that they do not move upwards.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROLLING MEALY BUG IN GUAVA?,Mix fish oil rosin soap 20 grams in one liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GUAVA MEALYBUG MANAGEMENT AND TEA MOSQUITO BUG MANAGEMENT?,Purabinophos 2 ml + Azadirachtin 3 ml + driving gum 1 ml / liter of water should be mixed and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BORON DEFICIENCY IN GUAVA?,Borax 5 grams should be mixed with one liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GUAVA SEEDLING AVAILABILITY?,Kotur Assistant Horticulture Officer G. Sreenivasan Phone 8489366009,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL MEASURE ON LEAF REDDENING AND WILTING OF GUAVA LEAF?,Magnesium Sulphate 50g + 13:40:13 60g + Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63% WP for control of leaf blight and scab in Guava. Spray 30 grams per 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GUAVA FLOWERING?,Boom Flower - 30 ml + 12:61:00 - 60 g + Mikrolla - 30 ml / 15 liter water spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT FOR GUAVA?,"PERU Drip the trees at the rate of zero: fifty-two: thirty-four, four kilograms per acre. ...","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR GUAVA?,Fertilizer should be given to guava crop :-00:52:34 4 kg/acre through drip. .,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR GUAVA FERTILIZATION?,"Fertilizers and water management: Manure or vermicompost: 15 kg per pit, Azotobacter: 50 g per pit, P. S. B: 50 grams Pratikhadda, K. M. B: 50 g per pit, Trichoderma: 50 g per pit, Nimboli powder: 50 g per pit, Follidol powder: 100 g should be used.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GUAVA BAHAR TIMING?,"guava naturally comes out 3 times. Mango trees bear flowers in the month of January-February and fruits in the month of August-August. In Mrig Bahar, trees bear flowers in June-July and fruits in November-January, and in Hast Bahar, trees bear flowers in September-October and fruits in March-May.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Guava,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY ON GUAVA?,19:19:19 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Bavistin 30 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME FOR RADISH CROP?,"Pusa Chetki type of Radish can be sown from April to August, Punjab White Radish-2, Japanese White from mid-September to October.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF TERMITE IN STANDING CROP?,Mix 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC with 15-20 kg of sand in moist vehicle or sprinkle lightly after irrigation.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH OF RADISH?,"For radish growth, spray 1 KG powder NPK (19:19:19) in 100 liters of water(@10 grams per liter) for one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INSECTICIDE SPRAY IN WHEAT CROP IN RELEVANCE TO WEATHER?,Do not spray any crop due to bad weather.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF RADISH CROP?,"Varieties of Radish Punjab White Radish-2, Japanese White and Punjab preferred time is mid September to October","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF RADISH?,The quantity of seed for Radish is four to five kg per acre I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YIELD OF RADISH VARIETIES?,"Varieties of Radish- Punjab White Radish-2 (Yield-236 quintals per acre), Japanese White (Yield-160 quintals per acre) and Punjab Pasam (Yield-215 quintals per acre).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED PRODUCTION OF CARROT?,"Apply 65 kg urea and 50 kg super phosphate to the seed-preparing crop, half urea and full phosphate at the time of sowing and the rest after 30 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF TERMITE IN RADISH?,"To prevent waterlogging in standing onion crops, apply 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC mixed with 15-20 kg of sand in a moist vehicle or lightly irrigate later.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF RADISH?,"Improved varieties of Radish are Punjab Safed Mooli - 2, Punjab Pasand, Pusa Himani, Pusa Chetki, Japanese White.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN RADISH?,"To prevent root rot in radish, sprinkle 500 g of clear (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15 kg of sand per acre or drenching at the rate of 3 g of Bavistin per liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YELLOWING OF LEAVES OF RADISH CROP?,"Due to excess water in the radish crop, the leaves turn yellow, the color will recover in a few days","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION IN RADISH?,Apply water immediately after sowing radish and later apply water according to the weather,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT?,"To prevent root rot problem, sprinkle 500 gm of clear (Carbendazim 12%+Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15-20 kg sand per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN RADISH?,"To protect the radish crop from root rot, sprinkle 500 gm of clear mixed with sand.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF APHIDS OR OTHER SUCKING PEST IN RADISH?,"To control sap-sucking insects, spray 350 ml of malathionon or 200 ml of Rogor in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ROOT ROT IN RADISH?,Mix 500 gm of sofilizer (Carbendazim + Mancozeb) in 15-16 kg of soil and sprinkle according to the kilo to prevent radish and gall.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF CARROT?,You can put 4 to 5 kg of seeds per acre for sowing carrot,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPACING FOR SOWING OF CARROT?,For small scale planting of carrots keep row to row spacing of 45 cm and plant to plant spacing of 7.5 cm. Sow at 10 cm row to row and 8 cm plant to plant 4 rows per bed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING OF VEGETABLES IN THIS MONTH?,"At this time you can sow radish, carrot, cabbage","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RADISH DURTION INFORMATION?,40 - 60 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF RADISH?,"Radish - Varieties - Pusa Himani, Pusa Desi, Pusa Chetaki, Pusa Reshmi, Japanese White, Ganesh Synthetic.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
