Vegetables,Radish,"	Plant Protection	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN  RADISH?,Sprinkle 500 grams of clear (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15 kg of sand per acre or drench at the rate of 3 grams of Bavistin per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF RADISH AND TURNIP?,The amount of seed for turnip should be two kilos and for radish four to five kilos,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME  OF RADISH?,"Varieties of Radish Punjab White Radish-2, Japanese White and Punjab preferred time is mid September to October","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Radish,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF CARROT?,The sowing time of carrot is September - October,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Spinach,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER USES OF PALAK?,"Apply 10 tonnes of manure, 75 kg of urea and 75 kg of super phosphate, all phosphorus and manure at sowing, half of urea at sowing and half of urea after harvesting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Spinach,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PALAK?,Sowing time of spinach for winter season is September to October and for hot season you can sow it from mid February to April.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Spinach,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOTAL FERTILIZER DOSE IN PALAK?,"Apply well digested cow dung 100 quintal and Nitrogen 35 kg (Urea 75 kg), Phosphorus 12 kg (Single Super Phosphate 75 kg) per acre for better crop growth and yield. Apply cow dung and full amount of phosphorus and half amount of nitrogen at the time of sowing. Apply residual nitrogen in two equal portions after each harvest. Irrigate lightly after fertilizing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Spinach,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE IN PALAK?,"In winter, apply 4-6 kg per acre of seeds and in summer 10-15 kg per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Spinach,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN SPINACH?,Plant for weed control in spinach crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Spinach,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISEASE CONTROL IN RADISH AND PALAK?,"To control diseases in spinach, mix 200 grams of Bavistan in 200 liters of water and spray one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Spinach,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF TERMITE OR OTHER INSECT-PEST IN SOIL BEFORE SOWING OF VEGETABLES?,"Before planting vegetables, 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC mixed with 15-20 kg of sand and sprinkled in a moist vehicle or lightly irrigated to prevent in-soil ants and borers.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Bajra Naper Hybrid,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING METHOD OF BAJRA?,Bajra sowing can be done by spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Bajra Naper Hybrid,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF BAJRA?,Apply 6-8 kg of seed per acre for sowing millet I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Bajra Naper Hybrid,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF NAPIER BAJRA?,"For control of leaf blight in Napier millet, spray 40 ml of Corazan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) in 80-100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fodder Crops,Bajra Naper Hybrid,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF FOLDER IN NAPIER BAJRA?,"For prevention of leaf blight in Napier millet, spray 40 ml of Corazan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) in 80-100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Oats,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME POOR FILLING OF GRAINS IN PADDY CROP?,"At the time of ripening, rain and wind causes the grain to remain empty and stained in the paddy crop","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Oats,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH OF CAULIFLOWER?,Spray 1 KG powder NPK (19:19:19) in 100 liters of water(@10 grams per liter) for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Oats,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY OF PESTICIDES WITHOUT ANY PROBLEM IN PADDY CROP?,Do not use any insecticides and fungicides in paddy crop without any problem I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Oats,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER APPLICATION INOats?,"For Oats, apply 33 kg of urea, 50 kg of super phosphate at the time of sowing and later add 33 kg of urea after 30-40 days. Apply 44 kg of urea per acre after the second crop to get a second crop ofOats","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Oats,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOP FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT IN PADDY?,Urea 25 kg + Potash 15 kg + Neem cake 5 kg + Fertilizer 5 kg/acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VEGETABLE SUITABLE FOR SOWING IN AUGUST-SEPTEMBER MONTH?,"Vegetables to be sown in August-September Cauliflower, Kale, Turnip, Peas, Carrots, Radish and Spinach","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER YIELD OF BRINJAL?,Spray 1 kg NPK in 100 liters of water at 13:00:45 per acre after flowering.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF BRINJAL?,The best time to plant brinjal paneri is the month of November and you can plant the prepared paneri in the field in the first fortnight of February.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FRUIT BORER CONTROL MANAGEMENT IN BRINJAL?,Mix thiodicarb 2 gm / 1 liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BRINJAL TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Apply Urea 42 kg + Potash 20 kg per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREVENTION FOR NEMATODE MANAGEMENT IN BRINJAL?,Apply Carbofuron 3 - 5 kg per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE HORTICULTURE CROPS IN AUGUST MONTH?,"Suitable vegetable crops in August are chillies, okra, plantain","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BRINJAL SOWING SEASON?,May - June,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PM KISAN SAMMAN NIDHI YOJANA NEW FARMER REGISTRATION DETAILS?,Register at https://pmkisan.gov.in/RegistrationForm.aspx,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING SEASON FOR BRINJAL?,December January and May June,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SHOOT AND FRUIT BORER MANAGEMENT IN BRINJAL?,"At the rate of 5 per acre, attractant trap and one light trap should be placed","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PEST MANAGEMENT IN BRINJAL AND CUCUMBER (20 DAYS)?,Partly cloudy weather today and tomorrow. Today's expected maximum temperature (36 degree Celsius and minimum temperature of 25 degree Celsius and wind speed of 18 kmph) hence irrigation is required depending on rainfall.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASING GROWTH IN BRINJAL?,Mix humic acid 2 ml / 1 liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF CATERPILLAR AND BEETLE MANAGEMENT IN BRINJAL?,Mix propinophos 2 ml + Neem oil 3 ml + sticky liquid 1 ml in one liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PHOSPHOBACTERIA MIXED WITH PSEUDOMONAS FLUORESCENCE FOR BRINJAL NURSERY TREATMENT?,Both cannot be mixed; they can be used separately,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING SEASON OF BRINJAL?,"Season of Eggplant Planting - Eggplant can be cultivated in all three seasons. Kharip seeds are sown in the second week of June and seedlings are planted in July, August. Rabi or winter season-seeds are sown by end of September and transplanted in October-November. Summer season-seeds are sown in second week of January and transplanted in February.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF BRINJAL?,"Eggplant - Caste - Cats Gota, Vaishali, Pragati, Aruna, Arjun, Krishna, Meghna, Lalita, Gaurav, Ajay.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATERPILLAR ON BRINJAL?,Infested pods should be collected and destroyed every week._ Biological insecticide should be used in primary stage._ Chlorantraniliprole 18.5 SC @ 4 ml or Thiocloprid 21.7 SC @ 10 ml or Emamectin Benzoate 5 Wg @ 4 gm or Thiodicarb 75 W Spray P @ 10 gm.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR CONTROL ATTACK OF FRUIT BORER ON BRINJAL CROP?,Solomon (beta-cyfluthrin + imidacloprid (8.49 + 19.81% w/w)) should be sprayed at 10 ml per 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BRINJAL SOWING AND THEIR DISTANCE?,"Plantation Before planting, the land should be plowed and well cultivated (30 to 40 tons per hectare) and mixed with cow dung. Planting distance in light soil - 75 x 75 cm. For hybrids - 90 x 90 cm. For low growing variety / in medium soil - 90 x 75 cm. For high draining soil / heavy soil - 120 x 90 cm.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWER DROP IN BRINJAL CROP?,Eggplant :-Spray with calcibor 30 gms / 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL MEASURES FOR SUCKING PEST ATTACK IN BRINJAL?,Sap-sucking Kid Control - Thiamethoxam 25 WG 5 gm + Mancozeb 30 gm /15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGUS ON BLACK BRINJAL?,Control of brinjal fungus - Bavistein 30 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.(CARBENDAZIN 50% WP),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST IN MANGO TREE?,Eggplant :- Spray Daman's Bio 303 -22 ml /15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL WILT ATTACK ON BRINJAL CROP?,Copper oxychloride 50% WP - 30 g/15 liters of water should be applied.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SHOOT BORER AND FRUIT BORER ON BRINJAL?,Eggplant - Cutworms and fruitworms - Chlorpyrifos (20 EC) should be taken in 30 ml / 15 liters of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR CONTROL ATTACK OF JASSIDS ON BRINJAL CROP?,Alika (Thiomethaxam 12.6 % + Lambda Psylothrin 9.5 %) should be sprayed with 8 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY ON BRINJAL?,Fertilizer spraying on eggplant - 19:19:19: 2 kg / acre in 200 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF BRINJAL CROP?,"Improved Varieties-, Ruchira, Pusa Kranti, Green Fruits - Flowers Green, Flowers Arjuna Purple - Manjari Gota, Krishna, Pusa Purple Round","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR ON BRINJAL?,Eggplant - For worm control :- Emamectin benzoate 7 g per 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR BRINJAL?,Bags of Sufla (15:15:15) along with 40 kg of urea and murate of potash should be applied per acre at the time of eggplant planting and 40 kg of urea should be applied one month after planting.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF THRIPS ON BRINJAL?,Actra 5 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed (Thiomithoxom 25%)-,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST IN BRINJAL?,Eggplant - Succulent pest control - Actra 5 gm/15 liters of water should be sprayed...,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEABOUT CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN BRINJAL?,For effective control of blight disease in brinjal crop = Bavistein 30 gm + humic acid 30 ml /15 l of water should be applied.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BRINJAL?,Eggplant sap-sucking pest control: 1) Spray with thymethoxome (25%) 5 g/15 liters of water 2) Apply 5-6 sticky traps per acre..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY FOR FLOWERING ON BRINJAL?,"For flower control, apply Vangi-Planofix 5 ml/15 liters of water and spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR ATTACK ON BRINJAL?,Eggplant bollworm control - Emamectin benzoate 5% SG 66 g/acre in 200 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
