Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WHITE FLY ON BRINJAL?,Actra 5 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
