Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL MEASURES FOR THRIPS?,Scab Control - Spinosad 45 s.g.ml / 15 l mixed with water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAY FOR FLOWERING BRINJAL?,Eggplant - To increase the number of flowers - Boomflower should be taken in 30 ml/15 liters of water and sprayed (Nitrobenzene 20%).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWERING OF BRINJAL?,"Eggplant flowers in 60 to 75 days after planting, after which the plot continues for six months","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
