Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF LEAF EATING CATERPILLAR OF BRINJAL?,Leaf-eating/rollerworm control Proclaim 5 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.(Imamectin Benzoate 5 %SG)- Syngenta,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO CONTROL OF LEAF MINER OF THRIPS IN BRINJAL CROP?,Spray 400 roger (dimethoate 30 EC) in 100 liters of water per acre to prevent thrips and tunnel borer attack in brinjal crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DOSE OF CORAGEN (CHLORANTRANILIPROLE) IN BRINJAL FOR CONTROL OF SHOOT AND FRUIT BORER?,"For prevention of fruit and lager borer in brinjal, spray 80 ml of Corazan (Chlorantraniliprole) in 100-125 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO CONTROL OF BRINJAL SHOOT AND FRUIT BORER IN BRINJAL?,"200 ml of Cypermethrin 10 EC, 160 ml of Deltamethrin 2.8 EC, 80 ml of Coragen, 80 g of Proclam 5 SG (Amamectin Benzoate) or 800 ml of Acalox mixed with 100 liters of water for control of fruit and lager borer in brinjal. Spray for one acre and box the damaged fruit in the ground","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
