Vegetables,Brinjal,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW MANY TYPES OF FLOWERS IS PRESENT IN BRINJAL?,"Brinjal produces 4 types of flowers with different style length. (Long style, short style, medium style and pseudo short style). For seed production and better yield, the long and medium style is desirable.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
