Oilseeds,Sesame,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF SESAMUM?,"Sesame Improved Jati-Kharip-AKT-64, Adhrarabbi-N-8, Flowers Sesame No.1 Summer AKT 101, Tapi,","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Aonla,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FRUIT DROP IN BER DUE TO FUNGUS ATTACK?,"To prevent the fruit of the plant from falling, do light irrigation in summer and if the fruit is falling due to fungal disease, apply Bavistan (carbadazim 50 wp) at the rate of 2.5 grams per liter.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Aonla,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PRECAUTION METHOD FOR BRANCH BREAKING AMLA TREE?,"Bordeaux paste should be applied (mix 200 grams of copper sulfate in one liter of water. Then in another vessel dissolve 200 grams of lime in one liter of water. Then in the third vessel, mix these two solutions and use them as glue)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Aonla,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME AMLA FOLIAR NUTRITION SPRAY MANAGEMENT?,Potassium Nitrate - 10 gm/ liter of water Mix and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Aonla,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZERS PRAY FOR AONLA CROP?,For flowering on favorite crop - 12:61:00 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Boomflower (Nitrobenzene 20 %) 30 ml / 15 liters of water for spraying.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
