Fruits,Litchi,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF CHLORPYRIPHOS IN LITCHI?,Chlorpyrifos (20%) can be applied at the rate of 15 ml per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Litchi,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER REQUIREMENT OF LITCHI (1-3 YEARS)?,"For 1 to 3 year old crop of litchi, apply 10-20 kg of composted manure along with urea 150-500 gm, single super phosphate 200-600 gm and muriate of potash 60-150 gm per tree. Add manure superphosphate and potash in the month of December Apply half urea fertilizer in mid-February and after fruiting in mid-April","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
