Spices,Garlic,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF GARLIC?,"Improved recommended types of garlic - PG-18, PG-17","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN GARLIC?,"Fertilizer recommendation in garlic - Apply 20 tonnes of rotted manure, 100 kg of urea and 155 kg of superphosphate per acre. I Apply all manure and superphosphate before sowing and urea fertilizer in three parts, first part one month after sowing. Second one and a half month and triple after 2 months put I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF FUNGAL DISEASE IN GARLIC?,Indifil M-45 can be sprayed at the rate of 3 gm per liter to prevent fungal disease in garlic crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN GARLIC?,No herbicides are recommended for control of overgrown weeds.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN GARLIC?,"For weed control in garlic, spray 1 liter Stop 30 EC up to one day after planting or 425 ml Round 23.5 EC dissolved in 200 liters of water within 7 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOWING OF GARLIC CROP?,"Check for disease attack before spraying when garlic turns yellow, if there is no disease then do not apply any fungicide.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF GARLIC?,Sowing time of garlic is last week of September to first week of October.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN GARLIC?,Sprinkle 500 grams of clear (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15 kg of sand per acre or drench at the rate of 3 grams of Bavistin per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF GARLIC?,"The white colored Jamnagar variety along with Godavari and Shreveta varieties are cultivated in Maharashtra. Garlic is planted in October-November in simple steam dry flats of 10.5 cm. The stones are broken and the petals or stalks are separated and covered with soil. For that, 500 to 600 kg of seed is required per hectare. After infection, water should be given so that the pods do not come out.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT CULTIVATION OF GARLIC & ITS SUITABLE VARIETIES?,"The white colored Jamnagar variety as well as the Godavari and Shreveta varieties are cultivated. Garlic is planted in October-November in simple steam dry flats of 10.5 cm. The stones are broken and the petals or stalks are separated and covered with soil. For that, 500 to 600 kg of seed is required per hectare. After infection, water should be given so that the pods do not come out.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF GINGER?,"White colored Jamnagar variety along with Godavari, Shreveta varieties are cultivated. Garlic is planted in October-November in simple steam dry flats of 10.5 cm. The stones are broken and the petals or stalks are separated and covered with soil. For that, 500 to 600 kg of seed is required per hectare. After infection, water should be given so that the pods do not come out.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH ON GARLIC CROP?,Fertilizer in garlic crops - 19:19:19 - 60 grams + Microla - 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed. !,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH ON GARLIC?,For garlic growth -19:19:19 40 g + Micro in 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF GARLIC?,"Improved varieties of garlic are planted by branching method. As this crop does not produce seeds after fruiting, new varieties have been created by selection from local varieties to produce more. Some varieties are known by local names. Like, Jamnagar, Mahabaleshwar, Ladwa, Malik, Fawari, Amleta and Rajeli Gadi etc. are popular in the past. In the last 10 to 12 years, various agricultural research centers have collected many varieties and developed improved varieties through selection. From the research Godavari (Selection-2), Shweta (Selection-10), Agrifound White (G-41), Yamuna Safed (G-50), G-1, GG-2, G-282, G-323, Varieties like Phule Baswant, Bhima Omkar etc. are suitable for the plains of India. The variety G-41 gives good yield in areas free from purple rust and brown rust and also has good storability. This breed is suitable for Pune, Nashik, Satara, Ahmednagar, etc. Phule Baswant and Godavari varieties are suitable for cultivation of purple garlic. G-50 variety has 30 to 40 petals","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GARLIC CROP FERTILIZER DOSE?,Spray Zero Fifty Two 50 to 75 grams of 50 to 75 grams in 15 liters of water from spray for garlic crop growth,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GARLIC SPRAY INFORMATION?,"Garlic spray 19:19:19 - 50 g + Microla 30 ml in 15 liters of water should be sprayed,","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON GARLIC?,Garlic Carapace Control - M 45 ( Mancozeb 75% WP ) 30 gms / 15 liters of water should be taken and sprayed..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR GARLIC?,0:52:34 Take 60 grams + Mikrola 30 ml in 15 liters of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GARLIC?,Garlic Varieties - Godavari Shweta Yamuna Safed Agrifound White Garlic Bhima,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE  IN GARLIC?,"Fertilizer recommendation in garlic - Apply 20 tonnes of rotted manure, 110 kg of urea and 155 kg of superphosphate per acre. I Apply all manure and superphosphate before sowing and urea fertilizer in three parts, first part one month after sowing. Second one and a half month and triple after 2 months put I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER RECOMMENDATION  IN GARLIC?,"Fertilizer recommendation in garlic - Apply 20 tonnes of rotted manure, 110 kg of urea and 155 kg of superphosphate per acre. I Apply all manure and superphosphate before sowing and urea fertilizer in three parts, first part one month after sowing. Put the second after one and a half months and the third after 2 months","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO CONTROL WEED IN  GARLIC?,1 liter pandametlin in 150 liter water /acre in between 48 hours,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPACING OF GARLIC?,Keep a distance of 15 cm between the rows and 7.5 cm between the plants while planting the onion plant in the field.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF GARLIC?,"Garlic Seed Processing Before planting, garlic cloves should be dipped in carbosulfan solution for 2 hours and then planted. Prepare a solution by mixing 20 ml of carbosulfan in 10 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY ON GARLIC CROP?,Fertilizer spraying in garlic crop - 19:19:19 - 60 grams + Microla - 30 ml/ 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF RABI ONION?,"Varieties of Rabi Onion Punjab White, Punjab Naroa, PRO-6, PRO-7, PYO-1, POH-1 and PWO-2.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANURES AND FERTILIZERS USED IN ONION CROP?,"For onion crop, apply 20 tonnes of manure, 45 kg of urea, 125 kg of superphosphate and 35 kg of potash per acre at the time of sowing and 45 kg of urea again after 30-45 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT FOR ONION NURSERY?,Add manure 10-15 days before preparing onion paneer,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN ONION?,"To prevent root rot in onion, 500 gm of clear (Carbendazim 12%+Mancozeb 63%) mixed with 15 kg of sand and sprinkled per acre or drenching at the rate of 3 gm Bavistin per liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING TIME AND TRANSPLANTING TIME OF RABI ONION?,"The sowing time of Radish Onion Paneeri is from mid-October to mid-November and from the first week of January to mid-January, dig the paneer and plant it in the field.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS IN ONION?,No herbicides are recommended for control of weeds in onion.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH AND YELLOWING OF ONION CROP?,Spray 1 KG of powder NPK (19:19:19) in 100 liters of water(@10 gm per liter) per acre for growth of onion crop and to remove yellowness.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN ONION?,Give water immediately after planting onions in onion so that the roots of the plants take hold of the soil and do subsequent irrigations at intervals of 7-10 days depending on the type of soil and weather. Total 10-15 waterings are required.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BIO FERTILIZER USED IN ONION CROP?,Apply 4 kg of Consortium mixed with 15-20 kg of soil per acre as soon as the onion crop is planted in the field.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPACING OF ONION?,Onion spacing is 15 cm from row to row and 7.5 cm from plant.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN ONION?,Spray 750 ml of Stomp 30 EC or 380 ml of Gol in 200 liters of water per acre within 7 days of sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF KHARIF ONION?,"Khavani Onion Agrifond Dark Red is the recommended variety, this variety matures in 95-110 days. Its average yield is 120 quintals per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF RABI ONION?,The amount of onion seed is 4-5 kg per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED PRODUCTION OF ONION (BULB TO SEED METHOD)?,"Onion seed is prepared from bales produced one year back. 8-10 quintals of well-sorted bales are required for one acre of seed production. Planting distance should be 45 cm I Seed producing variety of onion should be kept at least 1000 meters away from other varieties I Uproot early and late bearing plants I Flowering crop to produce pure seed Before blooming, during flowering and ripening, observe and remove non-plants. All flowers do not ripen at the same time. Therefore, when the seeds turn black, cut them out in 2-3 times and after drying, clean them at low temperature and low humidity. Store at I","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME AND TRANSPLANTING TIME OF ONION?,Sow nursery from mid-October to mid-November and transplant from the middle of December to the middle of January.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YIELD OF RABI ONION VARIETIES?,"Onion Varieties- POH-1 (Yield-221 quintals), PRO-7 (Yield-159 quintals), PRO-6 (Yield-175 quintals), PYO 102 (Yield-159 quintals) -164 quintal), PWO-35 (Yield-139 quintal), Punjab White (Yield-135 quintal) and Punjab Naroa (Yield-150 quintal).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTATION OF NURSERY OF ONION?,"Sow 4 to 5 kg of seed in 8 marla (200 square meter) area for onion paddy. Prepare beds 15 to 20 cm high and sow the seed 1 to 2 cm deep, in rows 5 cm apart. Apply 1000 kg of rotted manure (125 kg per marla) in the area prepared for paneri and irrigate the field 10 days before planting paneri so that all the weeds grow before sowing. Immediately after 50 to 60 days of rooting, plant the seedlings in the field","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF BLIGHT MANAGEMENT IN ONION?,Mix and spray Pseudomonas fluorescence 5 ml per liter of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THRIPS MANAGEMENT IN ONION?,Neem oil mixed and sprayed at the rate of 3ml/litre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CUT WORM MANAGEMENT IN SMALL ONION?,Mix chlorpyrifos 2 ml + sticky liquid 1 ml in one liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT FOR ONION?,Pseudomonas 10 grams should be mixed with one kg of seed. This should be done (slightly before) sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION SEED TREATMENT INFORMATION?,Manure 10 tons + Urea 25 kg + Super Phosphate 145 kg + Potash 20 kg should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING SEASON FOR ONION?,November December and and January February,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Urea 24 kg + Potash 15 kg should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR MANAGEMENT IN ONION?,Mix Azadirachtin 3 ml + sticky liquid 1 ml in one liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DORMANT PERIOD FOR ONION?,30 days,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THRIPS AND CATERPILLAR IN ONION?,Mix 2 ml of propenophos in one liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION FOLIAR APPLICATION INFORMATION?,1 kg of potassium sulphate mixed with 100 liters of water per acre should be sprayed 30 days before harvest.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Government Schemes,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CROP INSURANCE FOR ONION?,Closing Date: 31-07-2020 Insurance Company: Oriental Insurance Company,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION ROOT ROT MANAGEMENT?,Pseudomonas 5 ml per liter of water pour into the root,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION PLANTING SEASON?,October - November is suitable for planting,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR NUTRIENT APPLICATION FOR ONION?,Spray Urea 2.5 gm+Zinc Sulphate 2.5 gm/l of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOWNY MILDEW CONTROL MANAGEMENT IN ONION?,Mix Ridomil Gold 2 g / 1 liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION SEEDS AVAILABILITY INFORMATION?,July is suitable for sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT FOR ONION?,Dip the plant roots in a solution of Bavistein and humic acid,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH OF ONION?,Spraying the onion crop with fertilizer quantity - 12:61:00 60 gm + Microla 30 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF ONION?,Onion - Varieties - N - 53 Baswant - 780 N 2-4-1 Phule Suvarna Agrifound Dark Red Poona Fursungi,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION VARIETIES?,"Rabi Hungam Onion Cultivation Varieties - N-2-4-1 , Baswant 780,","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSES OF ONION?,"Integrated Nutrient Management:Organic Fertilizers: 25 to 30 t of cow dung/ha Bacterial Fertilizers: Azospirillum and Phosphorus Solubilizing (PSB) Bacteria 25 g/kg of seed should be applied before sowing. Proper time of Fertilizers: Organic Fertilizers: Apply 15 days before planting. Chemical Fertilizers: 50:50:50 kg Nitrogen:P:Palash/ha, half of Nitrogen, whole Phosphorus and Palash should be applied at the time of sowing and the remaining 50 kg quantity should be divided into 2 equal weeks after 30 and 45 days. 15 days before Rabi season onion replanting, sulfur should be applied at the rate of 45 kg per hectare.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION SEED YIELD?,Onion seed yield - 7 qtl / acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON ONION?,Onion Karpa disease control - Blue copper (copper oxychloride 50% WP )-40 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT TO ONION?,Treat onion seeds with Cabendazim (1 gm per kg) or Captan (2.5 gm per kg).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN ONION?,Onion - Weed killer - Spray 20 ml (Oxyfluorfen 23.5 ec) /15 liters of water after 21 days after replanting.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSES FOR ONION CROP?,"Onion Fertilizer Management :- Onion crops 40 to 50 hectare of cow dung and chemical fertilizer as recommended 100 kg of nitrogen, 50 kg of phosphorus and 50 kg of palash should be mixed with steam in the soil before planting. The remaining 50 kg should be weeded after 30 and 45 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILT ATTACK ON ONION?,Onion die disease - For growth -19:19:19 60 g + Microla 40 ml + Clear 30 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT ATTACK ON ONION?,Mancozeb 400 g/200 liters of water should be sprayed for 1 acre for control of Karpa disease on onion crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL BLIGHT TACK ON ONION?,Control of onion borer - Tubeconazole 7 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUCKING PEST ATTACK ON ONION?,For control of sap-sucking pest in onion crop - Bavistein Carbendazim 50% WP 30 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF ONION?,Onion should be planted in January.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEEDLING PREPARATION OF ONION?,"Onion plants, the area where the paddy steam is formed should be deeply plowed and the soil should be loosened with two or three passes of kulwa. Gadi Vafa should be 1 m wide 3 m long 15 cm high. Remove the lumps from the steam and keep them aside. A 5 cm finger line should be drawn parallel to the width of the steam. And in this the seeds should be sown thinly in rows and then covered with soil. Add water sparingly until the seeds sprout.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF THRIPS, BLIGHT ON ONION?","Onion Thrips, Karpa Control - Imidacloprid 17.8%, 5 ml + M 45, 30 g / 15 liters of water spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST IN ONION CROP?,A companion-pathogen insecticide should be used to control sap-sucking borer in onion crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH ONION?,For the growth of onion crop -19:19:19 60 g + microla 30 ml + humic acid 30 ml + twenty two - 30 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH ON ONION?,For onion growth -19:19:19 60 g + Micro in 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON ONION?,Thymethoxam (Actra) 5 gm + Bavistein 30 gm//in 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL MEASURE ON WILT OF ONION SEEDLING?,Copper oxychloride chloride 50% w 400 g + humic acid 98% 50 g per 200 liters of water should be applied for half an acre area.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION FERTILIZER DOSES ON ONION CROP?,00.52.34-60 g + Mikrolla -30 ml /15 liter water spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT FOR ONION CROP?,Seed treatment for onion crop - Thiram should be applied at three grams per kg of seed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ONION FERTILIZER DOSES?,Onion Pikala - Blue Copper - 30 g + Mikrolla - 30 ml / 15 liter water spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Onion,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR ONION?,"50 kg of nitrogen, 50 kg of phosphorous and 50 kg of palash per hectare of onion crop should be taken at the time of planting. After that 50 kg of nitrogen per hectare should be given after 1 month. 10 kg of onion seeds per hectare is enough.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Brown Sarson,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF TARAMIRA?,Sowing time of Taramira is the whole of October,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Brown Sarson,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR BETTER GROWTH OF MUSTARD?,For good growth of mustard you can spray one kg of NPK 19:19:19,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Brown Sarson,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WEEDS IN MUSTARD?,No herbicide spraying is recommended in mustard,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE FOR GRAM CROP?,"Use 15-18 kg seed per acre for native chickpea, 25 kg seed for PBG-5 variety and 37 kg seed per acre for Kabli chickpea.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF GRAM CROP?,"For Sowing Chickpeas The best time to sow indigenous chickpeas under barani conditions is October 10 to 25. Under Senju conditions, indigenous and Kabli chickpeas should be sown between October 25 and November 10.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOTAL FERTILIZER DOSE IN GRAM CROP?,Fertilizers in indigenous chickpeas - 13 kg urea and 50 kg superphosphate per acre after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF BENGAL GRAM?,"Gram - Varieties - Vijay, Digvijay, Vishal, Vikas, Jackie-9218, Phule G-12.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF GRAM?,"To improve seed germination and protect against fungal diseases at the seedling stage, 5 gm Trichoderma per kg seed or 2 gm Thiram, 2 gm Carbondazim per kg seed should be applied before sowing. Then 10 kg of seeds should be treated with a 250 g packet of Rhizobium bacterial culture in a cold jaggery culture solution. To prepare jaggery solution, take 125 grams of jaggery in one liter of water and warm the water until it dissolves. Seeds should be dried in shade for one hour and sown immediately. Due to this, the amount of gland on the gram root increases and more nitrogen is absorbed from the air and available to the crop and the yield of the crop increases by 3 to 5 percent.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATERPILLAR ON GRAM?,Spray Proclaim (Imamectin Benzoate 5%SG) 66g/acre in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR GRAM?,Gram Pikas -12 :61: 00 Spray 80 gms /15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILISER DOSE FOR GRAM?,19:19:19 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Radomil Gold 30 g + Humic Acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROWTH OF GRAM?,Gram Growth Planning : 12:61:00 60g + Microla 30ml + Clear 30g / 15 liters of water to spray..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GRAM PLANTATION?,"Sowing time of gram - Gram is a Rabi season crop and dry and cool air is good for it. In dryland areas, sowing should be done after 25th September before the soil moisture is blown away. For this purpose, the variety Vijay should be used. Horticultural gram sowing between 20th October to 10th November gives good yield.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT IN GRAMS?,Spray (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) UPL with clean 30 g/15 liter of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WILT IN GRAM?,Blue copper 30 g + humic acid 30 ml /15 liters of water should be given by Alvani.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILT IN GRAM?,19:19:19 60 gm + Microla 30 ml + Humic acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT FOR GRAM?,"For gram crop 12:61:00, 60 g + Microla spray in 30 ml / 15 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY ON BENGAL GRAM?,Fertilizer spraying in gram crop - 12:61:00 - 60 grams + microla - 30 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON GRAM?,For fungus control in gram crop- Radomil Gold-30 gm/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASE GROWTH IN BENGAL GRAM CROP?,Spray 12:61:00 60 gm + Microla in 30 ml / 15 l of water for more shoots and balanced growth in gram crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH SPRAY FOR BENGAL GRAM CROP?,For gram growth =19:19:19 3000 g + Microla 1000 ml + Saf (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) 400 g / in 200 L water and spray for 1 acre..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN TUR?,"Water management - As tur is mainly a kharif season crop, it grows on rainfed. However, in case of failure or water stress and irrigation facilities are available, the crop should be watered during the growing stage (30 to 35 days), flowering stage (60 to 70 days) and pod filling stage. This increases crop production.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE ON BENGAL GRAM?,"Fertilizers Improved gram varieties respond well to fertilizer and water, for which proper amount of fertilizer is required. 5 tonnes of well-rotted cow dung or compost per hectare should be spread on the field at the time of last plowing. 25 kg of nitrogen, 50 kg of phosphorous and 30 kg of palash per hectare i.e. 125 kg of diammonium phosphate (DAP) plus 50 kg of murate of potash or 50 kg of urea and 300 kg of single super phosphate plus 50 kg of murate of potash are applied while sowing the crop. to be given per hectare. It has been observed in the experiments that the production has increased by 18.55 percent due to the use of balanced fertilizers. The first spray of 2 percent urea should be done when the crop is in flower and then another spray after 10-15 days, this increases the crop yield.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF POD BORER ON BENGAL GRAM?,Proclaim (Imamectin Benzoate 5%) 80 gm per 200 liters of water should be sprayed for 1 acre..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT ATTACK IN BENGAL CROP CROP?,Spray (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) with clear 30 g / 15 liters of water UPL,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DRENCHING IN BENGAL GRAM?,Apply blue copper 40 g + humic acid 30 ml /15 liters of water by Alvani.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN BENGAL GRAM CROP?,Water Management Gram is a very sensitive crop to water. Gram crop generally requires 25 cm of water. Give a light watering after sowing. So the germination is good. Apply after about 25 to 30 days in medium soil. Second watering after 45 to 50 days and third watering after 65-70 days if required. Water should be given according to soil condition and requirement.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING FOR GROWTH ON BENGAL GRAM?,If gram is in flower then spraying with 12 6100 g + Mikrolla 30 ml + /15 liter of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR BENGAL GRAM CROP?,For growth of gram crop -19:19:19 60 gm + microla 10 ml + humic acid 30 gm / 15 liter of water for spraying.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
