Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING AT FLOWERING STAGE ON BENGAL GRAM?,"If gram is in flowering stage, spray 12:61:00 60 g + Microla 30 ml/Nutribuild 20 g/15 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON BENGAL GRAM?,Mancozeb 64% + Metalaxyl 4% WP - 30 gms per 15 liters of water should be sprayed..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR FLOWERING IN GRAM?,To increase the number of gram flowers - Boomflower (Nitrobenzene 20%) should be sprayed with 30 ml /15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT FOR GRAM CROP?,"Gram Water Management In medium soil the first water should be given after 20 to 25 days, the second after 45 to 50 days and the third after 65 to 70 days. Gram crop generally requires 25 cm of water. It is important to give water regularly (7 to 8 cm). If too much water is given, there is a risk of crop rotting. According to the local conditions and the depth of the soil, the distance between the two water courses should be maintained. Do not allow too large cracks in the soil. If one water is given to the gram crop, the yield increases by 30 percent, if two waters are given 6o percent and if three waters are given, the yield increases twice.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
