Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME JIVAMRUT SPRAY ON GRAM?,Mix 200 liters of water + 10 kg of indigenous cow's milk + 10 liters of indigenous cow's urine + 1 kg of jaggery + 1 kg of gram flour + 1 handful of bacterial soil on the dam and cover the mouth of the drum with burlap and keep it in the shade for 48 to 72 hours. Stir with a stick twice a day morning and evening and spray with 1 liter of Jiwamrit per pump Duration of use is only 7 days.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
