Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT FOR GRAMS?,"Water should be given to the gram crop. Water planning for gram crop For heavy soil, only two coats of water are sufficient. For that, the crop needs water during budding (30-35 days after sowing) and during filling of the valleys (60-65 days after sowing).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
