Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF GRAM POD BORER?,Preventive measures - Take 30 ml of lemon extract in 15 liters of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
