Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR FLOWERING ON BENGAL GRAM?,To increase the number of flowers on Herbara -Bumflower 30 ml or Tata Bahar 15 ml in 15 liters of water should be sprayed.(Nitrobenzene 20%) Devi Crop Science,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DRENCHING FOR GROWTH OF GRAM?,For gram growth - 12:61:00 60 gm + Micro in 30 ml /15 liter water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING AT POD FILLING STAGE IN BENGAL GRAM?,Spraying with Mikrolla 30 ml + 00:52:34 (Mono Potassium Phosphate) 60 g/15 liters of water if gram is in the gap filling stage.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF RUST ON BENGAL GRAM?,Tambara control on gram in flower should be sprayed with gram - M-45 in 30 gms / 15 liters of water. Gram Ghate-Tilt (propiconazole) 4-5 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGICIDE SPRAY FOR GRAM?,Spray gram with Bavistin 30 g/15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
