Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ATTACK ON GRAM CROP?,Saf (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) 30 gm / 15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY?,Spray with nitrobenzene 30 ml + 00 52 34 60 g /15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF GRAY MOLD ON BENGAL GRAM?,Control of red spot on gram crop = Spray with 30 gm / 15 liters of clean water (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING FOR INCREASING FLOWERING BENGAL GRAM?,For flowering of gram plant:- Nitrobenzene 20% in 30 ml/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GRAM CATERPILLAR ATTACK?,The gram crop should be sprayed with Corazan 5 ml/15 liters of water.(Chlorantraniliprole 18.5% EC) After 4-5 days Magnasium Sulphate - 80 g + 12:61:00-60 g / 15 liters of water spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR BENGALGRAM?,"12:61:00-70 grams should be sprayed with Mikrolla 30 ml in 15 liters of water, .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASE POD GROWTH IN BENGAL GRAM CROP?,Spray 00.52.34 60 gm + Microla in 30 ml / 15 l of water for more balanced growth in gram crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GRAM?,Gram - 00:52:34 - 60 g + clean 30 g / 15 liters of water should be taken and sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON GRAM CROP?,Saf (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%) 30g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RUST ATTACK ON GRAM?,Herbara Tambera Clean 30 g/15 liters of water for spraying (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF APHIDS ON GRAM?,Spray the crop with Rogar 20 ml + Clear -40 g /15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL MEASURES ON RUST OF GRAM?,Ridomil Gold (Metalaxil 4% + Mancozeb 64%) should be sprayed at the rate of 30 grams per 15 liters of water for control of Tambera disease in gram.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT BENGAL GRAM VARIETIES FOR RABI PLANTATION?,"The following improved seeds should be used for gram cultivation. Desi Small Seed Varieties = Vijay, Vishal, Saki-9516, AKGS Rate = 50 to 60 kg / ha Medium Seed Varieties = Jaki-9218 Rate = 75 to 80 kg / ha Kabuli / Large Seed Varieties = ICCV-25,, PKV Kabuli - 2, PKV Kabuli-4, Virat, grace rate=100-125 kg/ha","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GRAM?,"Gram -Jati -Vijay, Digvijay , Vishal , Vikas , Jackie -9218, Phule G -12 .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PRE EMERGENCY HERBICIDE FOR GRAM?,(Pendimethalin 30% EC) Spray before emergence after sowing,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GRAM CULTIVATION PERIOD?,"Period of gram cultivation :- But due to the facility of water supply in the horticulture area, gram should be sown between 20th October to 10th November. .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF BENGAL GRAM?,"Gram Improved Caste-Vijay, Digvijay, Saki 9516, Virat, P.D.K.V. Kanchan ( AKG 1109 )","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GRAM CROP?,"Gram varieties -Vijay, Digvijay, Vishal, Vikas, Jackie-9218, Phule G-12","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT FOR BENGAL GRAM?,Gram - 2-2.5 grams of carbendazim or thiram should be seed treated per kg of seed. Before sowing seeds should be treated with 25 g Rhizobium bacterial culture + 25 g phosphorus solubilizing bacterial culture in cold water of jaggery per kg of seed. Make a solution and rub it on the seeds,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE FOR GRAM?,"For small grain varieties of gram (eg Vijay, Vishal, Digvijay, ICCV-10, AKGS-1, Saki 9516) : 50-60 kg/ha. For medium size variety (eg Jaki 9218): 75-80 kg per hectare should be used for sowing. In Kabuli varieties, ICCV-2, PKV Kabuli-2 and PKV Kabuli-4 : 100 to 125 kg per hectare should be used for sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GRAM AND MAIZE CROP?,"Gram cultivars -Vijay, Digvijay, Vishal, Vikas, Jackie-9218, Phule G-12. Maize Crop Varieties - Phule Suchitra, Phule Chitra, Maldandi-3501, Prakash, Kiran","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON GRAM?,Nimboli extract 10000 ppm spray at 20 ml per 15 liters of water for the control of suckers on gram For preventive control of caterpillars Emamectin benzoate 8 gm per 15 liters of water should be sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT IN BENGAL GRAM FOR DISEASES?,"For fungicide seed treatment, apply 3 g Captan or Bavistan (Carbendazim) or 2.5 g Roveral (Iprodione) per kg of seed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT IN BENGAL GRAM FOR TERMITE?,"In weevil-infested lands, treat Viz by mixing 10 ml of Dursban 20 EC (chlorpyrifos) per kg of seed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF BENGAL GRAM WITH BIOFERTILIZERS?,"Mix chickpea seeds with one packet each of Misorhizobium (LGR) and Rhizobacterium (RB-1) bacterial fertilizer, mix well with the seed and shade dry and sow within an hour.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT IN BENGAL GRAM?,Apply 3 sprays of 100 ml Tilt 25 EC (Popiconazole) 15 days apart or 360 gm Indofil M-45 (Mancozeb) or Captan or Kavach (Chlorothalonil) 3 sprays 10 days apart. Dissolve 5 sprays in 100 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE IN BENGAL GRAM?,If indigenous chickpea is to be sown in the second fortnight of November then use 27 kg seed per acre and if sown in the first fortnight of December then 36 kg seed per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION IN BENGAL GRAM?,"In chickpeas, it is very important to water thoroughly before sowing and one watering should be done between mid-December and end of January.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED QUANTITY FOR BENGAL GRAM CROP?,"Use 15-18 kg seed per acre for native chickpea, 25 kg seed for PBG-5 variety and 37 kg seed per acre for Kabli chickpea.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILISER DOSE FOR BENGAL GRAM?,19:19:19 60 g + Microla 30 ml + Radomil Gold 30 g + Humic Acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILT IN BENGAL GRAM?,Spray with 30g of clear / 15 liter of water (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
