Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILTING IN BENGAL GRAM?,Blue copper 30 gm + humic acid 30 ml /15 liters of water should be given.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
