Pulses,Bengal Gram,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN SOYBEAN CROP?,"Chemical herbicides are not recommended at this stage of the gram crop, so weeding should be done now as needed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEEDICIDE OF BENGAL GRAM CROP?,Intercropping on gram crop :- First cropping should be done when gram crop is 20 to 25 days old and second cropping should be done when the gram crop is 30 to 35 days old.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
