Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGAL ATTACK ON BENGAL GRAM CROP?,For fungus control on gram crop - CARBENDAZIN (CARBENDAZIN 50% WP) 30 gm + Macro in 30 ml /15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ON BENGAL GRAM?,Apply Blue Copper 30 g/15 liters of water by Alvani..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION MANAGEMENT IN BENGAL GRAM CROP?,"For heavy soil, only two waterings are sufficient, first after 30-35 days and second after 60-65 days. 13 0 45 60 grams should be sprayed in 15 liters of water","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INFORMATION FOR GROWTH OF BENGAL GRAM CROP?,13:40:13 60 gm + Micro in 30 ml per 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INFORMATION FOR GROWTH AND SPROUTING OF BENGAL GRAM CROP?,For prop12:61:00 60 gm + Micro in 30 ml /15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT/IRRIGATION FOR BENGAL GRAM?,If there is moisture in the gram crop then do not water the crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT FOR BENGAL GRAM?,If there is moisture in the gram crop then do not water the crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE ON BENGAL GRAM CROP?,You should spray 19:19:19 60gm + 30ml of fine food liquid per 15 liters of water for the crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WILT ON BENGAL GRAM?,Bavistein 30 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BENGAL GRAM CULTIVATION?,"If the soil moisture is very low in cultivated gram field and some watering is possible, water the gram crop as soon as it begins to flower. While afforestation of irrigated gram fields, try to keep the distance between two rows to a minimum. Also, the length should be kept short according to the slope of the land, so that it is convenient to give adequate water to the crop. In medium soil, first watering should be done after 20 to 25 days, second after 45 to 50 days and third after 65 to 70 days. Gram crop generally requires 25 cm of water. It is important to water regularly (7 to 8 cm). If too much water is given, there is a risk of crop rotting. According to the local conditions and the depth of the soil, the distance between the two water courses should be maintained. Do not allow too large cracks in the soil. If one water is given to the gram crop, the yield increases by 30 percent, if two waters are given 60 percent and if three waters are given, the yield increases twice.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BENGAL GRAM VARIETIES?,"Vijay, Vishal, Digvijay, ICV Ten, Saki 95 16 . Irrigation Management - In medium soil, first water should be given after 20 to 25 days, second at budding and third at filling of valleys.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE FERTILIZER DOSE FOR BENGAL GRAM?,"For gram crop 10:26:26 50 kg, DAP 25 kg and Sulfur 300 mesh 20 kg per acre should be applied at the time of planting and 2% urea solution should be sprayed when the crop is in flower.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Bengal Gram,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PRE EMERGENCY HERBICIDE BEANGAL BENGAL GRAM?,"After sowing the gram crop, but before emergence, pendimethalin 30 e.c. Spray 1 liter of herbicide per acre mixed with 300 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITEFLY OR APHID IN PAPAYA PLANT?,Dilute 250 ml of malathion in 250 liters of water (1 ml per liter of water) and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SAP SUCKING INSECTS IN PAPAYA?,Spray at the rate of 1 gram of Actara per 3 liters of water or 1 ml of Confidor per 2.5 liters of water or 3 ml of Malathion or 3 ml of Roger or 10 ml of Nimbicidin per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF INSECTS FROM THE ROOTS OF PAPAYA?,Dilute 10 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC per liter of water to control papaya root rot.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SUCKING PEST ON THE PAPAYA PLANT?,boil neem leaves and branches and akka leaves in water and spray that water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RECOMMENDED VARIETY AND SOWING TIME OF PAPAYA?,"The recommended variety of Red Lady papaya is, papaya plant in envelopes of 25*10 cm with equal amount of manure, soil and sand, sow the seeds from second week of July to third week of September and plant the prepared plants in September. Can be planted at a distance of 1.25 meters in the field from the first week to mid-October","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME POWDERY MILDEW IN PAPAYA PLANTS?,Spray kerathan at the rate of 2.5 per liter of water to prevent chito disease attack on papaya plants.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IRRIGATION REQUIREMENT OF PAPAYA?,"Irrigate based on weather, crop growth and soil type.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF SUCKING PEST IN PAPAYA?,Spray 1 ml of malathionin per liter of water to control sap-sucking insects in papaya.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF SUCKING PEST IN FRUIT PLANTS?,Neem leaves can be boiled in water and sprayed to protect fruit plants from sap-sucking insects.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PAPAYA PLANTING SEASON, DURATION, SPACING, PLANT POPULATION?","Planting Season: June to September, Age: 24-30 Months, Spacing: 1.8 m * 1.8 m, Number of Calves: 1100 /ac","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF ATTACK OF FRUIT FLY?,Malathion 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed with Cu Lure 5 traps per acre (smelling traps).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATTERPILLAR ON PAPAYA?,PAPAYA PROCLAM (Emamectin Benzoate 5 % SG) 07 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FRUIT BORER IN PAPAYA?,Profex 30ml/15 liter of water should be sprayed.(Profenofos 40%) Nagarjuna,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING SEASON OF PAPAYA?,"Crop Name Papaya: June-July, February March, and October November","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON PAPAYA?,Spray with 30 ml of lemon extract in 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PAPAYA CROP?,"Seasons for Papaya Cultivation: Papaya cultivation is done throughout the year mainly in three seasons namely Old-July, September-October and January-February. In Maharashtra, cultivation is mainly done from June to October.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON PAPAYA?,Fungus Control on Papaya Crop - Spray 30 gm / 15 liters of clean water (Carbendazim 12% + Mancozeb 63%),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF PAPAYA?,Papaya -Variety - Taiwan -786 Washington Co 1 Co -2 Co - 4 Pusa Majesty .,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Papaya,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR PREVENTIVE MEASURES?,PAPAYA CATERPILLER PREVENTIVE MEASURES - SPRAY NEEM ARK 10000 PPM 20 TO 30 ML PER 15 LITER OF WATER,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO INCREASE FLOWERING IN COTTON CROP?,"For more flowering in soft crop, spray 2 kg NP in 100 liters of water at 13:00:45 per acre and spray again after a week. Total 4 sprays are required.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITE FLY IN COTTON?,"For whitefly control in soft 1 liter Nimbicidine, or 400 ml upload 25 SC (Buprofagin) or 20 ml Dentetsu (Clothianidine) or 80 g Ulala, or 60 g Ocean, or 200 g Polo, or 500 ml Leno, or 200 ml Spray Oberon, or 800 ml of Ethane in 125-150 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN COTTON AND TIMING OF FERTILIZER APPLICATION?,Apply 80 kg urea per acre in PAUBT 1 and 90 kg urea per acre in other Bt varieties in 2 equal installments. First installment at thinning and second installment at flowering.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER QUALITY IN COTTON?,2 kg NPK 13:00:45 in 100 liters of water and spray four times per acre at weekly intervals.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CAN WE MIX INSECTICIDE WITH NPK 13:00:45?,You can spray by mixing insecticide with 13:00:45 in soft water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PINK BOLLWORM IN COTTON?,200 ml of cypermethrin or 160 ml of deltamethrin or 100 ml of cypermethrin or 100 ml as per availability for control of pink blight. Fenvalerate or 40 ml Fame 480 SC (flubendamide) or 60 ml Tracer 45 SC (Spinosed) mixed with 100-125 liters of water and sprayed on the affected crop. Spray a group of insecticides only once for optimal control of canker sores.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF MAGNESIUM SULPHATE DEFICIENCY IN COTTON?,Spray 1 kg of magnesium sulphate in 100 liters of water per acre to prevent reddening on tender leaves.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PARA WILT IN COTTON?,Spray 1 gram of cobalt chloride in 100 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF SPOT ON COTTON CROP?,Spray 200 ml Amistar Top 325 SC (Azoxystrobin + Difenconazole) and 3 g Sutrareptocycline in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PINK BOLL WORM IN COTTON?,"Spray 800 ml of Acalax, 2 liters of Chlorpyrifos, 60 ml of Corazon, 40 ml of Fame, or 70 gm of Proclam or 160 ml of Deltamethrin 200 ml Avant in 125 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FUNGAL DISEASE IN COTTON?,"To prevent fungal diseases in cotton crop, you should mix Streptocycline @ 6-8 grams + copper oxychloride @ 600-800 in 150 to 200 liters of water and spray per acre in the last week of June and first week of July.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF LEAF CURL OR WHITEFLY. JASSID, THRIPS IN COTTON?",Use 300 ml Rogor (Dimethoate 30 EC) or Metasystox (Oxydemeton Methyl 25 EC) and 1 liter Nimicidin alternately mixed in 200-250 liters of water per acre or Ulala @ Spray 80 gm or Bufurozin 25 % SC @300 ml in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW TO IMPROVE GROWTH OR GOOD YIELD IN COTTON CROP?,"To increase the quality and yield of bolls in cotton crop, dissolve Biovita @ 250 ml or Sagarika @ 250 ml in 100 liters of water and spray per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF APHID IN COTTON?,mix 80 gm Ulala or 60 gm Ocean or 40 ml Confidoor or 40 gm Ektara in 100 liters of water and spray per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF MEALY BUG IN COTTON?,Spray 500 ml of Upload 25 EC (buprofengin) in 100-125 liters of water per acre for control of soft mealy bugs.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DAMAGE OF COTTON CROP DUE TO BAD EFFECT OF 2,4 D?","If there is an adverse effect of 2, 4 D weed killer on the plant, then there is no definite situation of this problem, but if the damage is not much, then 2 kg of urea can be mixed in 100 liters of water and sprayed per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL BOLL ROT IN COTTON?,Spray 500 grams of sofilizer (Carbendazim + Mancozeb) in 200 liters of water per acre to control soft blight.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME STATUS OF SOIL MOISTURE DURING PESTICIDE SPRAY?,It is important to have moisture in the soil while spraying pesticides,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WHITE FLY OR THRIPS IN COTTON?,Spray 200 grams of Polo mixed with 125-150 liters of water per acre to control whitefly.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GAP BETWEEN COBALT CHLORIDE AND INSECTICIDE SPRAY?,A two-day gap is required between cobalt chloride and pesticide sprays,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NANO UREA SPRAY IN COTTON?,There is no recommendation for nano urea in mild,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR SPRAY FOR COTTON (YIELD INCREASE -DAP USED)?,"DAP can be used; mix DAP 2 kg/10 liters of water, soak and filter, then mix potash 1 kg or potassium nitrate 1 kg or potassium sulfate 1 kg/90 liters of water and spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DAP AND POTASH CAN BE MIXED (TO SPRAY FOR COTTON)?,DAP and potash can be used.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PREVENT PESTS IN COTTON (MONOCROTOPHOS CAN BE USED)?,Do not spray monocrotophos; mix neem oil 3 ml + sticky liquid 1 ml /1 liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR SPRAY FOR COTTON?,Mix TNAU Cotton Plus 2.5 kg/200 liters of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MEALY BUG MANAGEMENT IN COTTON?,Mix imidacloprid 6 ml + Acebate 10 g + sticky liquid 10 ml in 10 liters of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COTTON MEALY MANAGEMENT?,Mix Purabinophos 2 ml driving glue with 1 ml / 1 liter of water and spray.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF SPOT CONTROL IN COTTON?,SAAF (Mancozeb + Carbendazim) 2 gm should be mixed with 1 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MAGNESIUM DEFICIENCY IN COTTON?,Mix and spray magnesium sulphate at the rate of 10 gm/l of water. (Urea can be added at the rate of 5 gm/l of water if the growth of the crop is low),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COTTON PEST FORECASTING INFORMATION?,Crop according to the season.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RED COTTON BUG MANAGEMENT IN COTTON?,Mix and spray 1.5 ml of Fipronil per liter of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COTTON SUITABLE SEASON AND VARIETIES?,"Monsoon (September October) and LRA 5166, K11, KC 2, SVPR 2,KC 3","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COTTON WEED MANAGEMENT?,Mix pendimethalin 1.3 liter + 200 liter water and spray per acre on third day after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FLOWER SETTING IN COTTON?,Spray TNAU Cotton Plus 2.5 kg/200 liters of water during flowering and fruiting season.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COTTON LEAF SPOT MANAGEMENT?,Carpentazim 1g/1 liter of water mixed and sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COTTON MEALYBUG MANAGEMENT?,Mix propenophos 2ml / liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME JASSIDS AND WHITEFLY MANAGEMENT IN COTTON?,Imidacloprid 17.8 SL 4 ml should be mixed with 10 liters of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DUSKY COTTON BUG?,Bipronil 2 ml / litre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAFHOPPER MANAGEMENT IN COTTON?,Spray imidacloprid at 0.5 ml per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COTTON FOLIAR APPLICATION?,"Soak 2 kg of DAP overnight, take clear water and mix it with 200 liters of water and spray it","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
