Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASING FLOWER IN COTTON CROP?,12:61:00 60 g plus nitrobenzene 30 ml per 15 liters of water should be sprayed to promote flowering on cotton crops.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT ATTACK IN COTTON CROP?,Carbendizum 25 g + humic acid 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be applied.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF THRIPS ON COTTON CROP?,Take 8 ml / 15 liters of water and spray. (Thiomethaxam 12.6 %+ Lambda Cilothrene 9.5%),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
