Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON COTTON CROP?,Spray Pride (acetamapride 20%) 7 g + Bavistein (carbendazim 50% WP) 30 g /15 liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
