Fruits,Peach,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSES IN PEACH?,"(1-2 years) Manure-10-15 kg, Urea-180-360 gm, Super Phosphate-190-380 gm and Potash 150-300 gm per plant, (3-4 years Manure-20- 25 kg, Urea-540-1000 gm and Super Phosphate-570-760 gm per plant, Potash 450-830 gm, (5 years or more)-Manure-30 kg, Urea-1000 gm and Super Phosphate-760 gm , Potash - 830 grams","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Okra,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF NEMATODE IN FIELD?,"Do not sow nematode-damaged crops for 2-3 years, 2-year crop rotation is also beneficial, many species of nematodes that live in normal soil moisture die with overwatering, castor and groundnut pods 0.2% Application 3 weeks before seeding reduces nematode problem in okra and tomato and 4 kg furadan (carbofuran) or nematofree (organic nematode inhibitor Paecilomyces lilacinus ) 50 gm per square meter of field or 2 kg spread per acre. Nematode attack in crops can also be reduced by","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Okra,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT-KNOT NEMATODES IN BHINDI IN STANDING CROP?,Spread 8-10 kg Furadan 3g (Carbofuran) or 2 kg Nematoferi (Verticillium chlamydosporium) mixed with 15-20 kg sand per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
