Vegetables,Okra,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON OKRA CROP?,Alika - 8 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed. (Thiomethaxam 12.6 %+ Lambda Cilothrene 9.5%).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Okra,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF LEAF EATING CATERPILLAR ON BHINDI?,"The larva of this insect is whitish-brown in color with a dark brown head. It enters the stem from the stem and eats the inner part. The worm enters the fruit near the stem and damages the fruit. The fruit becomes crooked and holes appear on it. Pest Control- Collect and destroy the rotten pods and fruits. Spray Chlorpyrifos 2 ml per liter and Quinolphos 2 ml per liter. Carbaryl 2 gm and neem oil 3 ml should be combined. .5 ml per liter should be sprayed. Infested flowers, fruits and buds lying on the ground should be burnt and destroyed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
