Vegetables,Okra,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF BHINDI?,"Okra can be grown in light medium as well as heavy soils. But should have well-drained soil. Although okra is cultivated throughout the year, the harvest is best in Kharif and summer seasons. The crop tolerates temperatures between 20 and 40 celsius. Okra crops better than other vegetables when water is scarce.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Ber,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER YIELD OF FRUIT?,"For a good yield of berries, 1 kg N:P:K 13:00:45 mixed with 100 liters of water can be sprayed per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Ber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO IMPROVE THE QUALITY OF FRUIT?,Spray N:P:K 13 0 45 on flowers to improve fruit quality,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Ber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CRACKING OF FRUITS?,Spray borax (sodium borate) at the rate of 2 grams per liter to prevent the problem of fruit cracking.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Ber,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TRAINING AND PRUNING IN BER?,"Through pruning and pruning of the plant is necessary every year. It starts at nursery time. Make sure to have a stem plant in the nursery. At the time of planting in the field, the upper end of the plant should be clean and have 4-5 strong branches 30-45 cm long. Cut the branches of the plant so that the branches do not spread on the ground. Cut off the dry, broken and diseased branches of the plant. Prune the plant in the second fortnight of May while the plant is not growing. Spray Bordeaux mixture (2:2:250) or 2.5 g Blytox per liter immediately after pruning.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Ber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF ROOT ROT OR ROOT BORER IN BER PLANT?,Keep 1 kg of white sandalwood at the time of watering.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Ber,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPRAYING FOR INCREASING FLOWERING IN APPLE BER?,For flowering in apple borer cropsTata Bahar should be sprayed with 30 ml per 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CITRUS PSYLLA AND APHIDS IN CITRUS?,Spray 200 ml of Confidor 17.8 SL (Imidacloprid) or 160 g of Actara 25 WG in 500 liters of water per acre during April-May and September-October.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF FOOT ROT/GUMMOSIS IN CITRUS?,Dissolve the affected plants with 50 ml sodium hypochlorite 5% or 25 g Ridomil Gold in 10 liters of water per plant and tamp the soil and mulch thoroughly under the canopy of the plants.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
