Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHITE FLY MANAGEMENT FOR LEMON?,Mix neem oil 3 ml + sticky liquid 1 ml /1 liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME Cultural Practices IN LEMON?,"Paper lemon trees need water stress in August September to sustain palm blossom; But if there is rain at this time, the garden is not stressed, and if the weather is unfavorable, the amount of flowering is reduced. In September-October, the flowering rate is only 10 to 15 percent.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
