Fruits,Lemon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF GUMMOSIS ON LEMON ()?,The bark from the place where the gum flows should be scraped off in such a way as not to damage the inner part of the tree. Then wash with 1% potassium permanganate solution and apply Bordomalam.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
