Fruits,Lemon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INTERCROPPING IN LEMON?,"Lemon: Up to the initial 4-5 years, mung bean, cowpea, groundnut, urad, shravan ghewda, onion, garlic, cabbage, gram, fenugreek should be intercropped in open spaces in two rows.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
