Cereals,Barley,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF GRASSY LEAF WEEDS IN BARLEY AFTER FIRST IRRIGATION?,Apply 500 g Arilon (Isoproteuron 75 WP) or 400 ml Axial (Penoxadin 5 EC) or 400 ml Puma Power (Finoxaprop-p-ethyl 10 EC) in 150 liters of water. Spray within 30-35 days of wheat sowing after the first watering,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
