Oilseeds,Groundnut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COMBINED NUTRIENT SPRAY IN GROUNDNUT.?,"DAP 1kg, Ammonium Sulphate 400g and Borax (Vensurum) 200g should be mixed together in 15 liters of water and kept overnight, the next day the mixture should be filtered and mixed with 200 liters of water + 120 ml of Planopics and sprayed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
