Oilseeds,Groundnut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RAINFED GROUNDNUT NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT?,"5 to 10 tons of humus manure, 5 to 10 tons of humus manure before sowing. Apply 75 kg gypsum (9 kg urea), (25 kg super phosphate) and (30 kg potash) per acre. On 40-75th day of rainfed crop, 75 kg of gypsum should be applied along the sides of the plants depending on soil moisture.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
