Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL WHITE GRUB IN GROUND NUT?,Imidacloprid 40% + Fipronil 40% - 150 g should be diluted in 400 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT SEED RATE OF SUMMER GROUNDNUT?,"Groundnut seeds Variety wise groundnut seeds should be used per hectare as follows. 100 kg : SB 11, TAG 24, TG 26, JL 501, Phule 6021, 120 to 125 kg Phule Pragati, Phule Vyas, TPG 41, Phule Unap, Phule Unnati","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GROUNDNUT?,"Groundnut -Variety -TAG 24, SB- 11, Flowers 285 TG -26 TPG -41 Western -44 Flowers - Unnati JL -24","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR GROUNDNUT?,Groundnut - Fertilizer - Apply 18 46 00 50 kg + Gypsum 50 kg at sowing and 50 kg Gypsum / acre at sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT TO GROUNDNUT?,Groundnut - Apply a solution of 5 gm thirum per kg seed followed by 25 gm phosphorus soluble bacterial culture agent + 150 gm jaggery + 1 liter water in cold water and apply to the seed..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF GROUNDNUT?,"Sowing Time Summer 15th January to 15th February, minimum temperature at the time of sowing should be 18 degrees Celsius or above.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME Cultural Practices OF GROUNDNUT?,"Seed rate: About 100 to 125 kg of seed per hectare depending on the variety is required for sowing. However, while determining the amount of seed, the variety selected for sowing, the number of plants per hectare, the weight of 100 grains of seeds, germination and sowing distance should be considered. For this, 100 kg of seed is required for SB 11, TAG 24, 125 kg of seed for Phule Pragati, TPG 41, JL 501 and 80 to 85 kg of seed should be used for Nimpasara and Pasara varieties.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT VARIETIES OF GROUNDNUT FOR SUMMER CULTIVATION?,"Groundnut - Varieties - TAG 24, SB- 11, Flowers 285, TG-26, TPG-41, Western-44, Flowers - Unnati, JL-24","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME QUERRY ABOUT FERTILIZER DOSE FOR GROUNDNUT?,"Fertilizer rate for groundnut - 25 kg of nitrogen + 50 kg of phosphorus should be applied during summer sowing. For groundnut, 250 kg of gypsum along with nitrogen and phosphorus (1.25 kg at sowing and 125 kg at emergence) should be given.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GROUNDNUT CROP?,"Groundnut Crop Varieties TAG 24, TG 26, S. 11, SB11, Phule 285, TG-26, TPG-41.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON GROUNDNUT?,Groundnut sap-sucking insect management Thymethoxam (Actra) 5 gm + Bavistein 30 gm/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATERPILLAR ON GROUNDNUT?,Spray Quinolphos 30 ml + Ridomil Gold 30 gm per 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN GROUNDNUT?,Spray Pursuit (Emazithapar 10 % SL) in 20 ml/10 liter of water on weeds after 21 days of crop emergence.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER USESIN GROUNDNUT?,Groundnut Fertilizer - 12:61:00 60 gm + Microla in 30 ml / 15 liters of water for spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT FOR GROUNDNUT?,For growth of white roots of groundnut crop - Humic acid 30 ml in 15 liters of water should be sprayed..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLACK SPOT / RUST ATTACK IN GROUNDNUT CROP?,For black spots or copper blight in groundnut crops - M 45 - 25 gms / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TIKKA DISEASE ATTACK ON GROUNDNUT?,M-45 30 gm / 15 liters of water should be taken and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BLIGHT ON GROUNDNUT?,Spray Bhuimuga with Bavistein 30 g / 15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GROUNDNUT CROP?,For growth on groundnut crop -19:19:19 60 gm + Microla 30 ml + Bavistin (Carbendazim 50% WP) 30 gm /15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME STRESS RETARDANT IN G.NUT?,Groundnut - to relieve stress - possession (can biosis),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WHITE FLY ON GROUNDNUT?,Ulla should be sprayed at 8 g/15 liters of water. (Flonicamid 50% WG),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YELLOWING OF GROUNDNUT?,Groundnut disease control - Mikrolla 45 ml + Saf 40 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETY OF GROUNDNUT FOR RABI SEASON?,WAN TPG 41 is recommended for rabi season for groundnut crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF GROUNDNUT CROP?,"Groundnut seed treatment - To protect the crop from seed borne and seedling disease, apply 5 gm Thirum or 2 gm Carbondenzym or 3 gm Mancozeb or 5 gm Trichoderma biological fungicide per kg seed before sowing. Then 25 grams of phosphorus soluble bacterial growth agent should be applied to one kg of seed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Groundnut,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROUNDNUT CULTIVATION DURING RABI SEASON?,"Groundnut should be sown from November 15 to December 15 during rabi season. After sowing, the yield decreases. SB for cultivation. - 11, T.A.G. - 24, T.G. - 26 of these varieties require 100 kg of seeds per hectare. So Phule Pragati, Phule Vyasa, Phule Unap, J.L. - 501, Phule Bharti requires 120 to 125 kg of seeds per hectare","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GINGER FARMING IN PUNJAB?,Ginger cultivation is not recommended in Punjab I,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF GINGER?,Ginger is sown in the first week of May-June.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GINGER SEED RATE INFORMATION?,Seed rate - 300 kg / acre (ginger tubers) required,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOIL AND CLIMATE FOR GINGER CULTIVATION?,"Aerated, well-drained, loamy soils are most suitable. It can be grown as a cash crop at an altitude of 1500 meters above sea level with annual rainfall of 150 cm.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN GINGER?,19:19:19 100 grams in 15 liters of water should be diluted for proper growth of ginger crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOIL BORNE PEST ATTACK ON GINGER?,Chlorpyrifos 40 ml/15 liters of water should be taken and filtered.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR GINGER CROP?,"For rooting of the ginger plant - 12:61:00 - 70 grams along with Microla - 30 ml - 15 liters of water should be sprayed or sprinkled, .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MATURITY STAGE OF GINGER?,"Ginger crop is ready in 7 months. But if ginger is planted for circumcision, the crop is ready in 8.5 to 9 months. In the month of January, the leaves turn yellow and start turning yellow. Cut the dried leaves and grate the leaves. They dig up the ginger pods with a spade, .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF GINGER?,"Ginger-Van-Mahim, Varda, Mahima, Suprabha, Suruchi, Surbhi, Rio-de-Janeiro.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR GINGER?,"For growth, 00:52:34-+60 gm + micro should be taken in 30 ml//15 liters of water and sprayed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PLANTING SEASON OF GINGER?,Ginger is planted from the second week of May to the first week of June.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR IN GINGER?,Larvin 30 g / 15 liters of water spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK WILT IN GINGER?,Blue copper (copper oxychloride 50% WP )-30 gm/15 liters of water should be taken and filtered.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DOSE OF CUSTODIA FUNGICIDE FOR GINGER?,250 ml per acre of Custodia fungicide should be used for ginger crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GINGER CATERPILLAR ATTACK?,Ginger pest - Chlorpyrifos 30 ml/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF ROOT BORER ON GINGER?,Chlorpyrifos 400 ml/200 liters of water should be sprayed for 1 acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MEASURES FOR FUNGAL ATTACK IN GINGER?,Thiamethoxam 25 WG 5 gm + Mancozeb 30 gm /15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FUNGAL ATTACK ON GINGER?,Ginger Fungicide - Tilt 2.5 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed. (Propiconazole 250 EC) Syngenta .,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING FUNGICIDES?,Ginger - Spray - Both should be sprayed with the same fungicide.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR GINGER?,19:19:19 3 kg should be released from drip for ginger crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BLIGHT ATTACK ON GINGER?,Blue copper (copper oxychloride 50 % WP )- 30 gm + Microla should be taken in 30 ml /15 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INCREASE GROWTH IN GINGER CROP?,12:61:00 1-1.5 Kg + Microla 300 ml + Humic Acid 500 ml / 200-250 L of water should be given by drip for more budding and balanced growth in ginger crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL WILT ATTACK IN GINGER?,Radomil Gold 40 g + Humic Acid 30 ml /15 liters of water should be given.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Ginger,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL MEFERTILIZER SPRAY FOR GINGER?,For ginger crop = 13:40 13 g + Microla 30 ml + Ridomil Gold 40 g / 15 l water should be taken and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER GROWTH OF PUMPKIN?,Spray 1 KG NPK (13:0:45) mixed with 100 liters of water for one acre to get better fruit from pumpkin crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FRUITING OF PUMPKIN?,"In Chapan pumpkin, if the fruit dries up after flowering, pollination has to be done, so the open flowers should be placed over the closed flowers, which will allow pollination to take place.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PUMPKIN ROOT ROT MANAGEMENT?,Mix Pseudomonas 5ml per liter of water and pour to soak the roots,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOLIAR SPRAY IN PUMPKIN?,Mix and spray potassium nitrate at the rate of 5 grams per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROUNDNUT CAKE APPLICATION FOR PUMPKIN?,Apply 30 grams per pit or 10-15 kg per acre soaked in water and let through drain irrigation. .,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF CURL VIRUS CONTROL IN PUMPKIN?,Mix and spray Bipronil at the rate of 2 ml/l of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUCKING PEST CONTROL BY ORGANIC METHOD?,Place a yellow and blue colored patch.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE VARIETIES OF PUMPKIN?,"Go 1, Go 2, Arka Suryamukhi and Arka Chandan etc.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING SEASON FOR PUMPKIN?,June - July and December - January,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PUMPKIN SOWING SPACING?,2 meters per row and 2 meters between plants,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SUITABLE PUMPKIN VARIETIES?,"Ko 1, Ko 2, Arkasuriyamukhi and Arka Chandan.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF BLIGHT MANAGEMENT IN PUMPKIN?,Mix and spray potassium nitrate at the rate of 5 grams per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FRUIT DROPPING IN CUCURBITs?,"Since the male and female flowers in the pumpkin species are in different places, the honey bee does the pollination in them, so if there is not one bee, there is a problem of fruit falling.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF RED PUMPKIN?,"Red Pumpkin -Variety -Co-1, Co-2, Arka Sandalwood, Arka Sunflower, Pusa Vishwas, Pusa Vikas.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON PUMPKIN CROP?,Bio 303 - Spray 22 ml / 15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Nutrient Management,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TOP DRESSING FOR PUMPKIN	?",Spray 5 g of potassium nitrate per liter of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pumpkin,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING SEASON FOR PUMPKIN	?",June - July and December - January,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT?,Apply 200g of micronutrient mixture per tree per year.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RHINOCEROS BEETLE COCONUT?,Neem powder mixed with 50gm of twice (100gm) sand and placed between the farms at the bottom of the third bats in the lobed areas can avoid the damage caused by the beetles.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RHINOCEROS BEETLE CONTROL MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT?,Cover a 5-10g ball of sand with sand and keep it in bat cages for young shoots.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT TOP DRESSING FERTILIZER APPLICATION?,"Urea 615 g, Super Phosphate 1 kg + Potash 1 kg + Manure 25 kg + Neem Punnaku 2.5 kg + Micronutrient Mixture 500 g / tree / once in 6 months","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT FERTILIZERS MANAGEMENT?,Urea 650g + Super Phosphate 1kg + Potash 1kg + Neem Cake 2.5kg + Manure 25kg + Coir Powder 500g should be applied per tree.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT RHINOCEROS BEETLE MANAGEMENT?,Mix neem powder and sand in the ratio of 1.2 and apply 150 kg per tree in 3 battens of Nadukurut.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BUD ROT MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT?,Spray copper oxychloride 2.5 g per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RHINOCEROS BEETLE MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT?,Neem powder should be mixed with 150 gm and 300 gm sand and applied bat to bat.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT INTERCROPPING WITH PADDY?,Crops like sugarcane and paddy should be avoided.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT TREE TRIMMING MANAGEMENT?,Dry husks and pods can be removed after fruit harvesting.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT FOR COCONUT?,Compost 25 kg + Neem cake 2.5 kg + Urea 650 gm + Super phosphate 1 kg + Potash 1 kg/tree,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HYBRID COCONUT VARIETIES BEARING STARING DETAIL AND ECONOMIC LIFE SPAN?,The year of first harvest is 3-4 years and the lifespan is 30-40 years.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BIO FERTILIZER APPLY COCONUT?,50 g of azopyrillum and 50 g of phospho bacterium + 100 g of neem cake mixed with 5 kg of compost should be applied per tree.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF BLIGHT MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT?,Mix and spray 10 grams of pseudomonas per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COMPATIBILITY OF NEEM OIL AND PSUEDOMONAS?,It is recommended to use Neem oil and Pseudomonas separately.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BUTTON SHEDDING FOR COCONUT?,Apply coconut tonic 200ml by root.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT SEEDLINGS SELECTION?,"Quality calves of 9-12 months can be selected using the following traits: early germination, rapid growth and calf vigor. Calves 10-12 months old with 6 to 8 udders or 9 month old calves with at least 4 udders. Neck thickness 10-12 cm. Rapidly dividing leaves indicate rapid growth and rapid fruiting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT PLANTING METHOD?,"3 feet long, wide and deep pits should be dug. The pit should be filled up to a height of 2 feet (60 cm) with composted manure and sand mixed equally. The coconut saplings with all the emerging roots removed should be planted in the middle of the tube after removing the soil mixture. The seedling and the coconut along with it should be compacted around the soil.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT PLANT POPULATION PER ACRE AND SPACING?,71 saplings can be planted per acre (7.5m x 7.5m).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT INTERCROPPING BELOW 7 YRS TREE?,"Up to five years depending on respective climate, area of tree and nature of soil. One season crops such as groundnut, sesame, sunflower, cassava, turmeric and banana can be grown. Cultivation of crops like sugarcane and paddy should be avoided","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INTERCROPS IN COCONUT?,"One season crops like groundnut, sesame, sunflower, cassava, turmeric and banana can be intercropped. Cultivation of crops like sugarcane and paddy should be avoided.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF EATING CATERPILLAR IN COCONUT?,Chlorpyrifos 2 ml should be mixed with 1 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RHINOCEROS BEETLE IN COCONUT?,One kg of castor bean powder should be mixed in 5 liters of water in an earthen pot. The beetles should be collected and destroyed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BUTTON SHED MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT?,Two packets (200 ml) of tonic per year should be given by root at 6 month intervals. Benefits: Reduces itching. Pods get bigger and lentil gets heavier.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BUTTON SHED IN COCONUT?,One packet (200 ml) of coconut tonic should be given by root at 6 month intervals.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BORON DEFICIENCY MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT?,Apply 50 grams of Borax per tree,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
