Fruits,Coconut,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT VARIETIES?,"Azhiyar Nagar 1, Azhiyar Nagar 2, Vepankulam-3 (Andaman Sada), Chavgad Orange Kuttai (COD) Chavgad Green Kuttai (CGD) Chavgad Yellow Kuttai (CYD)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT PLANTING?,"3 feet long, wide and deep pits should be dug. The pit should be filled up to a height of 2 feet (60 cm) with composted manure and sand mixed equally. The coconut saplings with all the emerging roots removed should be planted in the middle of the tube after removing the soil mixture. The seedling and the coconut along with it should be compacted around the soil. Planted calves should be shaded with plaited coconut leaves or palm leaves. The soil that collects around coconut saplings should be removed frequently. The circular bed should be widened every year.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MICRO NUTRIENT APPLICATION IN COCONUT?,Coconut Fertilizer 500g/tree,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT TONIC?,One packet (200 ml) of coconut tonic should be given intravenously at 6 month intervals.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HOW MUCH OIL CAN YOU GET FROM A COCONUT?,700 ml of oil can be extracted from 1 kg of coconut.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BUD ROT IN COCONUT?,Mix 2.5 grams of copper oxychloride in one liter of water and spray. (Remove the infected part of the chicken and soak the part with 2.5 copper oxychloride),"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOVE 5 YEAR COCONUT TREE FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,Cow dung manure 50 kg + Urea 1.2 kg + 2 kg Super Phosphate + Potash 2 kg + Micronutrient 1 kg + Borax 50 g / 1 tree Chemical fertilizer divided into two equal parts every 6 months Give method,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN WASTE LAND (ORGANIC)?,"Green gram - 10 litres, salt - 1 kg, neem oil 100 ml, lemon - 1 per acre mixed with 10 liters of water and sprayed.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT HYBRIDS INFORMATION?,"Yields in 2 years, life span is less than native varieties","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
