Fruits,Coconut,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME COCONUT PALM RETAINED FROM HEAVY WIND?,"If there are too many bats on the tree, the bats can be cut as per the advice of the horticultural authorities.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BUD ROT MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT (ORGANIC)?,Apply porto paste and protect it from rain water until new root comes. (To prepare 1 liter of porto paste 100 g of copper sulphate and 100 g of slaked lime are dissolved separately in 500 ml of water and both are mixed together).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
