Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHITE FLY MANAGEMENT IN COCONUT?,Setting yellow light trap at 2 numbers per acre. Whiteflies can also be controlled by applying chrysoperla insecticides from Agricultural University and Central Integrated Pest Management Center at Trichy and applying 400 per acre of water on infested leaves.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
