Fruits,Coconut,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ENCARSIA PARASITOID AVAILABILITY DETAILS?,"Give necessary spacing in coconut trees, remove dried bats, place yellow sticky traps between trees, then add starch solution (mix 1 kg of maida/starch in 5 liters of water and boil it to 20 liters). After that, the starch dries and turns into granules, eliminating the fungus.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
