Pulses,Pigeon Pea,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MANAGEMENT IN RED GRAM CROP?,"As tur is mainly a kharif season crop, it grows on rainfed. However, in case of failure or water stress and irrigation facilities are available, the crop should be watered during the growing stage (30 to 35 days), flowering stage (60 to 70 days) and pod filling stage. This increases crop production.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
