Vegetables,Bitter Gourd,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF BITTER GOURD?,"The fruits of this variety are white and long. This variety is cultivated in Maharashtra during the monsoon season. Araka Harit: Fruits of this variety are attractive small medium shaped, green in color. The fruit contains few seeds. Pusa Do Mosami : The fruit of this variety is heavy and long and green. This breed is suitable for both seasons. Harvesting of fruits starts in 55 days. Pusa Special : This variety is suitable for summer season and suitable for river bank cultivation. Apart from this, Selection-4, Selection-5, Selection-6 developed by the university as well as Konkan Tara, Phule Green Gold Extract, Hirakni are suitable for cultivation.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
