Vegetables,Sorghum,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DURATION OF SORGHUM?,Sorghum crop is ready for harvesting in 110 to 130 days depending on the variety..,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Sorghum,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF FUNGUS ON SORGHUM?,"Sorghum Fungicide - M 45, 30 gm / 15 liters of water spray.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Sorghum,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WILT ATTACK AND FERTILIZER FOR SORGHUM?,1) For growth control of sorghum crop -19:19:19 40 g + Microla 30 ml + M-45 30 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed 2) Actra 5 g / 15 liters of water should be sprayed for control of juice sucking insect on lemon crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Sorghum,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN SORGHUM?,"For effective weed control in sorghum, 25 to 30 days after sowing, 2,4-D (sodium salt) 80 w.p. (Especially for broad water weeds) Spray 400 g per acre mixed with 200 liters of water. (50 grams / 15 liters of water)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Sorghum,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER FOR SORGHUM?,Sorghum - 10:26:26 1 bag + 25 kg of urea should be used per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Sorghum,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF RABBI SORGHUM?,"Rabi Sorghum-Light soil (up to 30 cm deep) : Phule Anuradha, Phule Mauli Medium soil (up to 60 cm deep) : Phule Suchitra, Phule Mauli, Phule Chitra, Parbhani Moti, Maldandi-35-1 Heavy soil (more than 60 cm deep) : Phule Vasudha, Phule Yashoda, csv. 22, P.K.V. Kranti, C.S.H. 15, C.S.H. 19, .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Ridge Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RIDGE GOURD VIRUS DISEASE MANAGEMENT?,"Viral disease management response in Birken; Professor and Head, Department of Agrl.Entomology, TNAU, Coimbatore -641003 Tel: 0422-6611214","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Ridge Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR MANAGEMENT IN RIBBED GOURD?,Mix and spray Bipronil at the rate of 1.5 ml per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Ridge Gourd,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RIBBED GOURD FRUIT QUALITY INCREASE?,Mix potassium nitrate 5 gm and borax 1 gm per liter of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Ridge Gourd,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPACING IN RIDGE GOURD?,Two rows are spaced 80 to 120 cm between two vines at 2.5 to 3.5 m. 2 to 3 seeds are planted in each location.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Ridge Gourd,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF RIDGE GOURD?,Dodka-van- j k-malvika Rama Dhanush Mayuri,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Ridge Gourd,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR BITTER GOURD?,19:19:19 1.5 kg + Micronutrients 300 ml + Saf 400 g should be sprayed per acre in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INFORMATION OF SPRAYING?,No pesticide should be mixed and sprayed on the crop without recommendation.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME POD DROPPING IN SOYBEAN?,Spray Plano Fix 4 ml /15 liters of water,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WHITE FLY ON SOYBEAN?,"Ampligo (chloratranilylprole (10%) + lambda cyhotothrein (5%)) 80 to 100 ml per acre,","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR CONTROL ATTACK OF FRUIT BORER ON SOYABEAN CROP?,Takumi (Flubendamine 20% WGD) 5 g/15 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MIXING OF INSECTICIDES?,Do not use any kind of insecticide or fungicide together.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR SOYBEAN?,Soybean Fertilizer Spray : (00 52 34) 60 g/15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME HARVESTING OF SOYBEAN?,"Soybean pods should be harvested after 90 to 110 days of maturity, after the color of the pods has turned yellowish brown. If the harvest is delayed, the pods start to burst.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Soybean,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF CATERPILLAR ON SOYBEAN?,Spray Profenophos - 30 ml in 15 liters of water for control of bollworm on soybean crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Orange,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WHITE GRUB ATTACK IN ORANGE?,Human control in orangesForate ten percent,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Orange,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ANT CONTROL ON ORANGE CROP?,For ant control on orange crop - Thimet 4 kg/acre should be used.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Orange,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF GUMMOSIS ON ORANGE?,The bark from the place where the gum flows should be scraped off in such a way as not to damage the inner part of the tree. Then wash with 1% potassium permanganate solution and apply Bordomalam.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Orange,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER SPRAY FOR ORANGE CROP?,19:19:19 1.5 kg + micronutrients 300 ml + M-45 400 g should be sprayed per acre in 200 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Orange,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF ORANGE AND DRUMSTICK CROP?,"Varieties of oranges: - Nagpur oranges, Kinno oranges and no. There are 182 castes. Shevga Varieties :- Odissi, PKM-1, PKM-2, Ko-1, Siddhivinayak Shevga Konkan Ruchira.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF WATERMELON?,"Sugar Baby, Sugar Queen Arka Manik, Arka Jyoti, Augusta, Sugar King Badshah, Tejas","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN WATERMELON?,Fertilizer in Kalingad crop - 10:26:26 per acre - 1 bag should be applied.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON WATERMELON?,Karate (Lambda 5 SC) should be taken in 20 ml/15 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON WATERMELON CROP?,(Dimethoate) Dimethoate 30% EC should be taken in 15 ml / 15 liters of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CATERPILLAR ATTACK ON WATERMELON?,Neemboli extract should be taken in 30 ml /15 liter of water and sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF RED MITES ON WATERMELON?,Spray Spiromesifen 240 SC (22.9 % w/w).,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF SUCKING PEST ATTACK IN WATERMELON?,Lambda Psilothrin 5% SC in 1ml/1 liter of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE FOR WATERMELON?,Kalingad Fertilizer -19:19:19 3 kg + Microla 300 ml + Humic acid 500 ml per 200 liters of water per acre by drip.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Watermelon,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF WILT (MAR)DRENCHING?,Ridomil Gold 45 grams + humic acid 30 ml/15 liters of water should be mixed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF ROOT ROT IN CAULIFLOWER?,Mix 500 gm of sophilizer (Carbendazim + Mancozeb) in 15-20 kg of soil and sprinkle at good moisture.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DOWNY MILDEW AND ALTERNARIA BLIGHT IN CAULIFLOWER?,Spray 600 g of Indofil M-45 dissolved in 200 liters of water per acre at 7 days interval.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME GROWTH  OF CAULIFLOWER?,Spray 1 KG powder NPK (19:19:19) in 100 liters of water(@10 g per liter) for growth of cauliflower.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT BETTER FRUITING IN CAULIFLOWER?,"You can sprinkle one kilo of NPK 13:00:45, so mix it in a liter of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF CAULIFLOWER?,"For cauliflower, 250 gms in late season and 500 gms in early season are used for preparing one acre of paddy.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF BRINJAL SHOOT AND FRUIT BORER IN BRINJAL?,"200 ml of Cypermethrin 10 EC, 160 ml of Deltamethrin 2.8 EC, 80 ml of Coragen, 80 g of Proclam 5 SG (Amamectin Benzoate) or 800 ml of Acalox mixed with 100 liters of water for control of fruit and lager borer in brinjal. Spray for one acre and box the damaged fruit in the ground.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR IN CAULIFLOWER?,Spray 70 grams of Proclam mixed with 100 liters of water to prevent rust in cauliflower.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR BETTER GROWTH OF CAULIFLOWER?,You can spray 1 kg 13:00:45 so mix it in liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF CATERPILLAR/DOWNY MILDEW IN CAULIFLOWER?,300 ml Dipal (organic insecticide) or 70 g Proclaim or Success (Spinosed 2.5 SC) 100 ml Sumicidin 20 EC (Fenvalerate) or 200 ml Avat (Indoxacarb 15.8 EC) or Corazine 50 ml Mix in 100 liters of water and spray,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TO GROWTH OF CAULIFLOWER?,1 KG powder NPK (19:19:19) in 100 liters of water(@10 grams per liter) for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INSECT CONTROL IN cauliflower?,Dilute 10 ml of chlorpyrifos 20 EC per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN CAULIFLOWER?,"Spray 1 liter of Stomp 30 EC, dissolved in 200 liters of water for one acre to prevent weeds from sprouting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF FERTILIZER IN CAULIFLOWER CROP?,"For cauliflower, apply 55 kg urea, 155 kg super phosphate and 40 kg potash. For sowing, apply 55 kg urea after one month.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MATURITY TIME OF CAULIFLOWER CROP?,Cauliflower Pusa Snowball-1 variety is ready 100 days after transplanting and Pusa Snowball K-1 variety is ready after one week.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SPACING OF CAULIFLOWER?,Plant early season crop of cauliflower at 45*45 cm and late season crop at 45*30(line*plant) cm spacing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TRANSPLANTING TIME OF CAULIFLOWER?,"Planting time for early crop is June-July, main crop from August to mid-September and late crop from October to first week of November.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF CAULIFLOWER CROP?,"April, May, June, July, August, September and October","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Cauliflower,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF CAULIFLOWER?,"Cauliflower -Variety -Pusa Deepali, Pusa Shubhra, Pusa Snowball -1 ,Himani Suhasini Pavas","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Okra,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER GROWTH OF OKRA CROP?,"For good growth of okra, spray 1 kg NPK at 19:19:19 per 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Okra,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN OKRA?,"Apply 80 kg urea per acre to okra crop, first part at sowing and second part after first harvesting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Okra,"	Plant Protection	",INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WILT IN OKRA?,Apply Bavistan (Carbendazim) 1 gram per liter of water to the roots near the plant.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF STEM BORER/LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY?,60 ml of Corajan 18.5 SC (Chlorantraniliprole) or 20 ml of FEM 480 SC (Flubendamide) or 170 g of Mortar 75 SG (cartop hydrochloride) to 100 liters for prevention of stem rot/leaf blight in paddy/basmati. Put in water and spray per acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME INSECTICIDE EFFECT OF SPRAY IF CROP WASHED OUT BY WATER OF RAIN AFTER SPRAYING 12 HORSES ON PADDY CROP?,"If crop washed out by water of rain after spraying 12 horse on paddy crop, insecticide little less work to protect crop from insect.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF WEEDS FROM THE VACANT FIELD BEFORE SOWING?,Spray 500 ml of gramoxone 24 SL (Paraquat) in 200 liters of water per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF STEM BORER AND LEAF FOLDER IN PADDY?,"Spray 170 gm mortar (Cartop Hydrochloride 75 SG), 20 ml FEM (Flubedamide 480 SC) in 100 liters water and spray in one acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YIELD OF NEW PADDY VARIETY?,"New varieties of paddy-PR 128 (yield-30.5 quintal time-141 days, height-110 cm), PR 129 (yield-30 quintal time-138 days, height-105 cm) and HKR - 47 (yield-29.5 quintal time-134 days, height-117 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PR 126 PADDY VARIETY?,The sowing time of PR 126 is from 20th May to 5th June and 25-30 days old seedlings are planted in the field.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT CAN WE USE THE SEED OF PADDY FROM PREVIOUS YEAR'S CROP?,Parmal paddy seed can be saved for the next year but if the crop has any seed borne disease then the seed cannot be saved.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PADDY VARIETY PUSA-44?,"Pusa 44 is an uncertified variety of paddy, it is more susceptible to diseases and pests and takes longer to mature.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT THE VARIETIES OF PADDY PR-127, PR-128 AND PR-129?","Paddy Varieties --PR 128 (yield-30.5 quintal time-141 days, height-110 cm), PR 129 (yield-30 quintal time-138 days, height-105 cm) and PR 127 (Yield-30 quintals, time-137 days, height 104 cm:).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPECIAL VARIETY OF PADDY SUITABLE IN SALINE AND ALKALINE SOIL?,No specific variety of paddy is recommended in the colored fields. PR 127 variety should be avoided here and Gypsum should be used based on soil test report for other varieties.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SPECIAL VARIETY OF PADDY SUITABLE UNDER POOR QUALITY IRRIGATION WATER?,"No particular variety of paddy is recommended in poor water fields, PR 127 variety should be avoided and gypsum should be used based on water test report for other varieties.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS OF CR-212 VARIETY OF PADDY?,"CR 212 variety of paddy is not recommended by Punjab Agriculture University, Ludhiana, contact the respective dealer for information.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FIELD PREPARATION FOR TRANSPLANTATION OF PADDY?,"Before planting the pumpkin, level the field with a laser harrow very fine and well so that the fertilizer and other materials can be used properly and fix all the bumps. Planting good pumpkin will reduce the number of weeds and will save water because it will reduce water seepage into the ground.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE METHOD OF LAND PREPARATION FOR DIRECT SOWING AFTER RAIN?,"To prepare the field, after plowing twice with Taviyans, one should plow and harrow again, after that level the field with a laser harrow and water the field, after that one plow and harrow Sow after","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LAND REQUIREMENTS FOR PADDY NURSERY?,Sow 8 kg of seed in 6.5 marla (1.23 kg per marla) to plant paddy in one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN PADDY NURSERY?,"Apply 60 kg super phosphate, 26 kg urea, 40 kg zinc 21% or 25 kg zinc 33% before sowing and 26 kg urea per acre after 15 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF PADDY FOR DIRECT SOWING?,"For direct sowing of paddy, the seed quantity should be 8-10 kg of seed per acre, do not use more than 10 kg of seed because it will make the crop more dense and not a good fertilizer.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PRE-EMERGENCE WEED MANAGEMENT IN DIRECT SOWING OF PADDY/BASMATI?,Spray 1 liter of Stomp 30 EC (pendimethalin) in 200 liters of water per acre within 2 days of sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN LAND WHERE UPPER LAYER IS REMOVED OR ADDED?,"Apply fertilizers based on soil test in the field from which the soil is tilled or placed, add green manure or manure every year, check the signs of the weeds and spray a mixture of nutrients for good yield.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF PADDY?,Parmal paddy sowing time is from 10 May Sow more time consuming varieties first and give preference to later sowing of less time consuming varieties.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PRE-EMERGENCE WEED MANAGEMENT IN PADDY/BASMATI NURSERY?,62.5 ml of Sofit 37.5 EC (Pertylachlor+Sefner) after 3 days or 150 ml of Butachlor 50 EC after 7 days mixed with 7-8 kg of sand per kanal to prevent weed growth in paddy/basmati plantation. give up,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DETAILS ABOUT VARIETIES OF BASMATI?,"Varieties of Basmati - -Punjab Basmati 7 (2021) (yield-19 quintals, time-131 days), Pusa Basmati 1121 (yield-13.7 quintals, height-120 cm:, time-137 days), Pusa Basmati 1509 ( Yield-15.7 quintal, height-92 cm, time-120 days), Pusa Basmati 1637 (yield-17.5 quintal, height-109 cm, time-138 days), Pusa Basmati 1718 (yield-17 quintal, time -144 days, Height-121 cm), Punjab Basmati 5 (Yield-15 quintal, Height-112 cm, Time-137 days), Punjab Basmati 4 (Yield-17 quintal, Height-96 cm, Time-146 days, Punjab Basmati 3 (Yield-16 quintal, Height-105 cm, Time-139 days), Punjab Basmati 2 (Yield-12.6 quintal, Height-125 cm, Time-140 days), C SR 30 (Yield-13.5 quintal, Height-139 cm, Time-142 days), Basmati 386 (Yield-9 quintal, Height-180 cm, Time-155 days), Basmati 370 (Yield-12 quintal) , height-165 cm, time-150 days)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF DILA AND MOTHA IN SOWING PADDY AND WATER MANAGEMENT?,Spray 100 ml of Nomini Gold/Macho (Bispyribac-Sodium 10 SC) or 8 g of Almix in 150 liters of water on one acre 20-25 days after sowing. Do not water for at least 3-4 days after spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE IRRIGATION SCHEDULE IN DIRECT SEEDED PADDY/BASMATI IN DRY FIELDS?,If paddy is sown in dry field then apply first irrigation immediately after sowing and second irrigation after 4-5 days and subsequent irrigation at 5-7 days interval depending on soil type and weather.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED AND FERTILIZERS REQUIREMENT FOR PADDY/BASMATI NURSERY IF THE NURSERY IS SOWN IN 6.5 MARLAS (SUFFICIENT FOR 1 ACRE)?,"If paddy field is sown in 6.5 marla (1770 sq ft) then 8 kg seed is required and for this apply 1050 g urea, 2.5 kg superphosphate, 1625 g zinc sulphate 21% or 1 kg zinc sulphate 33% per 6.5 marla at sowing. and add 1050 kg urea after 15 days and 30 days (if required)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RODENT IN PADDY?,"To prepare rat bait, mix 1 kg of grain, 20 ml of vegetable oil, 20 g of sugar and 25 g of zinc phosphide and keep near the pit.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF PADDY?,8 kg of seeds are enough for one kilo of paneer,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION OF STOMP WEEDICIDE?,"The best time to apply stop herbicide is within 3 days of paddy planting, repeated application of stop herbicide is not recommended.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT THE PR 126 VARIETY IS PARMAL OR HYBRID?,"PR 126 is a parmal paddy variety, not a hybrid","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE OF PADDY FOR DIRECT SOWING?,Use 8-10 kg of seed for direct sowing of paddy,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER GROWTH OF BOTTLE GOURD CROP?,"For good growth, spray 1 kg NPK at 19:19:19 per 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF WEED IN PADDY?,Apply 100 ml Nomini Gold/Macho (Bespyribac-Sodium 10 SC) for swack grass or 400 ml Rystar 6.7 (Finoxaprop) for spider grass in 150 liters of water 20-25 days after sowing. Make a solution and spray it in one acre,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Rice,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED RATE IN DIRECT SEEDED RICE?,"For direct sowing of paddy, 8-10 kg of seed should be applied per acre","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Potato,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN POTATO CROP?,"Advised to farmer that no spray recommendation in potato crop, you can weeding hoeing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Maize,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT OF FODDER MAIZE?,Apply 10 tons of manure a fortnight before and 40 kg urea at sowing and 40 kg urea 4-5 weeks after sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF KHARIF MAIZE?,"Varieties of Maize for dry season - Long duration varieties - PMH1, PMH11, Prabhat and medium duration varieties - Kesari and short duration varieties - PMH2, Prakash, Megha. Varieties of maize for monsoon season - Long duration varieties - PMH 1 (21 quintals per acre monsoon and 27.6 quintals off season), PMH 11 (22 quintals per acre), Prabhat (17.5 quintals per acre ) and medium duration varieties-Kesari (16 quintals per acre) and short duration varieties-PMH2 (18 quintals per acre), Prakash (15 quintals per acre), Megha (12","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Maize,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CORRECT TIME FOR FIRST IRRIGATION TO THE MAIZE CROP?,Apply the first water to the maize crop 20-25 days after sowing,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Maize,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FOR BETTER GROWTH OF MAIZE?,For good growth of maize you can spray NPK 19:19:19 or Hoshi by mixing it in liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Garlic,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ADVANCE SPRAY TO STOP THE ATTACK OF INSECTS IN GARLIC CROP?,"If the garlic is not attacked by any insects, then there is no need to do any pesticides","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF PINK BOLLWORM IN COTTON?,"200 ml of cypermethrin or 160 ml of deltamethrin or 100 ml of cypermethrin or 100 ml as per availability for control of pink blight. Fenvalerate, or 800 ml of Ethane or 40 ml of FEM 480 SC (flubendamide) or 60 ml of Tracer 45 SC (Spinosed) in 100-125 liters of water and spray on the damaged crop. Spray one group insecticide only once for optimal control of the canker bug. Use Stika/Delta traps to control the pink canker.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MARKET PRICE OF COTTON?,"30/11/2021 Mandi : Breta Boha, Giddarbah : Narma (model price): 8000-8500/quintal, Narma price of Abohar market is not updated","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE WATER SOAKING OF COTTON SEED?,Soaking time for soft unsalted seeds is 2-4 hours,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MANAGEMENT OF EXCESS WATER IN COTTON CROP?,"Drain water from excess waterlogged fields, sprinkle 3 kg of sulfur per acre to increase water drainage.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT IN COTTON IN LIGHT SOILS?,"At the time of soft sowing, if there is a deficiency according to the soil test, you can add 75 kg of single superphosphate and 10 kg of zinc sulfate (21%) and 20 kg of potash.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF COTTON  THE SOWING TIME OF COTTON IS 1 APRIL TO 15 MAY. COTTON CROP TAKES 150-180 DAYS.?,"Sowing time of Narme is 1st April to 15th May, Narme crop takes 150-180 days to mature.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME RECOMMENDED VARIETIES OF BT COTTON?,"Recommended varieties of Bt fertilizers are - PAUBT1, Rasi 650, Rasi 773, Rasi 776, Nuzividu-855, Rasi-809, Rasi 653, Amar Biotech-4899, Amar Biotech-243, Amar Biotech-254, Shriram-2510-2, Shriram-2113-2, Ankur-3228, Ankur-3224, Super-5, Super-965","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF COTTON IN MEDIUM TO LIGHT SOILS?,"Recommended varieties of Bt soft for light to medium soils are - Rasi 650, Rasi 776, Rasi 653, Rasi 926, Shriram-6588-2, Ankur-3028, Ankur-555, US-51, US-91, Bayer 7172","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF COTTON IN MEDIUM-HEAVY SOIL?,"Recommended varieties of Bt soft for medium to heavy soils are - Rasi 773, Rasi 926, Sriram-6588-2, Ankur-3028, US-71, US-81, Bayer 7272, Nuzividu Sim Sim","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF BT-COTTON RECOMMENDED BY PUNJAB AGRICULTURAL UNIVERSITY, LUDHIANA?","Bt Soft Varieties - PAUB T-1 variety has been developed by Punjab Agricultural University, Ludhiana. Its average yield is 11.2 quintals per acre. Apart from this, seeds of many private companies are recommended by PAU. Click on https://epaper.jagbani.com/clip?457440 to see their list","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT IN COTTON?,"If there is a deficiency according to the soil test at the time of soft sowing, you can add 10 kg of zinc sulphate (21%) and 20 kg of potash.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN COTTON CROP?,"After the first watering, when the field comes up, dissolve 500 ml of Hitweed Max 10 percent (Pyrithiobac Sodium 6% + Quijalofap Ethyl 4%) in 150 liters of water and spray per acre on grass and broad-leaved plants. Seasonal weeds can be well controlled i","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED CONTROL IN COTTON?,"Spray 1 liter of Stomp 30 EC in 200 liters of water per acre within 24 hours of sowing and in fields where weeds emerge after rain or irrigation, 1 liter of Stomp 30 EC. C in 200 liters of water is sprayed in the field after sowing or dod 45 days after sowing or instead of godi spray 500 ml Gramoxan in 100 liters of water in between the rows in acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fiber Crops,Cotton,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME PINK BOLLWORM CONTROL IN COTTON CROP?,2 ml cypermethrin or 1.5 ml deltamethrin or 1 ml according to availability for control of pink blight. Mix one of fenvalerate per liter of water and spray on the damaged crop. Spray a group of insecticides only once for optimal control of canker sores.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME YIELD, MATURITY PERIOD AND HEIGHT OF NEW VARIETIES OF WHEAT?","New varieties of wheat-P. B. W 869 (average yield-23.2, days-158, height-101 cm), p. B. W 824 (average yield-23.3, days-156, height-104 cm), p. B. W803 (average yield-22.7, days-151, height-100 cm), Golden PBW 766 (average yield-23.1, days-155, height-106 cm), PBW1 Chapati (average yield-17.2, days-154, height-103 cm), DBW 222 (average yield-22.3, days-152, height-103 cm), DBW 187 (average yield-22.6, days-153, height-104 cm), HD 3226 (Avg yield-21.9, days-155, height-106 cm)","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE PREPARATION OF LAND FOR WHEAT SOWING AFTER PADDY?,"If wheat is to be sown after paddy harvesting, then after harvesting paddy with Super SMS combine, sow with Happy Seeder or Super Seeder if SMS system of the combine is not installed and If sowing with Happy Seeder or Super Seeder is to be done there, first scatter the stubble in the field with the help of rakes or after harvesting the paddy, after cutting the stubble with stubble shaver, expose it to sunlight for 2-3 days. Make bales of straw with a straw baler. After that, if there is enough moisture in the soil, harrow it after 2 times of threshing. If there is not enough moisture in the soil then plow it first or after making bales with baler when the stubble is threshed from the field then if there is moisture then wheat can be sown with zero tillage seed drill without any flow or After paddy harvesting, chop the stubble lying in the field. After that, irrigate the field and later with the help of rotavator or reverse plows, the stubble can be incorporated into the soil. Wheat can be sown with a drill","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF WHEAT SUITABLE FOR SALINE AND ALKALINE SOIL?,"Punjab Agriculture University, Ludhiana does not recommend any variety for wheat fields and bean fields, so some varieties are recommended by ICAR-Central Soil Salinity Research Institute, Karnal, Haryana, these varieties are - KRL 283 (8-16.4 quintals), KRL 210 (13.4-19.7 quintals), KRL 213 (13-17.5 quintals) KRL 19 (12.1-18.5 quintals), KR. L 1-4 (14-19.6 quintal)| For more information and seeds for these contact 0184 229 0501.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT WITH INSECTICIDE?,About seed treatment to be done before sowing to prevent rust in wheat crop So treat by applying 1 g Cruiser 70 WS (Thiamethoxam) or 4 ml Drusban 20 EC (Chlorpyrifos) or 2 ml Neonix 20 FS (Imidacloprid+Hexaconazole) per kg seed. Treatment with Neonix 20FS (Imidacloprid+Hexaconazole) also protects the crop from stem blight and leaf blight.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT WITH BIO-FERTILIZER?,"Dissolve 500 g of Consortium or 250 g of Azotobacter and 250 g of Streptomyces in 0.5 liter of water and mix well with the seed to be used per acre and spread the amended seed on the floor. Shade dry Sow as soon as possible after drying Apply seed dressing with organic fertilizers on the day of sowing Consortium, Azotobacter and Streptomyces organic fertilizers convert atmospheric nitrogen into fertilizer and make the consortium available to the crop It also dissolves the undissolved phosphorus available in the soil. With its help, the phosphorus-containing fertilizer given to the crop gets maximum amount to the crop.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SCHEDULE OF SEED TREATMENT OF WHEAT?,"If you want to treat wheat seed, first treat the seed with insecticide, then fungicide and lastly apply fungicide seed treatment with fungicide not more than one month before sowing and 1 hour after treatment Plant inside","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE APPLICATION OF FARM YARD MANURE IN WHEAT?,Manure for wheat crop should be applied at the time of land preparation and less than 2 kg nitrogen (4.4 kg urea) and 1 kg phosphorus (2.2 kg DAP) per 10 quintal of manure application.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BI-DIRECTIONAL SOWING OF WHEAT?,"In two-way sowing method, sow half of the recommended seed and fertilizer on one side (north-south) and the remaining half on the other side (east-west) (cutting the furrows). Keep a distance of 20 cm (8 inches) from the seedling. In this way, an average yield of 2 quintals more than normal is likely to be obtained.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING OF WHEAT WITH ZERO TILLAGE SEED DRILL?,"If sowing of wheat is to be done without moving the vehicle, then zero drill can be used. In this way, the cost of preparing the land at the time of sowing of wheat crop is saved. It is important to keep one thing in mind. That after 3 consecutive years of sowing wheat with zero drill, the land should be plowed once as the problem of rats is likely to increase in the field without continuous plowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SOWING TIME OF TIMELY SOWING VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,The sowing time of early sowing varieties of wheat is from the fourth week of October to the fourth week of November but the sowing time of advanced PBW 550 and PBW 550 varieties is from the second week of November to the fourth week of November.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOUT FERTILIZER DOSES IN WHEAT CROP?,"Fertilizer doses for wheat crop is 110 kg Urea, 55 kg DAP or 155 kg Superphosphate or Nitrophosphate, Apply 20 kg Muriate of Potash per acre to soil testing low in potassium and in the district Gurdaspur, Hoshiarpur, Roper and Shaheed Bhagat Singh Nagar apply 40 kg Muriate of Potash per acre time of sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE DOSE OF NITROPHOSPHATE (N:P:K::20:20:00) IN WHEAT IF DAP IS NOT AVAILABLE?,"If di-ammonium phosphate (DAP fertilizer) is not available to make phosphorus available to the wheat crop, 125 kg nitro-phosphate (N:P:K::20:20:00) per acre should be applied instead. should be used. This saves 50 kg of urea fertilizer per acre. Therefore, apply 125 kg of nitro-phosphate at the time of sowing and the remaining 60 kg of urea in 2 equal installments of 30 kg each with first and second watering. put","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME OTHER FERTILIZERS TO BE USED IN WHEAT IF DAP IS NOT AVAILABLE?,"If di-ammonium phosphate (DAP fertilizer) is not available to provide phosphorus to the wheat crop, then 155 kg of super phosphate (N:P:K:S:Ca::00:16:00) should be applied in its place. :11:19) should be used The total quantity of urea should be 110 kg only and if superphosphate is to be used in the crop then 20 kg urea should be applied at the time of sowing.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Water Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE FIRST IRRIGATION IN WHEAT?,First water should be given to wheat crop 21-25 days after sowing,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LATE VARIETY OF WHEAT CROP AND SOWING TIME?,Late variety of wheat crop is PBW 757 and sowing time of this variety is 4th night of first January.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF WHEAT FOR SOWING UNDER POPLAR TREES?,If sowing of wheat is to be done under Popular then use of PBW 725 and PBW 677 at 50 kg seed per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED AVAILABILITY OF WHEAT SEED?,"You can buy seeds from Punjab Agricultural University, Agricultural Science Center, Block Agriculture Office and Pan Seed","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE YIELD OF ABOUT THE TIMELY SOWING VARIETIES OF WHEAT?,"Timely sowing varieties of wheat-Golden PBW 766 (average yield-23.1, day-155, height-106 cm), PBW1 Chapati (average yield-17.2, day-154, height-103 cm), DBW 222 (average yield-22.3, days-152, height-103 cm), DBW 187 (average yield-22.6, days-153, height-104 cm), HD 3226 (average yield-21.9, days -155, height-106 cm)P. B. W 869 (average yield-23.2, days-158, height-101 cm), p. B. W 824 (average yield-23.3, days-156, height-104 cm), p. B. W803 (average yield-22.7, days-151, height-100 cm) advanced PBW 343 (yield-23.2 quintal), PBW1 zinc (yield-22.5 quintal), PBW 725 (yield-22.9 quintal ), PBW 677 (yield-22.4 quintals), HD 3086 (yield-23 quintals), HD 2967 (21.4 quintals), WH 1105 (yield-23.1 quintals) and PBW 621 (yield-21.1 quintals). quintal).","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF WHEAT VARIETY HD-3086?,The sowing time of wheat variety HD 3086 is from the fourth week of October to the fourth week of November,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Cultural Practices,"INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE HELPLINE NUMBER FOR COMPLAINT AGAINST THE DEALER WHO SELLS DUPLICATE SEEDS, FERTILIZERS AND PESTICIDES?","The helpline number to complain about dealers selling fake seeds, fertilizers and pesticides is 84373-12288.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THAT CAN WE SOAK THE WHEAT SEED IF SOIL IS LESS MOIST BEFORE SOWING?,"If the humidity in the wheat sowing field is low, soak the wheat seed in water for 4-6 hours, spread it in a thin layer and sow it after 24 hours.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME IMPROVED VARIETIES OF AFRICAN SARSON?,Improved varieties of African mustard - PC-6,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF MOLYA IN WHEAT?,Apply 13 kg Furadan 3 g per acre at the time of wheat sowing to control molya disease in wheat crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER YIELD OF CROP?,Spray 1 kg NPK in 100 liters of water at 13:00:45 per acre after flowering.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BETTER GROWTH OF CROP?,Spray 10 grams of NPK 19 19 19 per liter of water for growth.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE CONTROL OF APHID IN WHEAT?,"If the wheat crop has a high attack of aphids i.e. 5 aphids per shoot, then to prevent it, spray 2 liters of home-made neem solution or 20 grams of Thiamethoxam 25 WG in 100 liters of water per acre.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE BEST TIME OF UREA APPLICATION BEFORE OR AFTER THE IRRIGATION?,Urea can be applied after irrigation in light soils and before irrigation in heavy soils and there should be a gap of 3-4 days between irrigation and urea application.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Cereals,Wheat,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE TIMING OF APPLICATION OF UREA IN WHEAT?,Apply 90 kg urea to wheat crop in 2 equal installments during first and second irrigation and apply recommended amount of urea for 55 days and if enough rain falls to meet the water requirement then after rain Can also add urea,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SEED TREATMENT OF PEA CROP?,"Mix one acre of Rhizobium inoculum in half a liter of water and then mix this solution well with the seeds, shade dry the seeds and sow them in the field on the same day.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME AFTER HOW MUCH TIME WE CAN DO SOWING OF ANY CROP AFTER SPRAY OF GRAMOXONE?,The crop can be sown 2-3 days after gramoxone spraying,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF PEA STEM FLY IN PEA CROP?,Apply 10 kg furadan per acre at sowing time to control the branch fly in pea crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF TERMITE IN PEA CROP?,Apply 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC mixed with 15-20 kg of soil for one acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Peas,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF RUST IN PEA CROP?,Spray 400 grams of M-45 or 200 grams of Sulphex or 80 ml of Kerthene mixed with 200 liters of water for one acre and 4 sprays at 10-day intervals to prevent blight in peas.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME OF SUGARCANE IN AUTUMN SEASON?,Sowing time of sugarcane for autumn season is 20th September to 20th October.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Spices,Sugarcane,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE SEED RATE OF SUGARCANE?,"20,000 seeds with three eyes or 15,000 seeds with four eyes or 12,000 seeds with five eyes are enough to sow one acre of kamad.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DIE BACK IN MANGO?,"Remove dry and diseased shoots from mango, immediately after harvesting spray with Bordeaux mixture (2:2:250) or 2.5 g Blytox per liter.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Mango,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME TREATMENT OF MANGO PLANTS FROM TERMITE ATTACK?,"Check the signs of drying of the mango plant, if the crop is attacked by aphids, spray the stem with 5 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC per liter of water, apply the medicine again after 15 days.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Brinjal,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CONTROL OF TERMITE IN BRINJAL?,"Mix 1 liter of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC with 1 kg of sand, sprinkle diyo per acre or 1 kg of white sandalwood in the trench at the time of watering.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Pulses,Green Gram,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME BETTER FRUITING OF MOONG?,NPK (19-19-19) can be sprayed for growth of mung bean and NPK (13-0-45) for high yield.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING METHOD AND SPACING OF RAPESEED-MUSTARD?,"For planting mustard two crop seeds can be sown with a drill like rye. For mustard row to row distance 45 cm, plant to plant distance 10-15 cm and depth 4-5 cm. please keep","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF MUSTARD?,"Advanced varieties of mustard RH-30, T-59, RH-8113, RB-50, RH 8812, RH 781, RH-819, RH 9304, RH 9801, RH 0406, RB 9901, RH-0749, RH-761","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Oilseeds,Mustard,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME DISEASE CONTROL IN MUSTARD?,Spray Mancozeb 75% WP (Dithen M 45) drug by making a solution of 2 grams per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
