Fruits,Ber,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MEALY BUG CONTROL IN BER CROP?,Spray Profenofas at the rate of 3 ml per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
