Cereals,Maize,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME THE VARIETIES OF MAIZE?,"The types of maize are LL 1373, LL 699, LL 931, suitable time for sowing of maize is from the end of October to the first week of November.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
