Vegetables,Sweet Potato,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SWEET POTATO FERTILIZER DOSES?,Boron - 60 gm + calcium nitrate -60 gm / 15 waves of water spray to sweet potato crop.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Sweet Potato,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME SOWING TIME AND PLANTING METHOD OF SWEET POTATO?,"Cultivation of Sweet Potato Crop :- Season and Interval of Planting : In Maharashtra, sweet potato is cultivated mainly during Kharif and Rabi seasons. Kharif crops are planted in June-July or in April-May where there is water. Rabi season planting is done in the month of October - November. Sweet potato is in high demand especially on fasting days. So yams should be cultivated in such a way that yams will be ready on important fasting days considering the local market. While planting sweet potato, the distance between two rows should be 60 cm and the distance between two rows should be 30 cm. * Cultivation Method: Sweet potato should be planted at a distance of 60 cm. While trimming the underarms of the vermilla, care should be taken that both the eyes at the center are covered with the ground and the two eyes at the ends remain on the ground. Water should be given immediately after planting the cuttings. Generally, cuttings should be planted 3 to 4 months before the expected harvest.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Leafy Vegetable,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME QUEERY ABOUT VARIETIES OF FENUGREEK?,"Methi Varieties - Methi-1, Rajasthan Methi-1. Methi No.47, Prabha, Pusa Early Bunching, Kasuri.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Leafy Vegetable,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CULTIVATION OF CORIANDER?,"For cultivation of coriander, the field should be plowed vertically and horizontally, well pulverized and 3 meter flat steams should be constructed. 8 to 10 kg of well rotted cow dung should be mixed in each steam. Flatten the steam and throw it so that it falls like a seed. The seeds should be covered with soil and watered lightly. In case of heavy weed infestation, seed should be sown in shallow rows of 15 to 20 cm apart with weeds and then covered with soil. Before sowing in summer season, steam should be soaked well. And sow the seeds when the steam comes. 60 to 80 kg seeds are required per hectare for coriander cultivation. Before sowing seeds need to be treated for good germination. Before sowing, split the coriander and separate the seeds by rubbing the coriander with a shoe or a wooden board to separate the seeds. Also, before sowing, coriander seeds should be kept in a warm place in water for 12 hours and then used for planting. This increases the yield of coriander by allowing germination to take place in 8 to 10 days instead of 15 to 20 days and helps in early harvesting.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Leafy Vegetable,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON FENUGREEK?,19:19:19 50 g + micro in 30 ml / 15 liters of water should be sprayed.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Melon,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ABOU VARIETIES OF WATERMELON?,"Kalingad -Variety -Sugarbaby,Arka Manik,Arka Jyoti,Augusta,Sugar King,Badshah,Tejas,Sari Varamba Method - 2 X 0.5m spacing for Kalingada and 1 X 0.5m spacing for Melon 3 to 4 seeds should be planted, thanks .","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Melon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ATTACK OF SUCKING PEST ON MELON?,Spray with sap-sucking insect-Roger 15 ml (Dimethoate)+Blue Copper (Copper Oxychloride 50% WP)-/15 liters of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Melon,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WATER MELON SEEDLINGS?,"98-compartment Pro Tray is used for plant preparation. Cocopit is used in this.- 350 to 400 grams of seed is required per acre. Before planting, apply captan or carbendazim to the seeds at the rate of 2.5 grams per kg of seed. to give","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Jamun,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME CULTIVATION OF JAMUN?,"10 X 10 m planting pits of size 1 X 1 X 1 m should be dug. 100 trees can be planted per hectare. While filling the pit, put mulch at the bottom of it and fill it with 15 to 20 kg of well rotted cow dung + 15-20 kg of poita soil and 1.5 kg of single super phosphate and the remaining part should be filled with a mixture of good soil. In the first year, 1 gram of cow dung, 200 grams of urea, 500 grams of single super phosphate and 100 grams of muriate of potash should be given to the purple plant. This amount of fertilizer should be increased every year. In the fifth year, 5 dung manure 1 kg of urea, 1.5 kg of single super phosphate and 500 g of muriate of potash should be given.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Jamun,Fertilizer Uses,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME FERTILIZER DOSE IN FRUIT CROP?,You should apply Calcibor 30 g / 15 liters of water to the crop,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pearl Millet,Weed Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT IN PEARL MILLET?,"Bajri - Weed killer- 2,4-D should be sprayed 3-4 weeks after sowing of 40 g/15 liters of water.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pearl Millet,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME APPLICATION DOSE FOR PROFENOFOS 40%?,Spray with Profenofos 40% in 30ml/15l of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,Pearl Millet,Varieties,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF BAJRI?,"Bajri Jati - Shraddha Saburi, Peace, Prosperity, Parbhani Sampada, Thanks","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Musk Melon,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME LEAF BLIGHT AND LEAF SPOT MANAGEMENT IN MUSK MELON?,Mulam fruit leaf spot and leaf blight attack: Answer: Mix and spray Mancozeb at the rate of 2 grams per liter of water.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Musk Melon,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME MUSKMELON PLANTING INFORMATION?,"Melon planting is done in the month of January to February. 1.5 to 2 kg of seeds per hectare is enough for melon. 3 g of thiram per kg of seed should be applied before sowing.Sari Varamba Method- For Melon 3 to 4 seeds should be planted at a distance of 1 X 0.5 m. 1 to 1.5 m on both sides in the rain at a distance. 3 to 4 seeds should be sown at a distance. Varieties - Pusa Sharbati, Arka Rajahans, Hara Madhu, Durgapur Madhu.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Musk Melon,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME NUTRIENT MANAGEMENT IN MUSKMELON?,Fertilizer in Melon crop - Boron half kg per acre + Calcium Nitrate - 1 kg/200 liters of water should be applied by drip.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Fruits,Musk Melon,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME VARIETIES OF MUSK MELON?,"Melon Varieties -NS-910, Abhijit, Pusa-Sharbati, Hara Madhu, Nirmal-24, Arka Rajahans, Kundan.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,White Yam,Seeds,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ELEPHANT FOOT YAM SEED TREATMENT?,Mix 4 grams of Trichoderma viridis in one liter of water or Mix 10 grams of Pseudomonas in one liter of water. This should be done before (just before) sowing.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,White Yam,Nutrient Management,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ELEPHANT FOOT YAM BASAL FERTILIZER MANAGEMENT?,10 tons of manure + 70 kg of urea + 150 kg of super phosphate + 66 kg of potash should be applied per acre.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,White Yam,Plant Protection,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ELEPHANT FOOT YAM SEED TREATMENT INFORMATION?,"Senai tuber seed treatment Answer: Mix 100 grams of carpentazim in 100 liters of water for 500 kg of tuber and keep it for 15 minutes, then dry it for 30 minutes and then sow it.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,White Yam,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME ELEPHANT FOOT YAM SEED SELECTION?,"Selection of tuber seeds Ans: As fresh harvested tuber seeds are dormant, 45 to 60 days old tuber should be selected.","[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
Vegetables,White Yam,Cultural Practices,INFORMATION REGARDING/DETAILS ABOUT/TELL ME WEED MANAGEMENT FOR ELEPHANT YAM?,Follow the Hand weeding method.,"[Reference: www.data.gov.in, Kisan Calling Center]"
